₂O是离子化合物，在熔融状态能导电；Fe(OH)₃和胆矾都属于电解质，②正确。\n③SO₃、SO₂属于酸性氧化物，NO属于不成盐氧化物，③错误。\n④C₇₀、金刚石和石墨都是碳元素形成的不同单质，互为同素异形体，④正确。\n⑤干冰（CO₂）和乙醇属于非电解质；液氯是氯气单质，既不是电解质也不是非电解质，⑤错误。\n故②④正确，选B。","expected_stem":"下列各组物质的分类正确的是\n①混合物：纯牛奶、冰水混合物、水煤气；\n②电解质：氧化钠、氢氧化铁、胆矾；\n③酸性氧化物：\n3\nSO 、\n2\nSO 、NO；\n④同素异形体：\n70\nC 、金刚石、石墨；\n⑤非电解质：干冰、液氯、乙醇\nA．①②④\nB．②④\nC．①②③\nD．②④⑤","expected_options":["①②④","②④","①②③","②④⑤"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"0c5a30dfc916fc61967efc65c5474e1c716b309d1a829df13ebddc284aee5bcc","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"COMBINATION","required_markers":["①","②","③","④","⑤"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/b12a495c1c127c1d/3903d32268a88147135426c1443c0d73/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题题面","sha256":"6d0ac5044b02424fa315f637b88063cce87c51bcff447cd3df7d191cf2b158a1","width":1055,"height":305},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h1orig/b12a495c1c127c1d/3903d32268a88147135426c1443c0d73/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题解析","sha256":"6de9a136b8b9fada2a0bc0b43c9102ae6ea2ea4ecb7bc3d7c62c231182c468a8","width":1055,"height":388}],"question_asset_sha256":"6d0ac5044b02424fa315f637b88063cce87c51bcff447cd3df7d191cf2b158a1","analysis_asset_sha256":"6de9a136b8b9fada2a0bc0b43c9102ae6ea2ea4ecb7bc3d7c62c231182c468a8","expected_revision_token":"94a832c3e93aa7682357b5d0b13f23441d573b764869faaf777c88a3967ab302","expected_item_sha256":"809e6c723bf079ab2fc77dd8168e2136c759dc06ef4d54178b414954c9c6ff0f","source_pdf_sha256":"b7b2373aeb41b8561da324156f70c8a0522169c06970f93d298f5b21fe8590d8","question_png_sha256":"025ea37262beeba539083d23b1da08472dd007b22f57adecc053336cc1b1cf57","analysis_png_sha256":"44b2c36ad7464eb376346c6c047858e233cbef5b134cbc2652dfb34e29fa39b9"},{"source_manifest_id":"H1_CLASSIFY-4d226212640454b7","canonical_source_id":"--:H1_CLASSIFY-4d226212640454b7","grade_band":"高一","skill_id":"H1_CLASSIFY","old_question_id":"QH1O_68CF80AD52FE9F27_6A541C77DE7AD220_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH1O_68CF80AD52FE9F27_AD347ACFB114DCE7_R245BE48B2999"