及反应的分类如图所示，\n甲\n乙\n\n丙\n丁\n由图判断下列说法中错误的是\nA．用甲图的树状分类法可将单质分为金属单质、非金属单质和稀有气体\nB．乙图所示的分类方法属于交叉分类法，\n2\n3\nNa CO 既属于钠盐又属于正盐\nC．丙图碱性氧化物一定是金属氧化物，酸性氧化物一定是非金属氧化物\nD．丁图四大基本反应不能包括所有的化学反应，例如高炉炼铁反应","expected_options":["用甲图的树状分类法可将单质分为金属单质、非金属单质和稀有气体","乙图所示的分类方法属于交叉分类法， 2 3 Na CO 既属于钠盐又属于正盐","丙图碱性氧化物一定是金属氧化物，酸性氧化物一定是非金属氧化物","丁图四大基本反应不能包括所有的化学反应，例如高炉炼铁反应"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"b8142ca0d2e3d89cf1345cd5cc6172fc0dc4b6c0b93280dfeee30fcdd2343bcd","audit_status":"PASS","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/7d3fa05f554f9fd9/b5108abf09f10d2edd7d7087afdd66b2/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题题面","sha256":"97ba2c4b5c2a90812787adde8f351d22c3ecf48eafdb27d2832d297218fcd3d6","width":1055,"height":555},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h1orig/7d3fa05f554f9fd9/b5108abf09f10d2edd7d7087afdd66b2/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题解析","sha256":"c7513fe72a65e10e4a273d7356daad901e9af6b99337d358ed5e869da813f982","width":1055,"height":768}],"question_asset_sha256":"97ba2c4b5c2a90812787adde8f351d22c3ecf48eafdb27d2832d297218fcd3d6","analysis_asset_sha256":"c7513fe72a65e10e4a273d7356daad901e9af6b99337d358ed5e869da813f982","expected_revision_token":"73b80d082404cdd1a87a4f1f1a60911f2de9396c6d1fd2bd903caf1cd7542301","expected_item_sha256":"26229b04fb90adfdab8ceb1faa83bbe0bba19784323a874e9937d0c350596bb9","source_pdf_sha256":"b7b2373aeb41b8561da324156f70c8a0522169c06970f93d298f5b21fe8590d8","question_png_sha256":"7f0306f9157a38f4feb9364293d7b292d3a85e48b88f506d74d80743379759b6","analysis_png_sha256":"17b17e28ebc423a00eba8e571909cdcc451654fcc847011888feaeb6d0f8e3c3"},{"source_manifest_id":"H1_CLASSIFY-d1f4cc8b19c27f9e","canonical_source_id":"--:H1_CLASSIFY-d1f4cc8b19c27f9e","grade_band":"高一","skill_id":"H1_CLASSIFY","old_question_id":"QH1O_827E3C18E36DFDBC_2335C80E00B66CB7_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH1O_827E3C18E36DFDBC_7C4244141ABC4B38_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"339c6ceb5d12954800135b596d9eb8c26fad76ca8b2fceb527259b1816b9a628","expected_explanation_sha256":"339c6ceb5d12954800135b596d9eb8c26fad76ca8b2fceb527259b1816b9a628","expected_explanation":"A．CO₂在水中不能自身电离；其水溶液导电是因为CO₂与水反应生成的H₂CO₃发生电离，因此CO₂属于非电解质，A正确。\nB．CuO能与酸反应生成盐和水，属于碱性氧化物，B正确。\nC．Cu₂(OH)₂CO₃属于碱式盐，不属于碱，C错误。\nD．H₂O能发生极弱的电离，属于弱电解质，因此也是电解质，D正确。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"三星堆出土的青铜面具，表面有一层“铜绿”[Cu2(OH)2CO3]，其受热分解生成CuO、H2O 和CO2。下\n列有关说法错误的是\nA．CO2属于非电解质\nB．CuO 属于碱性氧化物\nC．Cu2(OH)2CO3属于碱\nD．H2O 属于电解质","expected_options":["CO2属于非电解质","CuO 属于碱性氧化物","Cu2(OH)2CO3属于碱","H2O 属于电解质"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"824771fde88faaed83cb31c3aa8b0bed34c9f03941339338da58d1c929f78e78","audit_status":"PASS","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/827e3c18e36dfdbc/8089b4edd64b40c9b4a477af8d633dc7/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题三星堆出土的青铜面具，表面有一层“铜绿”[Cu2原题题面","sha256":"d218bb8e49a56958a81a8e4af21d429b6bcca804e62499f03a04198a0eb145e0","width":1055,"height":181},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h1orig/827e3c18e36dfdbc/8089b4edd64b40c9b4a477af8d633dc7/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题三星堆出土的青铜面具，表面有一层“铜绿”[Cu2原题解析","sha256":"55a0a533126d90cc3d3f38039ca25ff3eec9d037d1255d80f1a26b661e0e3a4f","width":1055,"height":470}],"question_asset_sha256":"d218bb8e49a56958a81a8e4af21d429b6bcca804e62499f03a04198a0eb145e0","analysis_asset_sha256":"55a0a533126d90cc3d3f38039ca25ff3eec9d037d1255d80f1a26b661e0e3a4f","expected_revision_token":"379bcef56be51a44a5ccfc75eb8033036e323730b7d228e352294f702c80303c","expected_item_sha256":"28b06ac56dfd0b9f34da61cd1afc7666d2e4113e4c366ec50197680948097d76","source_pdf_sha256":"b7b2373aeb41b8561da324156f70c8a0522169c06970f93d298f5b21fe8590d8","question_png_sha256":"8775ae6f27ef3fb0dbf824c2de13aec5fa4e2d990199c0235df82611144259e1","analysis_png_sha256":"87ad69ba62d659c64bad6cf60ee804012d2f602a27f63c15a0ff5238041f0da5"},{"source_manifest_id":"H1_CLASSIFY-d4444004e516b6d9","canonical_source_i