:1:2\nD．抽走隔板后，所得混合气体的平均摩尔质量为56g/mol","expected_options":["物质的量： ( ) 2 (X): CO : (Y) 1: 2:1 n n n","密度： (X) : (Y) 1:1","摩尔质量： ( ) 2 M(X): M CO : M(Y) 2:1: 2","抽走隔板后，所得混合气体的平均摩尔质量为56g/mol"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"ec1a99655afd42e39a270eed104e303ffc2cb50f75cf8faeff79b35439bbda2e","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/b5103d89760d73e6/0f8b6b86372641ae2616594ed83c804b/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题题面","sha256":"4c6cd5df51bff83ef33e4854ad87bb55f6fd451e7284bac6219cfad72e5a2497","width":1055,"height":415},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h1orig/b5103d89760d73e6/0f8b6b86372641ae2616594ed83c804b/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题解析","sha256":"a73d7aecbdd7de97cd44f805bd5ae3d758fc71af8a0f386f4abb88415858275a","width":1055,"height":447}],"question_asset_sha256":"4c6cd5df51bff83ef33e4854ad87bb55f6fd451e7284bac6219cfad72e5a2497","analysis_asset_sha256":"a73d7aecbdd7de97cd44f805bd5ae3d758fc71af8a0f386f4abb88415858275a","expected_revision_token":"d547d67b016f94fc0b630643338dc8c470555aa370ebf5878d7b0f8631afeb59","expected_item_sha256":"9896caf4946f88580c49a300936fe5c9e07347263b1232be2fa5e6bb596f51c8","source_pdf_sha256":"62cc58ca8ad0c723af3f33d6cc62489ba4102c822062b5abda1f3c812ea91a6c","question_png_sha256":"3835d3c22954824292fe0c816bd763c712e37f3a0a9fd227014936b76b6db30e","analysis_png_sha256":"b96a1508018a3e657556dde8caf50cb8dde21f56fd1cee645b74a88367ed526a"},{"source_manifest_id":"H1_GAS_MOLAR_VOLUME-1a1d03f2b9b4468f","canonical_source_id":"--:H1_GAS_MOLAR_VOLUME-1a1d03f2b9b4468f","grade_band":"高一","skill_id":"H1_GAS_MOLAR_VOLUME","old_question_id":"QH1O_5E9D06B7969B3D52_B197727B7A7FE0F0_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH1O_5E9D06B7969B3D52_A51C99A649F64B70_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"190d842fa6be7d408dda024bad5c8fd7dc1dda273ee97752931028b3b546d778","expected_explanation_sha256":"ee23ad424701e7a5d91efba4e8e34b28ce