积时，气体的物质的量越大，分子数越多，气体压强越大，⑤正确。\n故②⑤正确，选B。","expected_stem":"下列叙述中正确的是\n①标准状况下，1LHCl 和1LH2O 的物质的量相同\n②标准状况下，1gH2 和14gN2的体积相同\n③28gCO 的体积为22.4L\n④两种物质的物质的量相同，则它们在标准状况下的体积也相同\n⑤同温、同体积时，气体的物质的量越大，压强越大\nA．①③④\nB．②⑤\nC．④⑤\nD．①⑤","expected_options":["①③④","②⑤","④⑤","①⑤"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"cbf47474a443d4fce1cfc75b9dcae2b4310c9ca5b52ccd99bafe1c3fbcf7b24c","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"COMBINATION","required_markers":["①","②","③","④","⑤"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/eb70ffaa476f4c5f/539f2cb96c32f388e333e122855f2c38/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题6原题题面","sha256":"bd83e56237bff45348a88230df14118f2febfe6c5011c53081818d546a7dd0c9","width":1055,"height":302},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h1orig/eb70ffaa476f4c5f/539f2cb96c32f388e333e122855f2c38/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题6原题解析","sha256":"553a740025264759969b4f151eb3f328d3c2b2e41a734923a0423d6899b5e390","width":1055,"height":1077}],"question_asset_sha256":"bd83e56237bff45348a88230df14118f2febfe6c5011c53081818d546a7dd0c9","analysis_asset_sha256":"553a740025264759969b4f151eb3f328d3c2b2e41a734923a0423d6899b5e390","expected_revision_token":"68cc0c5fe1a9f43819310879e07671e998351607c624c45a80c787b14aa74905","expected_item_sha256":"084de4ffef18192b0c587d1bfd1f30f93ea1910df591604c17686d34935a9888","source_pdf_sha256":"62cc58ca8ad0c723af3f33d6cc62489ba4102c822062b5abda1f3c812ea91a6c","question_png_sha256":"6e4a68ae683c035e71038b9689f0192d6bf74d4cfe74b9959792fcc73ae05fc2","analysis_png_sha256":"e85176efe81ec0f962167053caac637967df5dd98cce438b3a681751d0462354"},{"source_manifest_id":"H1_GAS_MOLAR_VOLUME-65e5f8f17cc3f747","canonical_source_id":"--:H1_GAS_MOLAR_VOLUME-65e5f8f17cc3f747","grade_band":"高一","skill_id":"H1_GAS_MOLAR_VOLUME","old_question_id":"QH1O_0C8C6EBD1EC6CF5A_C186E75B642CD994_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH1O_0C8C6EBD1EC6CF5A_6EE2B54882D26335_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"b00ba822346d00476c9e1b265468889328ab91b560cb4beedc1832e01241026f","expected_explanation_sha256":"52de7ef53cf00f861234ecbd0872b4681df023e4f35919e2bce6b05b8b21f6fb","expected_explanation":"A．在一定温度和压强下，气体分子间的平均距离一定，不是此时决定气体体积大小的主要因素，A错误。\nB．气体分子间的距离远大于分子本身的大小，分子大小对气体体积的影响可以忽略，B错误。\nC．在一定温度和压强下，气体体积主要取决于分子数目的多少，分子数越多，体积越大，C正确。\nD．分子的相对分子质量与气体体积没有直接关系，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"在一定温度和压强下，气体体积主要取决于\nA．分子间的平均距离\nB．分子微粒大小\nC．分子数目的多少\nD．分子式量的大小","expected_options":["分子间的平均距离","分子微粒大小","分子数目的多少","分子式量的大小"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"7c9a11bf330d3b93499efb409c67662aae702ab94902cc599bf4039af9d89cfc","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/0c8c6ebd1ec6cf5a/617e427ed2f644489c9060262f95cae1/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题在一定温度和压强下，气体体积主要取决于原题题面","sha256":"9b3d04d6ad99251c96d5125156443d77816cd0d342a7c11eaf471b83ee91ae9c","width":1055,"height":135},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h1orig/0c8c6ebd1ec6cf5a/617e427ed2f644489c9060262f95cae1/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题在一定温度和压强下，气体体积主要取决于原题解析","sha256":"daef530093ad08c5804812edc99d6bd6a2ffa7fb14f2e4e872a378268c8dedef","width":1055,"height":433}],"question_asset_sha256":"9b3d04d6ad99251c96d5125156443d77816cd0d342a7c11eaf471b83ee91ae9c","analysis_asset_sha256":"daef530093ad08c5804812edc99d6bd6a2ffa7fb14f2e4e872a378268c8dedef","expected_revision_token":"09ac7e12db6cd9d43d906403a8638b701a2e706c178540e69627efaae7905c99","expected_item_sha256":"151363160cb712924a6b89e64693c2edbffd575fb7fcbf9f51df280aba43082c","source_pdf_sha256":"62cc58ca8ad0c723af3f33d6cc62489ba4102c822062b5abda1f3c812ea91a6c","question_png_sha256":"16cb2c1b2cdbee833b9d0143b6e6b7fccebd330dc02a02ec10203179c9c86a03","analysis_png_sha256":"11980f331e19779bcd887f388f247717f7e4d13f1627f1a93c4481afeadf4614"},{"source_manifest_id":"H1_GAS_MOLAR_VOLUME-66b7e59c04a92ba0","canonical_source_id":"--:H1_GAS_MOLAR_VOLUME-66b7e59c04a92ba0","grade_band":"高一","skill_id":"H1_GAS_MOLAR_VOLUME","old_question_id":"QH1O_2A704FAB34077960_63A49CC51B7C683D_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH1O_2A704FAB34077960_D3CDF115BBB55475_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"22a77dcfe094c4651d37d2fa9bb80ecdeafd430615ed20ab29a0c6c1366600d2","expected_explanation_sha256":"a745060fa70721a09c9f550f1c5802a2a76a1c5633d00cebf4ab531c34e54f71","expected_explanation":"A．三个气球温度、压强和体积都相同，所含气体的物质的量和分子数相同，A正确。\nB．分子数相同，气体的物质的量也相同，B正确。\nC．相同温度和压强下，气体分子间的平均距离可看作相同，C正确。\nD．三组气体按体积比1∶1混合，平均摩尔质量分别为：①(2+4)÷2=3 g·mol⁻¹，②(71+32)÷2=51.5 g·mol⁻¹，③(44+64)÷2=54 g·mol⁻¹。①小于空气的平均摩尔质量，会上升；②、③都大于空气的平均摩尔质量，会下沉。因此有两个气球下沉，不是只有一个，D错误。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"常温常压下，分别向三个气球(同一规格，忽略气球自身的重量)中充入两种按体积比1：1 混合的气\n体，得到体积相等的①、②、③三个气球(如图)。下列判断不正确的是\nA．三个气球中所含气体的分子数相等\nB．三个气球中所含气体的物质的量相等\nC．三个气球中气体分子间的平均距离相等\nD．将三个气球放在空气中，只有一个往下沉","expected_options":["三个气球中所含气体的分子数相等","三个气球中所含气体的物质的量相等","三个气球中气体分子间的平均距离相等","将三个气球放在空气中，只有一个往下沉"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"8bc4607a911addd37f853493a86ed9b55da381917bf46d3cca7055ffa40841b2","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/2a704fab34077960/7b93991848a71064c4ebbf8f6481e80c/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题常温常压下，分别向三个气球(同一规格，忽略气球自原题题面","sha256":"fb18a38e11d6fd161565fd7d797da26dbb2f244639f758f7f2bc887a81a536ef","width":1055,"height":377},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h1orig/2a704fab34077960/7b93991848a71064c4ebbf8f6481e80c/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题常温常压下，分别向三个气球(同一规格，忽略气球自原题解析","sha256":"4c5c90fde8ca7fb12ff2ff531378996b4bc9cc2334d9a0978315918c8c187536","width":1055,"height":1796}],"question_asset_sha256":"fb18a38e11d6fd161565fd7d797da26dbb2f244639f758f7f2bc887a81a536ef","analysis_asset_sha256":"4c5c90fde8ca7fb12ff2ff531378996b4bc9cc2334d9a0978315918c8c187536","expected_revision_token":"2d64ed88ade648ecef9bc4a7cd9a0428a3cb3b99711bf05479abfc117dc5d83a","expected_item_sha256":"e6fd9a54c919e6c1b480140660282f092b21bb2b163a1ab62f849e201b9b0dca","source_p