质的量相等，每个CO分子含1个氧原子，每个CO₂分子含2个氧原子，氧原子数之比为1∶2，不是1∶1，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"同温同压下，相同体积的CO 和CO2相比较，下列说法正确的是\nA．分子个数之比为2：3\nB．密度之比为11：7\nC．质量之比为7：11\nD．所含氧原子个数比为1：1","expected_options":["分子个数之比为2：3","密度之比为11：7","质量之比为7：11","所含氧原子个数比为1：1"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"89039379b0697bfd259b2b4b9f7652ccf117d9b39fad4039c78b9241a42565af","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/48eb3250c7a21eb8/49fcd0bd64fc632aa770618d12a9be39/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题题面","sha256":"6a2a1fd61cf74b991ed8f6320dade0bd0a33e27ebf6004cf9251540fb6480881","width":1055,"height":131},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h1orig/48eb3250c7a21eb8/49fcd0bd64fc632aa770618d12a9be39/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题解析","sha256":"97de19b59162eab7d6560aca9b9037dd7c0d4009535917fc0dd667288b0b170e","width":1055,"height":343}],"question_asset_sha256":"6a2a1fd61cf74b991ed8f6320dade0bd0a33e27ebf6004cf9251540fb6480881","analysis_asset_sha256":"97de19b59162eab7d6560aca9b9037dd7c0d4009535917fc0dd667288b0b170e","expected_revision_token":"f4092ec13714e3ac58469d6223167f9d1cfcd9ef01896258397483aa2ff4b142","expected_item_sha256":"68715f4f6e72cbaf9d326b868e373036bdaf9ea9d19b583bc0e63f46d142e566","source_pdf_sha256":"62cc58ca8ad0c723af3f33d6cc62489ba4102c822062b5abda1f3c812ea91a6c","question_png_sha256":"a9178203221e14f1f1fae98fe69440a8e07a9d60b530894cab7ba72fae938d1c","analysis_png_sha256":"852fb78dc53d1e7aec52f18312e324e29cf0048a34a4ea8b8989439e413e3608"},{"source_manifest_id":"H1_GAS_MOLAR_VOLUME-89a5a5e101b15337","canonical_source_id":"--:H1_GAS_MOLAR_VOLUME-89a5a5e101b15337","grade_band":"高一","skill_id":"H1_GAS_MOLAR_VOLUME","old_question_id":"QH1O_92D87C5E734A33F3_62B36806C8DEEBAE_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH1O_92D87C5E734A33F3_662D83848222481D_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"3fe337bd3b78a724069bfcba204f2d6807fb34d83e4c669c59d3f7cedd4715ff","expected_explanation_sha256":"2edf6a2da8977d8b9d21758400767be3bd2a14516fea4cb86c71e6bbd8647601","expected_explanation":"A．1 mol H₂的质量由m=nM计算，等于2 g；质量只由物质的量和摩尔质量决定，与温度、压强无关，A错误。\nB．标准状况下只有气体才能用V_m≈22.4 L·mol⁻¹换算；“某物质”还可能是标准状况下非气态的H₂O、SO₃等，B错误。\nC．气体体积由温度、压强和物质的量共同决定；20 ℃时压强未知，1 mol气体的体积不一定大于22.4 L，C错误。\nD．气体摩尔体积适用于不发生反应的混合气体，标准状况下1 mol H₂和O₂的混合气体体积约为22.4 L，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"下列叙述中，正确的是\nA．1 mol H2的质量只有在标准状况下才约为2 g\nB．在标准状况下，某物质的体积是22.4 L，则可认为该物质的物质的量约是1 mol\nC．在20℃时，1 mol 任何气体的体积总比22.4 L 大\nD．1 mol H2和O2的混合气体，在标准状况下的体积约为22.4 L","expected_options":["1 mol H2的质量只有在标准状况下才约为2 g","在标准状况下，某物质的体积是22.4 L，则可认为该物质的物质的量约是1 mol","在20℃时，1 mol 任何气体的体积总比22.4 L 大","1 mol H2和O2的混合气体，在标准状况下的体积约为22.4 L"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"c8f8cbb084913f328f34d9bc712e6df025aac0bc9e50e4d229a11aa9b7ca4440","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/92d87c5e734a33f3/ac644f1f84edf8bd754691b96a99bf15/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题▌对点练2-2原题题面","sha256":"70327f8877c4a89a824d6e39f2064570ec3e61c87b3a7d647bea442d5a86d1f5","width":1055,"height":226},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h1orig/92d87c5e734a33f3/ac644f1f84edf8bd754691b96a99bf15/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题▌对点练2-2原题解析","sha256":"fdc27717f1647c7509f96c48a2fc1d8be23ca8006f271cb5bed621eb3db22889","width":1055,"height":604}],"question_asset_sha256":"70327f8877c4a89a824d6e39f2064570ec3e61c87b3a7d647bea442d5a86d1f5","analysis_asset_sha256":"fdc27717f1647c7509f96c48a2fc1d8be23ca8006f271cb5bed621eb3db22889","expected_revision_token":"81ca60624352377a1f4d5d9c14c167bc6e9fb442c74443cddc301504351568c8","expected_item_sha256":"c17112b22fc05e9e2849765cfb4a177c19154403f461b94f92838b8eb4a539b6","source_pdf_sha256":"62cc58ca8ad0c723af3f33d6cc62489ba4102c822062b5abda1f3c812ea91a6c","question_png_sha256":"851796585211066605988471617ceb01503dc49d7095ca4a827416e91ae759a5","analysis_png_sha256":"2933299854d412e287a6cbba774eebf1c40745f971575ed29c8531