19cefa373520397a126b69cac81cb7cd0940895a6cb7baa144fa773870f","expected_explanation":"A．Na、Mg位于同一周期，越向右金属性越弱，所以金属性Na＞Mg，可用元素周期律解释，A不符合题意。\nB．O、S位于同一主族，越向下非金属性越弱，所以非金属性O＞S，可用元素周期律解释，B不符合题意。\nC．金属性Na＞Mg，最高价氧化物对应水化物的碱性NaOH＞Mg(OH)₂，可用元素周期律解释，C不符合题意。\nD．HCl不是Cl的最高价氧化物对应的水化物，不能用“最高价氧化物对应水化物的酸性”这一周期律判断HCl与H₂SiO₃的酸性强弱，D符合题意。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"下列有关性质的比较中，不能用元素周期律解释的是（\n）\nA.金属性：Na>Mg\nB.非金属性：O>S\nC.碱性：NaOH>Mg（OH）2\nD.酸性：HCl>H2SiO3","expected_options":["金属性：Na>Mg","非金属性：O>S","碱性：NaOH>Mg（OH）2","酸性：HCl>H2SiO3"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"2da7eeae6e236cd07c32a94fc9d3c67270cdb2a6ed24f389884e92d588589594","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/76f53dd18f2e81ef/bca913a09433c09596d00202c1bfe915/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题题面","sha256":"2b188737a4e18b05b73b8f9af15930a75319f7dac53a7e80a878685c6b71497a","width":1055,"height":240},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h1orig/76f53dd18f2e81ef/bca913a09433c09596d00202c1bfe915/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题解析","sha256":"2631d77f4a86e77de8604d7258ddd5c876aae0a51ba7005418f9f53a6162587b","width":1055,"height":334}],"question_asset_sha256":"2b188737a4e18b05b73b8f9af15930a75319f7dac53a7e80a878685c6b71497a","analysis_asset_sha256":"2631d77f4a86e77de8604d7258ddd5c876aae0a51ba7005418f9f53a6162587b","expected_revision_token":"a558f351660ec51ebea3cb52979c393bf1c9f8f4ca139048cb27f734f4a6d6d4","expected_item_sha256":"a133d3b6e2184ddbe2eda23388170a09d232f6b93d5e336aee769318a9bdc912","source_pdf_sha256":"b17f7ef5acdfa12784cb49573fbc49da61598659305bec836a1d488895c73a15","question_png_sha256":"732138e7c145d97123375d091a1095c7219388e2db7e04c7af43422d670e9bda","analysis_png_sha256":"4a828aa2007161c51ba27ec89ffa10501cc9ceaecac9578415ceb2980d160adf"},{"source_manifest_id":"H1_PERIODIC-1628d07dd61fe57f","canonical_source_id":"--:H1_PERIODIC-1628d07dd61fe57f","grade_band":"高一","skill_id":"H1_PERIODIC","old_question_id":"QH1O_B1F8C