,"expected_explanation_sha256":"ce0f96ecb1c1db6ec5b81f1ca455541b8bc4640a2578688e8cee800bf642aa67","expected_explanation":"A．第三周期主族元素的原子半径总体从左到右减小，所以r(Na)＞r(Mg)＞r(Al)＞r(S)，题给顺序相反，A错误。\nB．同主族元素自上而下电子层数增加，原子半径增大，所以r(I)＞r(Br)＞r(Cl)＞r(F)，题给顺序相反，B错误。\nC．O²⁻、Na⁺、Mg²⁺、Al³⁺的核外电子排布相同，核电荷数越大半径越小，所以r(O²⁻)＞r(Na⁺)＞r(Mg²⁺)＞r(Al³⁺)，题给顺序错误，C错误。\nD．S²⁻、Cl⁻有3个电子层，Na⁺、Al³⁺有2个电子层；同电子层结构的微粒核电荷数越大半径越小，所以r(S²⁻)＞r(Cl⁻)＞r(Na⁺)＞r(Al³⁺)，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"下列微粒半径大小比较正确的是(\n)\nA．Na<Mg<Al<S\nB．I<Br<Cl<F\nC．Na+<Mg2+<Al3+<O2-\nD．S2->Cl->Na+>Al3+","expected_options":["Na<Mg<Al<S","I<Br<Cl<F","Na+<Mg2+<Al3+<O2-","S2->Cl->Na+>Al3+"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"f813ce7e3738d3a26e47336fcf78f859befa7a4d595e9f47a61b56a02a132aae","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/c12dc1fa707f963a/0c362f9380bb12487fe415d016203a82/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题【典例2】下列微粒半径大小比较正确的是(原题题面","sha256":"9ba99cc54ca488d60ae13d12290f6dd09072e29d6f83366ee856dc183b3b2bb8","width":1055,"height":94},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h1orig/c12dc1fa707f963a/0c362f9380bb12487fe415d016203a82/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题【典例2】下列微粒半径大小比较正确的是(原题解析","sha256":"a75b69bf1a20186bcfc91051093d93bdc9563ef0a705e78cf62b57bc86cb7533","width":1055,"height":5479}],"question_asset_sha256":"9ba99cc54ca488d60ae13d12290f6dd09072e29d6f83366ee856dc183b3b2bb8","analysis_asset_sha256":"a75b69bf1a20186bcfc91051093d93bdc9563ef0a705e78cf62b57bc86cb7533","expected_revision_token":"c3603edebd814eff488ccfc789c4b4cac138310ab4790cbd5ccee494401757f6","expected_item_sha256":"513f1adf9296239b6163e6351a43be8344116ae59ff79fb30e3044905970a3c2","source_pdf_sha256":"58daff7df4f3793bf5d6d64385aa29aeca03a79e98eb49cb8fdd182e37e557d4","question_png_sha256":"32d6810d91e9c6e5ae27a1b044b8c75e063fb3044f40563e1810077287e70722","analysis_png_sha256":"fa546b21807018ff37c6e987321bffb8ad01718e67f15cd5b62588826ffdc43d"},{"source_manifest_id":"H1_PERIODIC-79f