fb9093fc797f3af70b25d647f3c9e8f","analysis_png_sha256":"db78f6fca7bdd0b3ea9499d3ea965483b2d3936e8d2522678284be05a6b876d8"},{"source_manifest_id":"H1_REDOX-15361085db516b54","canonical_source_id":"--:H1_REDOX-15361085db516b54","grade_band":"高一","skill_id":"H1_REDOX","old_question_id":"QH1O_A4CC894290626F3B_2528961A5477E5A7_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH1O_A4CC894290626F3B_E4C6299DC21AEF49_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":1,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"d3b157b6bacc51be278209d14fe804a99016ca4211a4ad97fe3f5d095d30d783","expected_explanation_sha256":"9b53342fdcc0027bc7443e287ec2b5f8adc78cebf81ab3707c9fde77d3875771","expected_explanation":"A．反应①中SO₂里的S由＋4价升为SO₄²⁻中的＋6价，SO₂失电子，发生氧化反应，A错误。\nB．反应①中Fe³⁺作氧化剂，得氧化性Fe³⁺＞SO₂；反应②中Cr₂O₇²⁻作氧化剂，得氧化性Cr₂O₇²⁻＞Fe³⁺，所以Cr₂O₇²⁻＞Fe³⁺＞SO₂，B正确。\nC．1 mol K₂Cr₂O₇中2 mol Cr由＋6价降为＋3价，共转移6 mol电子，电子数为6N_A，不是3N_A，C错误。\nD．标准状况下6.72 L SO₂为0.3 mol。由①得0.6 mol Fe²⁺，再由②知6 mol Fe²⁺消耗1 mol Cr₂O₇²⁻，所以消耗0.1 mol K₂Cr₂O₇，不是0.2 mol，D错误。\n故选B。","expected_stem":"SO2 气体与足量Fe2(SO4)3 溶液完全反应后，再加入K2Cr2O7 溶\n液，发生如下两个化学反应：①SO2＋2Fe3＋＋2H2O===SO2－\n4 ＋2Fe2＋＋4H\n＋；\n②Cr2O2－\n7 ＋6Fe2＋＋14H\n＋===2Cr3＋＋6Fe3＋＋7H2O。下列有关说法正确的是(\n)\nA.SO2 发生还原反应\nB.氧化性：Cr2O2－\n7 >Fe3＋>SO2\nC.每1 mol K2Cr2O7 参加反应，转移电子的数目为3NA\nD.标准状况，6.72 L SO2 参加反应，则最终消耗0.2 mol K2Cr2O7","expected_options":["SO2 发生还原反应","氧化性：Cr2O2－ 7 >Fe3＋>SO2","每1 mol K2Cr2O7 参加反应，转移电子的数目为3NA","标准状况，6.72 L SO2 参加反应，则最终消耗0.2 mol K2Cr2O7"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"ace8b3e2d9d5b445e5649908f28c7d13fd9e0b3f3c9d301bde4199832dc1b797","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/a4cc894290626f3b/581b2786bd058b8ce37abbf4fb80201e/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题8原题题面","sha256":"b41aa9864a3a4cd20743f7ad6b24f364f888ed5b024f4ace9c93c59476744696","width":1055,"height":334},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h1orig/a4cc894290626f3b/581b2786bd058b8ce37abbf4fb80201e/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题8原题解析","sha256":"79b9b0a97060f370eeb29