c0e4446806bf9a003eb996c5c1310d91b101f9aafef0","expected_explanation":"A．H2SO4＋Na2SO3===Na2SO4＋SO2↑＋H2O 中无化合价的变化，不属于氧\n化还原反应，所以该反应中无氧化剂，故A 错误；\nB．Na2SO3 不稳定，容易被空气\n中的O2 氧化成硫酸钠变质，故B 正确；\nC．Na2SO4 含有阴阳离子，存在离子键，\n硫酸根中含有共价键，故C 正确；\nD．SO2 在空气中会转化成硫酸，形成酸雨，所\n以二氧化硫是导致酸雨的主要有害污染物，故D 正确。","expected_stem":"关于反应H2SO4＋Na2SO3===Na2SO4＋SO2↑＋H2O 所涉及的物质，\n下列说法错误的是(\n)\nA.H2SO4 在该反应中为氧化剂\nB.Na2SO3 容易被空气中的O2 氧化变质\nC.Na2SO4 是含有共价键的离子化合物\nD.SO2 是导致酸雨的主要有害污染物","expected_options":["H2SO4 在该反应中为氧化剂","Na2SO3 容易被空气中的O2 氧化变质","Na2SO4 是含有共价键的离子化合物","SO2 是导致酸雨的主要有害污染物"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"51da9cd7d537588a671a9d2430e363ffdc45c6be59e07c06186c3f4bc8c604ce","audit_status":"PASS","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/e7a999d826cf87db/dde3a28084ccc5d6d2ce1dbe1835e2dd/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题题面","sha256":"e7d23436490e92553c03c31be79a9cbe8b7210310d03a1cb63dd9870350970b7","width":1055,"height":287},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h1orig/e7a999d826cf87db/dde3a28084ccc5d6d2ce1dbe1835e2dd/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题解析","sha256":"0f031fc1ef544218a70dfabd26c745c03410658af352567776940aed84220fc1","width":1055,"height":287}],"question_asset_sha256":"e7d23436490e92553c03c31be79a9cbe8b7210310d03a1cb63dd9870350970b7","analysis_asset_sha256":"0f031fc1ef544218a70dfabd26c745c03410658af352567776940aed84220fc1","expected_revision_token":"804e0321c7f47b11cc8c42e2a43984b664c47d047d46d7f6af3a92789d553379","expected_item_sha256":"58bd25fd8b2fc37332f6c087fbc5fa34af81d73ddbe2c64911359bb7b36966af","source_pdf_sha256":"d80bf387d5b5b4be63c8faa214afde3f0a71af9cf1fa4c1f314b3297997ce7f9","question_png_sha256":"158aa8ebe860a541b884b4169d0c4c71e36e0f780104b7fcf559dbe96fd037a3","analysis_png_sha256":"d707afa3ffbdc9e8021c1c2a65b2c9f7083b2719c7cc209bead62752a2aada60"},{"source_manifest_id":"H1_REDOX-5d459052c0af9835","canonical_source_id":"--:H1_REDOX-5d459052c0af9835","grade_band":"高一","skill_id":"H1_REDOX","