on_png_sha256":"bfe3bc0be8b99babab97ad75b32aad890f3930e7c8c09da4e6379e2a3b0bbff6","analysis_png_sha256":"cd446c34e3f5991aed202b18d9a27f994d1af2a37580cc10ea211e2022086140"},{"source_manifest_id":"H1_REDOX-823e63f4c62c1b2c","canonical_source_id":"--:H1_REDOX-823e63f4c62c1b2c","grade_band":"高一","skill_id":"H1_REDOX","old_question_id":"QH1O_7CD069630635B2FF_3CA2B8B2176AE332_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH1O_7CD069630635B2FF_F0D317A4A26776F5_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":1,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"5aec60944103e9692835d6ecc9c922587f339615f7b30e656efea1f656bba55a","expected_explanation_sha256":"5aec60944103e9692835d6ecc9c922587f339615f7b30e656efea1f656bba55a","expected_explanation":"A．ClO⁻中Cl的化合价降低，ClO⁻是氧化剂；N₂是氧化产物。同一反应中氧化剂的氧化性强于氧化产物，因此氧化性ClO⁻＞N₂，A正确。\nB．NH₄⁺中N由－3价升到0价，NH₄⁺是还原剂；Cl⁻是还原产物。同一反应中还原剂的还原性强于还原产物，因此还原性NH₄⁺＞Cl⁻，B错误。\nC．N由－3价升到0价，被氧化；Cl由＋1价降到－1价，被还原，C正确。\nD．方程式生成H⁺，处理后的废水呈酸性，不能不经处理直接排放，D正确。\n故选B。","expected_stem":"废水脱氮工艺中有一种方法是在废水中加入过量NaClO 使NH\n＋\n4 完全转化为N2，\n该反应可表示为2NH\n＋\n4 ＋3ClO\n－===N2↑＋3Cl\n－＋2H\n＋＋3H2O。下列说法中错误的\n是(\n)\nA.氧化性ClO\n－>N2\nB.还原性NH\n＋\n4 <Cl\n－\nC.反应中氮元素被氧化，氯元素被还原\nD.经此法处理过的废水不可以直接排放","expected_options":["氧化性ClO －>N2","还原性NH ＋ 4 <Cl －","反应中氮元素被氧化，氯元素被还原","经此法处理过的废水不可以直接排放"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"de122a9e72dbbfa1132720881136672ab8bcb90c5944b0c311cc36f8927d8ab2","audit_status":"PASS","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/7cd069630635b2ff/7886eb2b58bb884effc19501fa750f06/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题题面","sha256":"89abef29b3eadff92607d325966e2caf997193f3311a6038f9e45825010cb907","width":1055,"height":341},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h1orig/7cd069630635b2ff/7886eb2b58bb884effc19501fa750f06/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题解析","sha256":"cd30bf200af09de3c1ae2e2f5ca7c1c70b14053b0627a1bb9548fc4611ad9fc8","width":1055,"height":1628}],"question_asset_sha256":"89abef29b3eadff92607d325966e2caf997193f3311a6038f9e45825010cb907","analy