nC.通入SO2 后溶液逐渐变成无色，体现了SO2 的漂白性\nD.滴加KI 溶液时，每转移2 mol e\n－会生成2 mol CuI 沉淀","expected_options":["上述实验条件下，物质的氧化性：Cu2＋>SO2>I2","在SO2 与I2 反应中得到还原产物为H2SO4","通入SO2 后溶液逐渐变成无色，体现了SO2 的漂白性","滴加KI 溶液时，每转移2 mol e －会生成2 mol CuI 沉淀"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"559277b0063a44ac55d7cadadfa74cdad2f240d845a2a33867cc25feb1b64d3d","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/d7db3d2599f13006/2a7ab5e98ed7c1c4cea8988c3e9e1ed1/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题7原题题面","sha256":"020fa982e0099b52b44bf860f3686ee9d385758e63b6aa56672dceb61990ff5a","width":1055,"height":334},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h1orig/d7db3d2599f13006/2a7ab5e98ed7c1c4cea8988c3e9e1ed1/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题7原题解析","sha256":"b25f568d31b3ac34de874f97a9033e7448f50fd3a9f6c20b723ac12423bb9c57","width":1055,"height":340}],"question_asset_sha256":"020fa982e0099b52b44bf860f3686ee9d385758e63b6aa56672dceb61990ff5a","analysis_asset_sha256":"b25f568d31b3ac34de874f97a9033e7448f50fd3a9f6c20b723ac12423bb9c57","expected_revision_token":"4aa28d484715899d0b971cd6562b375e85964737ffbdc1ece30f6312b956b603","expected_item_sha256":"8a0ab336fc5d14172cc066e595b5e948a24bfc0315776e1f16c09afaa6ab8cee","source_pdf_sha256":"d80bf387d5b5b4be63c8faa214afde3f0a71af9cf1fa4c1f314b3297997ce7f9","question_png_sha256":"1e1b952091b903d4539c278e99284c1cd3b0bdb2a8c575bf52e5eaf22e2fd79e","analysis_png_sha256":"69946829e3797b0f087c20da440af98d1f709b4bcc4a843420b1a4e9b1126f8b"},{"source_manifest_id":"H1_REDOX-96bc425d5fc494b8","canonical_source_id":"--:H1_REDOX-96bc425d5fc494b8","grade_band":"高一","skill_id":"H1_REDOX","old_question_id":"QH1O_27060A682962964C_54F6AB72C7C95935_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH1O_27060A682962964C_DD1B2CF37143B277_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":1,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"6bcac36bba7a1383b08fba55044c9d252abede7c5f5eb13e2db1fda3b8a2bd31","expected_explanation_sha256":"6bcac36bba7a1383b08fba55044c9d252abede7c5f5eb13e2db1fda3b8a2bd31","expected_explanation":"A．NbO⁺中Nb为＋3价，NbO₂⁺中Nb为＋5价，题中顺序写反，A错误。\nB．反应前后H均为＋1价，H⁺中H的化合价没有变化，因此H⁺既不是氧化剂也不是还原剂，B正确。\nC．NbO₂⁺和Nb₂O₅中Nb均为＋5价，转化时没有元素化合价变化，不是氧化还原反应，C错误。\nD．Nb由＋3价升到＋5价，每生成1 mol NbO₂⁺转移2 mol电子；生成0.1 mol时转移0.2 mol电子，D错误。\n故选B。","expected_stem":"铌具有广泛用途。黏土铌矿中NbO\n＋转化为NbO\n方程式为NbO\n＋＋MnO2＋2H\n＋===NbO\n＋\n2 ＋Mn2＋＋H2O，下列有关说法正确的是\n(\n)\nA.NbO\n＋和NbO\n＋\n2 中Nb 元素的化合价分别为＋5 和＋3\n＋既不是氧化剂也不是还原剂\nB.反应中H\nC.NbO\n＋\n2 转化为Nb2O5 的反应为氧化还原反应\nD.生成0.1 mol NbO\n＋\n2 ，反应转移0.1 mol 电子","expected_options":["NbO ＋和NbO ＋ 2 中Nb 元素的化合价分别为＋5 和＋3 ＋既不是氧化剂也不是还原剂","反应中H","NbO ＋ 2 转化为Nb2O5 的反应为氧化还原反应","生成0.1 mol NbO ＋ 2 ，反应转移0.1 mol 电子"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"a5c6bdc83874efca3f5f2db41cf9aff8277a0a58699bdddc2518530596f88039","audit_status":"PASS","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/27060a682962964c/21e1df9a569cdee34045e65896ffb248/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题13原题题面","sha256":"bd6826bb7042c9cfe88d738e21c2eac6ef313b7c0741d577d1af59351a0ede80","width":1055,"height":340},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h1orig/27060a682962964c/21e1df9a569cdee34045e65896ffb248/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题13原题解析","sha256":"41ba76155a6d81a5c314af3b6a3749db878c859c475badb102446f8e858db68b","width":1055,"height":287}],"question_asset_sha256":"bd6826bb7042c9cfe88d738e21c2eac6ef313b7c0741d577d1af59351a0ede80","analysis_asset_sha256":"41ba76155a6d81a5c314af3b6a3749db878c859c475badb102446f8e858db68b","expected_revision_token":"018083f83606f027239372dd4f47a7a5d8ab418eb6f4b7fb29505f863a63dc6e","expected_item_sha256":"66b5a402befdc8181b4cb99dbf1b3d8ce0863b7555b1f9937da924ec2cc79b16","source_pdf_sha256":"d80bf387d5b5b4be63c8faa214afde3f0a71af9cf1fa4c1f314b3297997ce7f9","question_png_sha256":"23ae7fc655145239d521ad630a686823664c2d0703755d36da77ffe52a032cd5","analysis_png_sha256":"e8da48be1b3c597cb83a5b113303a92a11dc3b764fad3ee9efbc0cd45e9674d2"},{"source_manifest_id":"H1_REDOX-96e82df1454f2339","canonical_source_id":"--:H1_REDOX-96e82df1454f2339","grade_band":"高一","skill_id":"H1_REDOX","old_question_id":"QH1O_78F5E18F3A539292_C9F838EDFB8F0F50_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH1O_78F5E18F3A539292_DBDD1D569FEAB102_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"2ee07addbfa40075defc16b306659e251715e66a4b65a49a9b85953982e69f38","expected_explanation_sha256":"1c656a38671d0daba653548ee073e2b18b76619c55fdd0018872f1d175eba5c0","expected_explanation":"A．置换反应要求反应物和生成物中都有单质，本反应的反应物均为化合物，不属于置换反应，A错误。\nB．N₂H₄中N为－2价，生成N₂时升为0价，N₂H₄被氧化，不是被还原，B错误。\nC．N₂H₄中N的化合价升高，N₂H₄失电子、作还原剂，C正确。\nD．N₂H₄中的N由－2价升到0价，N₂O₄中的N由＋4价降到0价，所以N₂既是氧化产物又是还原产物；H₂O中元素化合价未变，不是还原产物，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"阿波罗宇宙飞船以N2H4(联氨)和N2O4 为推力源，反应温度达2\n700 ℃，反应式为：2N2H4＋N2O4===3N2＋4H2O。关于该反应的说法中正确的是\n(\n)\nA.属于置换反应\nB.N2H4 被还原\nC.N2H4 是还原剂\nD.N2 是氧化产物，H2O 是还原产物","expected_options":["属于置换反应","N2H4 被还原","N2H4 是还原剂","N2 是氧化产物，H2O 是还原产物"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"4271c937114de790ac9943649de0a5799d564bb885bab885fd010d5552a0cb9e","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/78f5e18f3a539292/364160f5f433da20a2db11028d69ac1a/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题5原题题面","sha256":"4bfd503f2fd20e2ba121e552c33d746b82bfddfbe2c92c8f9e987fee1fd2924c","width":1055,"height":340},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h1orig/78f5e18f3a539292/364160f5f433da20a2db11028d69ac1a/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题5原题解析","sha256":"9030bf2c94667719b071ead1a03f559f918ba0500948aad867095b7b7520f38b","width":1055,"height":240}],"question_asset_sha256":"4bfd503f2fd20e2ba121e552c33d746b82bfddfbe2c92c8f9e987fee1fd2924c","analysis_asset_sha256":"9030bf2c94667719b071ead1a03f559f918ba0500948aad867095b7b7520f38b","expected_revision_token":"f7091a1ea0701cb872f4d68abaef8d9afdcbf342ea35e0b4a181feee3d54c1c4","expected_item_sha256":"e9274260242a4d8f865a0782de548660edf6a83f04e0970c445bbceb2c1500a9","source_pdf_sha256":"d80bf387d5b5b4be63c8faa214afde3f0a71af9cf1fa4c1f314b3297997ce7f9","question_png_sha256":"c716b3fd6b8657cd66637d8b03a849a9ea9518d6ffb5f08d06138ba535a0d302","analysis_png_sha256":"73431c30524210b3411a829506f20c289ba9313f7642adcf72842b3e5fc21d6a"},{"source_manifest_id":"H1_REDOX-a7147f4559791b52","canonical_source_id":"--:H1_REDOX-a7147f4559791b52","grade_band":"高一","skill_id":"H1_REDOX","old_question_id":"QH1O_A05BEEC525828B5F_3A5EB27F0F690457_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH1O_A05BEEC525828B5F_DCE7B6123A9E6621_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":1,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"3eed72dffa5a0d8ed840c977cbf684725bc74e383415525a114002f971d8bf46","expected_explanation_sha256":"5e239b0ac2568d3cbb300bd517482a9506021598a244aad57d3f50e1ea98b979","expected_explanation":"A．反应①中S₂O₃²⁻发生歧化，既作氧化剂又作还原剂；反应⑤是配合反应，不是氧化还原反应，S₂O₃²⁻既不是氧化剂也不是还原剂，所以A错误。\nB．反应②中2 mol S₂O₃²⁻共转移2 mol电子，即1 mol S₂O₃²⁻转移1 mol电子；消耗0.1 mol S₂O₃²⁻时，转移电子数为0.1N_A，B正确。\nC．反应④中各元素化合价均未变化，是非氧化还原反应，没有氧化剂和还原剂，C错误。\nD．S₂O₈²⁻中S为＋6价；强氧化性来自过氧键中－1价的O，不存在“＋7价硫”，D错误。\n故选B。","expected_stem":"硫元素可形成多种含氧酸根离子，如SO2－\n3 、SO2－\n4 、S2O2－\n3 、S2O2－\n4 、\nS2O2－\n7 、S2O2－\n8 、S4O 2－\n6 等，部分转化关系如下。下列说法正确的是(\n)\n①S2O2－\n3 ＋2H\n＋===SO2↑＋S↓＋H2O\n②2S2O2－\n3 ＋I2===S4O2－\n6 ＋2I\n－\n③2S2O2－\n4 ＋H2O===S2O2－\n3 ＋2HSO\n－\n3\n④3K2S2O7＋Fe2O3===Fe2(SO4)3＋3K2SO4\n⑤AgBr＋2S2O2－\n3 ===[Ag(S2O3)2]3－＋Br\n－\n⑥5S2O2－\n8 ＋2Mn2＋＋8H2O===10SO2－\n4 ＋2MnO\n－\n4 ＋16H\n＋\n3 都表现了还原性\nA.上述反应中S2O 2－\nB.反应②中每消耗0.1 mol S2O 2－\n3 转移电子数为0.1NA\nC.反应④中氧化剂与还原剂的物质的量之比为3∶1\nD.反应⑥表现了＋7 价硫元素的强氧化性","expected_options":["上述反应中S2O 2－","反应②中每消耗0.1 mol S2O 2－ 3 转移电子数为0.1NA","反应④中氧化剂与还原剂的物质的量之比为3∶1","反应⑥表现了＋7 价硫元素的强氧化性"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"b05bb651fd822159b6510f0cbd34c9942d85af74c491ae0854a81fa20a5d0cb0","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/a05beec525828b5f/01915ea6c290fcf01a89ca26a99b4a73/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题14原题题面","sha256":"24a57dac672cb12195faf1ee14b494b414