化性，浓H2SO4 不能干燥SO2","H2S＋H2SO4(浓)===S↓＋SO2↑＋2H2O 反应中氧化产物与还原产物的物质的量 比为1∶1","NO2 与NH3 在一定条件下不可能发生反应"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"f6cf79accfa9c274e8bf250d777df631a73f02aef045b0f6ce97a8821a51bf0f","audit_status":"PASS","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h1orig/7831619720601f9a/65f7f8c4348141922576c5a1422cfe82/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题【典例1】下列说法正确的是(原题题面","sha256":"54f4cd66f4b6a17adaed3286adc830a42139d719860ef223a413fd06725686ec","width":1055,"height":287},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h1orig/7831619720601f9a/65f7f8c4348141922576c5a1422cfe82/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题【典例1】下列说法正确的是(原题解析","sha256":"cc3048a85f1f1e0af0049858184ab172b2fc304492144caee25f9c9d4cbf4f1c","width":1055,"height":1841}],"question_asset_sha256":"54f4cd66f4b6a17adaed3286adc830a42139d719860ef223a413fd06725686ec","analysis_asset_sha256":"cc3048a85f1f1e0af0049858184ab172b2fc304492144caee25f9c9d4cbf4f1c","expected_revision_token":"68c718b6f8aa6cedcffb50a3805d6587f652e16c369a45ff2d7d0f515b6d4e97","expected_item_sha256":"e092d2a44ba10941ca47c4a6d82303787713ea548977a969584af6b064bf1ad1","source_pdf_sha256":"d80bf387d5b5b4be63c8faa214afde3f0a71af9cf1fa4c1f314b3297997ce7f9","question_png_sha256":"d470964512e272972ee889e513bd0f2fc6cdcb681993680551144944aa48026b","analysis_png_sha256":"00aa1992245634469b0185091f4287734de9d41613b0a984ff4876fcad32d94f"},{"source_manifest_id":"H1_REDOX-bd35f6a2801dec99","canonical_source_id":"--:H1_REDOX-bd35f6a2801dec99","grade_band":"高一","skill_id":"H1_REDOX","old_question_id":"QH1O_2D5376DEAF7473B6_773E3384DF7C61C9_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH1O_2D5376DEAF7473B6_20D224D9C5DE12A4_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"b13db83ca0aecbd5096808a47e0dbcedc30a0ae8c1a0f6c43ddb83980741cf4e","expected_explanation_sha256":"b13db83ca0aecbd5096808a47e0dbcedc30a0ae8c1a0f6c43ddb83980741cf4e","expected_explanation":"A．K2H3IO6 中I 元素的化合价降低，发生得电子的反应，发生还原反应，A