F－e⁻＝FeC₂O₄F＋K⁺，B正确。\nC．充电通过0.02 mol电子时，有0.02 mol K嵌入碳电极，增加质量为0.02×39＝0.78 g，C正确。\nD．题目未说明气体处于标准状况，4.48 L气体的物质的量不一定为0.20 mol，因此不能推出通过隔膜的K⁺为0.20 mol，D错误。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"2020 年6 月，清华大学发现了一种新型的钾离子电池正极材\n料，比过去使用的任何材料都更加稳定。电池示意图如下，总反应为FeC2O4F＋\nKC6\n放电\n充电\nC6＋KFeC2O4F。下列有关说法错误的是（\n）\nA.放电时，负极反应：KC6－e\n－===K\n＋＋C6\n＋\nB.充电时，阳极反应：KFeC2O4F－e\n－===FeC2O4F＋K\nC.充电时，当电路中通过的电子为0.02 mol 时，碳电极增加的质量为0.78 g\nD.用该电池电解饱和食盐水，阴极产生4.48 L 气体时，通过隔膜的K\n＋为0.2 mol","expected_options":["放电时，负极反应：KC6－e －===K ＋＋C6 ＋","充电时，阳极反应：KFeC2O4F－e －===FeC2O4F＋K","充电时，当电路中通过的电子为0.02 mol 时，碳电极增加的质量为0.78 g","用该电池电解饱和食盐水，阴极产生4.48 L 气体时，通过隔膜的K ＋为0.2 mol"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"3a9eefd42665dcad65838f379143c3b7c62589d8f9add903fecc54b990a6f60a","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/102c94958ff04712/d02563b33a4211e53b5a9620d9aaaf36/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题9原题题面","sha256":"e21e098a5bade1d1185b378f1850286ac73e60697fa5382bbb55bfb5d79bc515","width":1055,"height":574},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/102c94958ff04712/d02563b33a4211e53b5a9620d9aaaf36/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题9原题解析","sha256":"fb9e25e557de3f7877c6bdd2b6ba78cce700cb9c689f762738be65f2faf31b04","width":1055,"height":288}],"question_asset_sha256":"e21e098a5bade1d1185b378f1850286ac73e60697fa5382bbb55bfb5d79bc515","analysis_asset_sha256":"fb9e25e557de3f7877c6bdd2b6ba78cce700cb9c689f762738be65f2faf31b04","expected_revision_token":"284ac5bef8204f6878adb7596405c5657b4ebedbd1d23e4fe1f8844d5b06744b","expected_item_sha256":"8a0b54de40dcb7b3468f38f56b456c3a1000c99f05d8787efcddc30109242934","source_pdf_sha256":"4407fb9cf7c4f489f5fff7dca3f1fbd5f5da2803ae1ec6a7c056c23f4be5ed5e","question_png_sha256":"3781f51f505d01d54fcc3fcb4fe92a84c34d4ab285161a04cfc8f0b760b46cb8","analysis_png_sha256":"84aa527f53af5ff484ca2efd5fd691cb6e5e0f6b136b1a2d43ee8ec95c949795"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_ELECTRO-2630750b3fc7c2ad","canonica