"2749c33c739bf7e529ccfa9b9af49748cebea16ec6f2aee31cd4b0985d345eaf","expected_explanation_sha256":"b9669abb3ea8a49d89ea1b3bc04a8b3ca7c3dc175a8616837bc2d16ec25540f8","expected_explanation":"A．放电时Zn在负极失电子：Zn－2e⁻＋4OH⁻＝Zn(OH)₄²⁻，A正确。\nB．CO₂中C显＋4价，HCOOH中C显＋2价，每1 mol CO₂转化为HCOOH转移2 mol电子，B正确。\nC．充电总反应是放电总反应的逆反应，可写为2Zn(OH)₄²⁻＝2Zn＋O₂↑＋4OH⁻＋2H₂O，C正确。\nD．充电时正极发生2H₂O－4e⁻＝O₂↑＋4H⁺，c(H⁺)增大；温度不变时K_w不变，故c(OH⁻)降低，D错误。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"科学家近年发明了一种新型Zn－CO2 水介质电池。电池示意图如图，\n电极为金属锌和选择性催化材料，放电时，温室气体CO2 被转化为储氢物质甲酸\n等，为解决环境和能源问题提供了一种新途径。\n下列说法错误的是（\n）\n4\nA.放电时，负极反应为Zn－2e\n－＋4OH\n－===Zn（OH）2－\nB.放电时，1 mol CO2 转化为HCOOH，转移的电子数为2 mol\nC.充电时，电池总反应为2Zn（OH）2－\n4 ===2Zn＋O2↑＋4OH\n－＋2H2O\n－浓度升高\nD.充电时，正极溶液中OH","expected_options":["放电时，负极反应为Zn－2e －＋4OH －===Zn（OH）2－","放电时，1 mol CO2 转化为HCOOH，转移的电子数为2 mol","充电时，电池总反应为2Zn（OH）2－ 4 ===2Zn＋O2↑＋4OH －＋2H2O －浓度升高","充电时，正极溶液中OH"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"335016c12522ba606257201f1797f06712d8bfc4f2861b08cc5aab7e9562c8f3","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/05911db3f68e8dce/b40e6db0369b041ffee095d252266ee9/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题【典例2】科学家近年发明了一种新型Zn－CO2 原题题面","sha256":"5a1be208921f31a81d607daef2c6ab6165554a9c0acf01e86b7cdd01162602a3","width":1055,"height":637},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/05911db3f68e8dce/b40e6db0369b041ffee095d252266ee9/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题【典例2】科学家近年发明了一种新型Zn－CO2 原题解析","sha256":"bda0364bae352ede18790fa0d411f62e3823575e34ee8faa1bbcf92829802522","width":1055,"height":1443}],"question_asset_sha256":"5a1be208921f31a81d607daef2c6ab6165554a9c0acf01e86b7cdd01162602a3","analysis_asset_sha256":"bda0364bae352ede18790fa0d411f62e3823575e34ee8faa1bbcf92829802522","expected_revision_token":"674a19cf04b76c6ca39464378e54f5484e9f19c57454fe424065fe7c4675203b","expected_item_sha256":"1e3607e0b71155383137558a10038122d217c048a28ab56e3d905379e56376d1","source_pdf_sha256":"4407fb9cf7c4f489f5fff7dca3f1fbd5f5da2