5c7a9b471cfeb8d","analysis_asset_sha256":"8c78f5cf33820e760fc8f34caf4fb14faaad8a89d0206375a7caa17d2825f1f4","expected_revision_token":"707dd6d985410e4eea76cc92b22e445d51132959406ffa816736805b12d4a1bb","expected_item_sha256":"5e9e2b553dd8f2e9d3ea3382681b305261220a7a518712c9b781cb1ca92fbe0c","source_pdf_sha256":"4407fb9cf7c4f489f5fff7dca3f1fbd5f5da2803ae1ec6a7c056c23f4be5ed5e","question_png_sha256":"330a0813237737697582c5009b468f9597446a6aa1556e34d2d34d13800b36ac","analysis_png_sha256":"33c1ea2a297061d0cbdf30290caebcb36257b2c767776dd8340251ab86e41523"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-062d066f7120b252","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-062d066f7120b252","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_FC688F95E550D011_F45A233EBA72E83F_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_FC688F95E550D011_609263D6037CFA05_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"3c5d64450a6907500e7d49c30039f9edb372cba6d0bbabfa515d8459160eca58","expected_explanation_sha256":"9a5ec3982e6da5a71d5bb7eb56adf0453717e7fa9027add6c722e892fce90ee9","expected_explanation":"测定NO₂相对分子质量时，应尽量减少N₂O₄，即使2NO₂(g)⇌N₂O₄(g)向逆反应方向移动；该正反应放热且气体物质的量减小，因此高温、低压最有利于逆向移动。\nA．0 ℃温度最低，明显有利于生成N₂O₄，误差较大，A错误。\nB．130 ℃虽温度高，但300 kPa高压有利于生成N₂O₄，B错误。\nC．25 ℃、100 kPa均不是给定条件中的最高温和最低压，C错误。\nD．130 ℃是最高温，50 kPa是最低压，N₂O₄最少，测定误差最小，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"一定条件下：2NO2(g)\nN2O4(g)\nΔH<0。在测定NO2 的\n相对分子质量时，下列条件中，测定结果误差最小的是(\n)\nA.温度0 ℃、压强50 kPa\nB.温度130 ℃、压强300 kPa\nC.温度25 ℃、压强100 kPa\nD.温度130 ℃、压强50 kPa","expected_options":["温度0 ℃、压强50 kPa","温度130 ℃、压强300 kPa","温度25 ℃、压强100 kPa","温度130 ℃、压强50 kPa"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"a7c1595b38ab2b598458c9659d694498436bf186a862b52af62eb3a9870155ab","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/fc688f95e550d011/a80bdca08c3d0cc2056c4e4a95fb148f/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题题面","sha256":"a4e423295f0fcb6156c446f644e22e2f761cf001b114c74564c4a74dda14adce","width":1055,"height":290},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/fc688f95e550d011/a80bdca08c3d0cc2056c4e4a95fb148f/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题解析","sha256":"ae088342222e5c70ef4090022af78d2bb30031de53457b0d45b0f67a23d747ed","width":1055,"height":193}],"question_asset_sha256":"a4e423295f0fcb6156c446f644e22e2f761cf001b114c74564c4a74dda14adce","analysis_asset_sha256":"ae088342222e5c70ef4090022af78d2bb30031de53457b0d45b0f67a23d747ed","expected_revision_token":"ed622aa7c7566323aea8cd52a2a427c0c57ab22cd281789878a6e5a07894fd1e","expected_item_sha256":"41065a9d16d7a46711163620bbc48b7dd35518f7c899e33cf9049902ddae33c2","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"9519f9ca7c2dba637cf1ebb1ee09a059a1fd7b31216cea28ac34ea1c61b35041","analysis_png_sha256":"f030f8a7aab663bd3a0319ab9d6f16106ea7cbe9d469eaa85dca4383f869a29d"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-08e6c9de91c5da70","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-08e6c9de91c5da70","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_4A84FC6FA8C1D186_07A89363C270E92B_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_4A84FC6FA8C1D186_F3CFB7DCAF3DDC7A_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"bad87598b06ed8552e972710cd90adc9fe849f07f2c3e5a347ca9a364637d721","expected_explanation_sha256":"178780196f5f216d353ac8b29756bbc2b67643897a9f7256ede68d75ab6de536","expected_explanation":"容器体积扩大到2倍的瞬间，若平衡不移动，c(A)应由0.50降至0.25 mol·L⁻¹；新平衡时c(A)＝0.30 mol·L⁻¹，说明平衡逆向移动，因此反应物侧气体化学计量数之和较大，即x＋y＞z。\nA．应为x＋y＞z，不是x＋y＜z，A错误。\nB．减小压强后平衡逆向移动，不是正向移动，B错误。\nC．逆向移动会生成B、抵消一部分原来的转化，所以B的转化率减小，不是增大，C错误。\nD．平衡逆向移动使生成物C所占比例减小，C的体积分数减小，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"在一定温度下的密闭容器中发生反应：xA(g)＋yB(g)\nzC(g)，平衡时测得A\n－1。保持温度不变，将容器的容积扩大到原来的两倍，再达\n的浓度为0.50 mol·L\n平衡时，测得A 的浓度为0.30 mol·L\n－1。下列有关判断正确的是(\n)\nA.x＋y<z\nB.平衡向正反应方向移动\nC.B 的转化率增大\nD.C 的体积分数减小","expected_options":["x＋y<z","平衡向正反应方向移动","B 的转化率增大","C 的体积分数减小"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"4c239339bd5ae20da45b1861c3a59aa29f40ef35c29a56e5a18ba89d0e1fdd37","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/4a84fc6fa8c1d186/2014d5b665150f46d42a21af314c127b/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题题面","sha256":"6512c4897f7b025bacc82c716af5c66a457e3dfa6726592130315e139b226b15","width":1055,"height":334},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/4a84fc6fa8c1d186/2014d5b665150f46d42a21af314c127b/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题解析","sha256":"72780951eba5df4841c7a755b87f5c08e9913181d9b4bc80bbf3fdcdd92db57b","width":1055,"height":915}],"question_asset_sha256":"6512c4897f7b025bacc82c716af5c66a457e3dfa6726592130315e139b226b15","analysis_asset_sha256":"72780951eba5df4841c7a755b87f5c08e9913181d9b4bc80bbf3fdcdd92db57b","expected_revision_token":"8d640e140146e2abe55c65b4658e2a0c23ddb179810ba302554c0a1729598538","expected_item_sha256":"f7b6fba419a55ec703539de7a2c0464f6be7e93f18ed643d3f653d9e96e8369f","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"6406ac4ee1e47e54b2492df95d7434767cc774be688efd4f68fcdb0e6a53eb21","analysis_png_sha256":"d5a4f2caca63a9db438b54e44eb31af05c8e5c604960dc17b4d791feabb9f1cd"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-14620bdd42ba60d5","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-14620bdd42ba60d5","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_3D83BADCC8519716_C899D0936B518CE2_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_3D83BADCC8519716_137882E048A333B5_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":1,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"e3e3ebebd93d7d9417523fd625368108ce1252e22ea88b2013b28171d4a54478","expected_explanation_sha256":"13af0fbb59ddcea319cb9f02ddceccaffbe0f95aa3a3e7f46c514272a9295528","expected_explanation":"A．由曲线先后达到平衡可知T₁＜T₂；升温后P体积分数减小，平衡逆向移动，K减小，所以K₁＞K₂，不是K₁＜K₂，A错误。\nB．T₁平衡时P体积分数为40%，总物质的量为2 mol，所以n(P)＝0.8 mol，消耗N为1.6 mol，N转化率为80%；平衡时n(N)＝0.4 mol、n(P)＝n(Q)＝0.8 mol，在2 L容器中K＝(0.8/2)²/(0.4/2)²＝4，B正确。\nC．反应前后气体总物质的量不变，反应过程中气体密度和压强可能始终不变，不能据此判断达到平衡，C错误。\nD．降低温度有利于正反应、及时分离产物也有利于提高转化率，但增大压强不使该等体积反应的平衡移动，所以三项措施不能说均有利，D错误。\n故选B。","expected_stem":"将1 mol M 和2 mol N 置于体积为2 L 的恒容密闭容器中，发生反应，\nM(s)＋2N(g)\nP(g)＋Q(g)\nΔH。反应过程中测得P 的体积分数在不同温度下随\n时间的变化如图所示。下列说法正确的是(\n)\nA.若X、Y 两点的平衡常数分别为K1、K2，则K1<K2\nB.温度为T1 时，N 的平衡转化率为80%，平衡常数K＝4\nC.无论温度为T1 还是T2，当容器中气体密度或压强不变时，反应达平衡状态\nD.降低温度、增大压强、及时分离出产物均有利于提高反应物的平衡转化率","expected_options":["若X、Y 两点的平衡常数分别为K1、K2，则K1<K2","温度为T1 时，N 的平衡转化率为80%，平衡常数K＝4","无论温度为T1 还是T2，当容器中气体密度或压强不变时，反应达平衡状态","降低温度、增大压强、及时分离出产物均有利于提高反应物的平衡转化率"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"986587247cb7d5b2bcc511571bf664ea8ce78b74afd13966b77eadb697b70269","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/3d83badcc8519716/05bd09434137a9524be91f1d1bf7d223/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题【典例1】将1 mol M 和2 mol N 置原题题面","sha256":"7d5cd73c3c094036795a895606bce9a8e929659b42520f937f9f90e096e8fe88","width":1055,"height":521},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/3d83badcc8519716/05bd09434137a9524be91f1d1bf7d223/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题【典例1】将1 mol M 和2 mol N 置原题解析","sha256":"cd6e7db932e197ca1991ed8523d8586635215cf06ab80e41742b4b822a6de276","width":1055,"height":409}],"question_asset_sha256":"7d5cd73c3c094036795a895606bce9a8e929659b42520f937f9f90e096e8fe88","analysis_asset_sha256":"cd6e7db932e197ca1991ed8523d8586635215cf06ab80e41742b4b822a6de276","expected_revision_token":"1fc27da390cbb2305e49deb703845977b60248bc5f5a4aaae3f1970c06afcef7","expected_item_sha256":"a2cd0dfb77b08b8401348dac51d153abefa216c223d207f864ea1fd67d4ac1eb","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"4d256cd48dccbd409dda4d6ba1a3fee15e3f5dea52ea4bb854d34960e314a05c","analysis_png_sha256":"f72f504cac2887030d493f452f064ed6ccbafd9a4939b0ed9a015f310bae2fb9"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-27f0a36c4f880a18","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-27f0a36c4f880a18","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_AE7F8A576F8DB3E9_474CFBD43AEBF510_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_AE7F8A576F8DB3E9_93840716CAE6A7C4_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"71c906a257c21301397652e007ca9f3b5eafd4df42518e9da1223b13851a0169","expected_explanation_sha256":"71c906a257c21301397652e007ca9f3b5eafd4df42518e9da1223b13851a0169","expected_explanation":"A．根据勒夏特列原理可知，升高温度，化学平衡向着吸热反应方向移动，\n而c(Z)增大，说明平衡正向移动，故ΔH>0，A 正确；\nB．加入一定量Z，Z 的浓度\n增大，平衡逆向移动，故达新平衡后m(Y)减小，B 正确；\nC．加入等物质的量的Y\n和Z，Z 的浓度增大，平衡逆向移动，由于X、Y 均为固体，故K＝c(Z)，达新平\n衡后c(Z)不变，C 错误；\nD．加入一定量氩气，加入瞬间，X、Z 的浓度保持不变，\n故正、逆反应速率不变，故平衡不移动，D 正确。","expected_stem":"某温度下，在恒容密闭容器中加入一定量X，发生反应\n2X(s)\nY(s)＋Z(g)，一段时间后达到平衡。下列说法错误的是(\n)\nA.升高温度，若c(Z)增大，则ΔH>0\nB.加入一定量Z，达新平衡后m(Y)减小\nC.加入等物质的量的Y 和Z，达新平衡后c(Z)增大\nD.加入一定量氩气，平衡不移动","expected_options":["升高温度，若c(Z)增大，则ΔH>0","加入一定量Z，达新平衡后m(Y)减小","加入等物质的量的Y 和Z，达新平衡后c(Z)增大","加入一定量氩气，平衡不移动"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"edcb073dc4e11206f84d8c37805db101642a1454257aefcc8ef961a5b50de3b4","audit_status":"PASS","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/ae7f8a576f8db3e9/458e63acbbaeffd8af71801daa0a389e/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题题面","sha256":"a9d0e94f518afa586974176d621b78133b4ac148d8da4d315de936c539b06fa8","width":1055,"height":287},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/ae7f8a576f8db3e9/458e63acbbaeffd8af71801daa0a389e/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题解析","sha256":"879a4c6a1a783b304d391058d7c5e9c5d14ebe018ff9efc4a43961fcdb306729","width":1055,"height":334}],"question_asset_sha256":"a9d0e94f518afa586974176d621b78133b4ac148d8da4d315de936c539b06fa8","analysis_asset_sha256":"879a4c6a1a783b304d391058d7c5e9c5d14ebe018ff9efc4a43961fcdb306729","expected_revision_token":"ba04d3e7e89d405d3d5c4c8eda1629c3a20f6fd5fa98d5c1b86f3d1d3b2aac4b","expected_item_sha256":"4caa74bfde6d404ebaeff759f0a6c99fddf4c4272326da4447c84bf42caa9a09","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"7e4a20368b58d4e6b677965339c7daa12b18be5a843c63c1e74a625613e39e72","analysis_png_sha256":"a41555001c922743a5b9c240bbf83e6aac63c7b754bf00e54d4965eb536d90fc"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-29f4708d3752be09","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-29f4708d3752be09","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_B2C9A65CFEE57FCA_56D2C787B63ACF22_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_B2C9A65CFEE57FCA_F633C88A569FD3E4_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"a5950c1b4162b8f3bd381c35ce6cc4af2ef69c4dd76a6fb5ae3f27732c00b2e4","expected_explanation_sha256":"24bc9e4ef9b8ffaa7969cb865b49d2f3f77049f8c9c5c04f3b1d48ece49f6930","expected_explanation":"A．升高温度会使正、逆反应速率都增大，不是正反应增大而逆反应减小，A错误。\nB．Fe(s)和FeO(s)都是固体，不写入平衡常数表达式，正确表达式为K＝c(CO)/c(CO₂)，B错误。\nC．温度由700 ℃升至900 ℃时K由1.47增至2.15，说明升温有利于正反应，正反应为吸热反应，C正确。\nD．平衡常数只与温度有关；同温度下增大CO₂浓度虽会引起平衡移动，但K不变，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"反应：Fe(s)＋CO2(g)\nFeO(s)＋CO(g)，700 ℃时平衡常数为1.47，900 ℃时\n平衡常数为2.15。下列说法正确的是(\n)\nA.升高温度，该反应的正反应速率增大，逆反应速率减小\nB.该反应的化学平衡常数表达式为K＝c（FeO）·c（CO）\nc（CO2）·c（Fe）\nC.该反应的正反应是吸热反应\nD.增大CO2 浓度，平衡常数增大","expected_options":["升高温度，该反应的正反应速率增大，逆反应速率减小","该反应的化学平衡常数表达式为K＝c（FeO）·c（CO） c（CO2）·c（Fe）","该反应的正反应是吸热反应","增大CO2 浓度，平衡常数增大"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"1ffa586f7a6cba561876177084445212ac6f786ae0f62be34d3c68686ceec66c","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/b2c9a65cfee57fca/7a150562fa00157f9ec2cf7c07a48dd3/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题题面","sha256":"6d4f04ff4c00d53c222dba22693ae225ac639a6a45eb56e5cf932f3f27a099fe","width":1055,"height":334},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/b2c9a65cfee57fca/7a150562fa00157f9ec2cf7c07a48dd3/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题解析","sha256":"09c96cd2c177c0e969a49f7727c2b72848306a85dc16f204673bc16e618e4857","width":1055,"height":290}],"question_asset_sha256":"6d4f04ff4c00d53c222dba22693ae225ac639a6a45eb56e5cf932f3f27a099fe","analysis_asset_sha256":"09c96cd2c177c0e969a49f7727c2b72848306a85dc16f204673bc16e618e4857","expected_revision_token":"0c7382b8d314283c4764c9ced7ac4a67e75dfb4d2ae731dac028881139b2c083","expected_item_sha256":"4bd0a5c6a823aa673d7dc6713f167b176665a047fc3231c81718cae6959d36fb","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"ece515e7a35c859a720ab57d7f7b799d48cf9fa0c157c8d20a14e0dbe20eb7e9","analysis_png_sha256":"2fe976ecbb2fad26926f2eeb1eaec7ac8c22f566709d3954389021cb2c24ee95"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-34488d2c092387cd","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-34488d2c092387cd","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_3CA7F90F09DC4901_C685F50287EFCEFE_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_3CA7F90F09DC4901_BE592E755BAA19D6_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"5b211b0b8a6a082d22ee689fae25020b50cd503f2d8340e3b02a43dd5cee06cf","expected_explanation_sha256":"b0bcb988d9ff793819e9d2161dbf5b67568ecc4ce2cb877b36a0e1ac8a682fd3","expected_explanation":"由容器①达到平衡时放热0.75Q kJ可知，反应消耗A 1.5 mol，平衡时n(A)、n(B)、n(C)分别为0.5 mol、0.25 mol、1.5 mol。容器②达到相同温度下的平衡时与容器①等效。\nA．容器②需由逆反应方向消耗0.1 mol C，逆反应吸热0.05Q kJ，不是放热，A错误。\nB．恒温恒容时充入He，各反应物和生成物浓度不变，平衡不移动，A的转化率不变，B错误。\nC．恒温恒容时C的平衡体积分数为1.5/(0.5＋0.25＋1.5)＝2/3；若容器②恒容绝热，逆反应先吸热使温度降低，随后平衡向放热的正反应方向移动，所以C体积分数大于2/3，C错误。\nD．两容器温度相同，平衡常数相同；用容器①平衡浓度计算K＝3²/(1²×0.5)＝18，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"T ℃时，体积均为0.5 L 的两个恒容密闭容器中发\n生可逆反应：2A(g)＋B(g)\n2C(g)\nΔH＝－Q kJ·mol\n－1(Q>0)。保持温度不变，\n实验测得起始和平衡时的有关数据如下表，下列叙述中正确的是(\n)\n容器\n起始时各物质的物质的量/mol\n达到平衡时体系\n编号\n能量的变化\nA\nB\nC\n①\n2\n1\n0\n0.75Q kJ\n②\n0.4\n0.2\n1.6\nA.容器②中达到平衡时放出的热量为0.05Q kJ\nB.向容器①中通入氦气，平衡时A 的转化率变大\nC.其他条件不变，若容器②保持恒容绝热，则达到平衡时C 的体积分数小于2\n3\nD.容器①、②中反应的平衡常数均为18","expected_options":["容器②中达到平衡时放出的热量为0.05Q kJ","向容器①中通入氦气，平衡时A 的转化率变大","其他条件不变，若容器②保持恒容绝热，则达到平衡时C 的体积分数小于2 3","容器①、②中反应的平衡常数均为18"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"4311e4eb63c31e9dd209a0fd44d8ffb9971c7bcf80b06eb9062a0790f938463c","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/3ca7f90f09dc4901/d171e92ee5e71abac35fcceda9ce9072/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题5原题题面","sha256":"f751e2f9c3ff258cfaf733bdb7128ce50f2851ccdfb3f58b4fbafe7d86f88e81","width":1055,"height":542},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/3ca7f90f09dc4901/d171e92ee5e71abac35fcceda9ce9072/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题5原题解析","sha256":"82095f3cb678742b35d9a387ace65b980d246b925dbdcd09c9a6455a213e420f","width":1055,"height":648}],"question_asset_sha256":"f751e2f9c3ff258cfaf733bdb7128ce50f2851ccdfb3f58b4fbafe7d86f88e81","analysis_asset_sha256":"82095f3cb678742b35d9a387ace65b980d246b925dbdcd09c9a6455a213e420f","expected_revision_token":"a4646e600046c93d869e5bd46df8c1001ea40897820d36f12b66d38fc6ba45fc","expected_item_sha256":"3a27ef39b0deacde8ce81a625bc2395ab84623f93cf7e771588d97722095d206","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"9fbd291448f71362ee355e74811d45932dc0929a18051eaa75817b3fac004dd3","analysis_png_sha256":"aef8dba4119cb7d7010e70838816f75684f9dd58f2e747d511c1a057563b2225"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-39acd486a8269b8c","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-39acd486a8269b8c","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_7F323A81CEDA0787_5EC5AE2ECFE0EC9F_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_7F323A81CEDA0787_21BCCB103DB88D7F_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"dc24c17d5c2cb799832a30aed00ec3f28be2c552d639ead18a417a2fb1bce8c8","expected_explanation_sha256":"1b2f0702effa958f4e4ce23220d640f27b28f21dbac0e222691807c2c533c047","expected_explanation":"由H₂(g)＋S(s)⇌H₂S(g)得K₁＝c(H₂S)/c(H₂)；由S(s)＋O₂(g)⇌SO₂(g)得K₂＝c(SO₂)/c(O₂)。目标反应等于第一个反应加上第二个反应的逆反应，所以K＝K₁/K₂。\nA．平衡常数不能按K₁＋K₂相加，A错误。\nB．平衡常数不能按K₁－K₂相减，B错误。\nC．若两反应同向相加才对应相乘；本题第二个反应需要逆写，C错误。\nD．K＝K₁×(1/K₂)＝K₁/K₂，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"已知下列反应的平衡常数：\nH2(g)＋S(s)\nH2S(g)，K1；\nS(s)＋O2(g)\nSO2(g)，K2。\n则反应：H2(g)＋SO2(g)\nO2(g)＋H2S(g)的平衡常数为(\n)\nA.K1＋K2\nB.K1－K2\nC.K1×K2\nD.K1\nK2","expected_options":["K1＋K2","K1－K2","K1×K2","K1 K2"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"b0029833ed3d9d860750baa3eac516fe710e9ebfe4659dd4ad096cb4e292706e","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/7f323a81ceda0787/6b47c7a7f2bc5339d5a4d9c99868b76b/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题4原题题面","sha256":"019b82f59824ac9126fdce9fcb02402e1f36c7861de7fb186595bc26fdc1b8a5","width":1055,"height":310},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/7f323a81ceda0787/6b47c7a7f2bc5339d5a4d9c99868b76b/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题4原题解析","sha256":"b0f3ed4e3d10c4e33a8c7b2de95a9839c2bbaf5c78058284a69f7f331939a205","width":1055,"height":328}],"question_asset_sha256":"019b82f59824ac9126fdce9fcb02402e1f36c7861de7fb186595bc26fdc1b8a5","analysis_asset_sha256":"b0f3ed4e3d10c4e33a8c7b2de95a9839c2bbaf5c78058284a69f7f331939a205","expected_revision_token":"555ec2547d8947d18410b549d5ba36626b13e7152983f4d22cbd58d9cd6026c9","expected_item_sha256":"050d82515b98ecd6840b630735a98c9bcd6e0c1fa2c1d33790344ac36fd62cdb","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"fd90f969c3d1b46bda5c5712a2a6453ee4f8220703185f82678ddf7edc82683b","analysis_png_sha256":"1cc071c6a1d448eb042c734586d59f915052cbda76269aea3fec3737f8877d31"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-457e26c5cfe12409","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-457e26c5cfe12409","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_8B07F8E8BA7E6C32_E5BC81D75D2B4414_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_8B07F8E8BA7E6C32_5C3970C79DF8B2E4_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"540ecfbf5851dec0473f7b0b4cf6feaab45ae26f86fe49ff5ec5c2b14f5f547f","expected_explanation_sha256":"f5ba5b7b812b6e48278422722930f38ee698c9404530fc0685a9aef90962bc53","expected_explanation":"A．反应Ⅰ的生成物有CH₃OH和H₂O，正确的平衡常数为K＝c(CH₃OH)c(H₂O)/[c(CO₂)c³(H₂)]；选项漏写c(H₂O)，A错误。\nB．反应Ⅱ与Ⅲ相加得反应Ⅰ，ΔH₁＝＋42.5－90.7＝－48.2 kJ·mol⁻¹，正反应放热；升温时CH₃OH物质的量分数减小，对应曲线b，加压时该分数增大，对应曲线a。选项把曲线a说成温度曲线，B错误。\nC．低温有利于反应Ⅰ正向移动，但低温时反应速率慢，因此应研发低温区高效的催化剂，C正确。\nD．9×10⁵ Pa、250 ℃时CH₃OH物质的量分数约为0.10；升至280 ℃后放热反应逆向移动，该分数小于0.10，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"通过反应Ⅰ：CO2(g)＋3H2(g)\nCH3OH(g)＋H2O(g)\nΔH1，\n可以实现温室气体资源化利用。该反应通过如下步骤实现：\n－1\n反应Ⅱ：CO2(g)＋H2(g)===CO(g)＋H2O(g)\nΔH2＝＋42.5 kJ·mol\n－1\n反应Ⅲ：CO(g)＋2H2(g)===CH3OH(g)\nΔH3＝－90.7 kJ·mol\n密闭容器中，反应物起始物质的量比n（H2）\n＝3 时，在不同条件下(分别在温度\nn（CO2）\n为250 ℃下压强变化和在压强为5×105 Pa 下温度变化)达到平衡时CH3OH 物质\n的量分数变化如图所示。下列有关说法正确的是(\n)\nA.反应Ⅰ的平衡常数可表示为K＝\nc（CH3OH）\nc（CO2）·c3（H2）\nB.曲线a 表示CH3OH 的物质的量分数随温度变化\nC.提高CO2 转化为CH3OH 的转化率，需要研发在低温区高效的催化剂\nD.在9×105 Pa、280 ℃条件下，平衡时CH3OH 的物质的量分数为0.10","expected_options":["反应Ⅰ的平衡常数可表示为K＝ c（CH3OH） c（CO2）·c3（H2）","曲线a 表示CH3OH 的物质的量分数随温度变化","提高CO2 转化为CH3OH 的转化率，需要研发在低温区高效的催化剂","在9×105 Pa、280 ℃条件下，平衡时CH3OH 的物质的量分数为0.10"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"2f2f2cc0c2dd1cbc80d551d04a7504b1d4698831a7b3e1df3f3d0a5211e7bfaa","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/8b07f8e8ba7e6c32/6bf6bd6e9f9b69ed071c245542a46436/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题题面","sha256":"2f9a51d942c895cc2df7042771df3d349fcc25088975bcbfc683e731fd1fc0f0","width":1055,"height":615},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/8b07f8e8ba7e6c32/6bf6bd6e9f9b69ed071c245542a46436/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题解析","sha256":"984afac3d748b253285cc52741aa9e10212d148d0e64de5a532e566d876484fd","width":1055,"height":427}],"question_asset_sha256":"2f9a51d942c895cc2df7042771df3d349fcc25088975bcbfc683e731fd1fc0f0","analysis_asset_sha256":"984afac3d748b253285cc52741aa9e10212d148d0e64de5a532e566d876484fd","expected_revision_token":"596ff2450ded20ef4f60527590a81747701dc2ba1ff648a378eeb56b3cab1d21","expected_item_sha256":"b9c8abb46b8d5bf6bb30337a08516159226aabf23b04e65e3ad0fc272511d2f3","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"cd743a63befd35a12db5af92fefb7eb4c3736f85723a824e7bfa6afd2a3655a4","analysis_png_sha256":"4b62c9d59cc36723acff0c4b993132108bbdb9d0adbfca531921c0c856abae08"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-4f05b37be4ebc7b7","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-4f05b37be4ebc7b7","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_7BDA9CD1B3E0A6C2_B1667321B92E5ADC_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_7BDA9CD1B3E0A6C2_D295AB3304919B2C_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"1dc1d7e29cc115be86f8fe5fb2d67423414fa4803c2ac96128575230a5c6d8f8","expected_explanation_sha256":"71b8c4ff254a969830f3d25f572daf6f3b8aaa7ca8e76ad52da4bc9ee2bd3fb2","expected_explanation":"A．升高温度时CH₃OH体积分数减小，说明正反应放热，ΔH＜0；同温度下p₁曲线的CH₃OH体积分数更大，所以p₁＞p₂。该项把ΔH写成大于0，A错误。\nB．状态B的温度和压强均高于状态A，升温和加压都会加快正、逆反应，所以v逆(状态A)＜v逆(状态B)，B错误。\nC．设起始加入1 mol CO和2 mol H₂，CO转化x mol。C点CH₃OH体积分数为x/[(1－x)＋(2－2x)＋x]＝0.50，解得x＝0.75，所以CO转化率为75%，C正确。\nD．恒温恒压下，仅改变充入CH₃OH的总量相当于同比例改变体系规模，达到平衡时各组分体积分数相同，不会因加入量不同而不同，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"用CO 和H2 在催化剂的作用下合成甲醇，发生的反应如下：CO(g) ＋\n2H2(g)\nCH3OH(g)。在体积一定的密闭容器中按物质的量之比1∶2 充入CO 和\nH2，测得平衡混合物中CH3OH 的体积分数在不同压强下随温度的变化如图所示。\n下列说法正确的是(\n)\nA.该反应的ΔH>0，且p1>p2\nB.反应速率：v 逆(状态A)>v 逆(状态B)\nC.在C 点时，CO 转化率为75%\nD.在恒温恒压条件下向密闭容器中充入不同量的CH3OH，达平衡时CH3OH 的体\n积分数不同","expected_options":["该反应的ΔH>0，且p1>p2","反应速率：v 逆(状态A)>v 逆(状态B)","在C 点时，CO 转化率为75%","在恒温恒压条件下向密闭容器中充入不同量的CH3OH，达平衡时CH3OH 的体 积分数不同"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"80be0ede47a0958fa924c6c278ab20ea8cd4af689cfef97fc910444deb4af17f","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/7bda9cd1b3e0a6c2/1778ec780f7f18081c670936eb66cb18/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题用CO 和H2 在催化剂的作用下合成甲醇，发生的原题题面","sha256":"f12cad198241d33a194e0e590d3f6935c22d281b2a0fae5e63f807abcf9d4d9c","width":1055,"height":673},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/7bda9cd1b3e0a6c2/1778ec780f7f18081c670936eb66cb18/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题用CO 和H2 在催化剂的作用下合成甲醇，发生的原题解析","sha256":"b3196a951aef35331e43b116cfbd208c874b06524411074b7d3a5110209f53f8","width":1055,"height":2311}],"question_asset_sha256":"f12cad198241d33a194e0e590d3f6935c22d281b2a0fae5e63f807abcf9d4d9c","analysis_asset_sha256":"b3196a951aef35331e43b116cfbd208c874b06524411074b7d3a5110209f53f8","expected_revision_token":"e9278d7ab73b825cdc9e1e47b752d53e60bc683e777e05c79be43cf6f701115f","expected_item_sha256":"3934056e7c8821e31ae758ff17353a878c346130a222af080492d892f4b6a47d","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"2e339f12a437b48e33c3603438a7b688abb67dc882ec58f372eec36066494462","analysis_png_sha256":"7efcd4bfebca845412f6b6f84149853f249e5c5aa873f1caa2f2052e2a260081"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-50172782fe7ec563","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-50172782fe7ec563","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_D81DCFB1B5BED330_FB795EB216233DCF_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_D81DCFB1B5BED330_23CA1758A27A4CD3_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"5ca3e3dc3d4afa92a6c62fd3a3312954ace45288630e5f16c4b0491449b002d9","expected_explanation_sha256":"f578ade9cab6e1931f1ea5898143fff7d5e058ab5a7c90f1cbb3a5a98687b9d8","expected_explanation":"A．正反应放热，温度升高时平衡逆向移动、K减小，所以图1中下降的曲线a能反映K随温度的变化，A正确。\nB．正反应气体物质的量减小，增大压强使平衡正向移动，CO平衡转化率增大，所以p₁＞p₂＞p₃，B正确。\nC．升温会降低CO平衡转化率，加压会提高CO平衡转化率；两种影响可能互相抵消，因此不同温度、压强下α(CO)可能相等，C错误。\nD．按n(H₂)/n(CO)＝2.0，即化学计量数之比投料时，两种反应物按相同比例消耗，所以α(CO)＝α(H₂)，D正确。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"甲醇既是重要的化工原料，又可作为燃料，利用合成气(CO\n和H2)在催化剂的作用下合成甲醇，发生的反应为CO(g)＋2H2(g)\nCH3OH(g)\nΔH<0。一定条件下，往一密闭容器中充入一定量的CO(g)与H2(g)，该反应的平\n衡常数K 随温度变化的曲线如图1 所示，反应体系中CO 的平衡转化率α(CO)与\n温度和压强的关系如图2 所示，下列说法错误的是(\n)\nA.图1 中曲线a 能正确反映该反应的平衡常数与温度的变化关系\nB.图2 中p1>p2>p3\nC.在不同温度、压强下进行该反应，α(CO)不可能相等\nD.若α(CO)＝α(H2)(H2 的平衡转化率)，则合成气中n（H2）\n＝2.0\nn（CO）","expected_options":["图1 中曲线a 能正确反映该反应的平衡常数与温度的变化关系","图2 中p1>p2>p3","在不同温度、压强下进行该反应，α(CO)不可能相等","若α(CO)＝α(H2)(H2 的平衡转化率)，则合成气中n（H2） ＝2.0 n（CO）"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"ea3bb9d425623044ad0428a0c54b40593c9a4265856d41d88ab305def16ad88b","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/d81dcfb1b5bed330/2bc0ac2a012e4db53485fe8c01bc4e4c/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题题面","sha256":"a466c483d7c5f7e1da7376f5b3aeb018d77cfd5ded23089a267ddd142d4ec2de","width":1055,"height":788},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/d81dcfb1b5bed330/2bc0ac2a012e4db53485fe8c01bc4e4c/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题解析","sha256":"12cdb66c60371a072908ad99b7d4032df97b2fd446c8aa1ac42a61073f615b72","width":1055,"height":474}],"question_asset_sha256":"a466c483d7c5f7e1da7376f5b3aeb018d77cfd5ded23089a267ddd142d4ec2de","analysis_asset_sha256":"12cdb66c60371a072908ad99b7d4032df97b2fd446c8aa1ac42a61073f615b72","expected_revision_token":"1091d80a0d96228ed6145a8de4da6bbe731cd41043e114dd009d0f5afa829f18","expected_item_sha256":"f2d089ce66ac4fcc7ddbab3be77a236e8288b3227111cd4f2c494a98e9f1a5ab","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"7cedd5135e5bfc8398eb6078871764b98323ba7c2bfa56499644582435461f7f","analysis_png_sha256":"2740894fcfbc0fa68d0b39746152d10b832398d14e204e0f407d926c5edcd1b8"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-59fcd59e00dd3f5d","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-59fcd59e00dd3f5d","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_BFC51B4E02BCCB99_3A0A2F5E43D1706D_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_BFC51B4E02BCCB99_DD2CE3B243958089_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":0,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"28bc020904c88e980da97b7682eec42eadc82903b452461abd19b900bfbcb703","expected_explanation_sha256":"34b721ce5d9f67738bcba2f503a4827c6172ddd73620e6e415c80cb122b0fd2b","expected_explanation":"A．正反应放热，升高温度时平衡逆向移动，Z的物质的量减少、X或Y增加，与t₁后的图像相符，A正确。\nB．催化剂只改变达到平衡的快慢，不改变平衡组成，不会出现图中的物质的量变化，B错误。\nC．平衡前Δn(X或Y)＝a mol、Δn(Z)＝2a mol，所以m＝2，反应前后气体化学计量数之和相等；增大压强不使平衡移动，不符合图像，C错误。\nD．若在t₁加入Z，加入瞬间Z的物质的量应先增大，而图中Z从原平台向下变化，不符合，D错误。\n故选A。","expected_stem":"已知某密闭容器中发生反应：X(g)＋Y(g)\nmZ(g)\nΔH＜0。反应过\n程中，X、Y、Z 的物质的量随时间的变化如图所示，则t1 时刻改变的条件可能是\n(\n)\nA.升高温度\nB.加入更高效的催化剂\nC.增大压强\nD.加入一定量的Z","expected_options":["升高温度","加入更高效的催化剂","增大压强","加入一定量的Z"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"0f09ef1c8ca85e266b14bdf57a66a5302af0dd912dd3af04f2a759871eb6cc37","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/bfc51b4e02bccb99/234786cbf13a3268dc889dac25da30a4/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题题面","sha256":"6e77fe62f1d95c5296c31eabede001c1f6e570b5bce4b5313081915a6dc47cf8","width":1055,"height":483},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/bfc51b4e02bccb99/234786cbf13a3268dc889dac25da30a4/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题解析","sha256":"11431f572f33cd54c1250bf84c5bd873ae592821071b36b522a88b92338eac10","width":1055,"height":860}],"question_asset_sha256":"6e77fe62f1d95c5296c31eabede001c1f6e570b5bce4b5313081915a6dc47cf8","analysis_asset_sha256":"11431f572f33cd54c1250bf84c5bd873ae592821071b36b522a88b92338eac10","expected_revision_token":"ad3a69f12e84b62f5d729aad4406a00671b7dce26c6c5ab2cdd7af328cbca424","expected_item_sha256":"0b7425849a53dc5b675f7674d126872eca15eff97171737ea6259443616cd55a","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"5a784e100ebefa91bb260e44670fb00a464fbc29b9179ec11885490cb1278e9e","analysis_png_sha256":"fd51b79e9e274355accab8c2e55a5cdaa6d6e7beb98aac68c330f60b7218fe91"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-5b512578e87cbc37","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-5b512578e87cbc37","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_288BCF7C5958D854_B4EE9F3FF5E75B22_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_288BCF7C5958D854_49AFC14E77EA7267_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":1,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"ea45ac2bf9c77af4b23ce314a464959a879acd5849040aec7cca1d313f028bfc","expected_explanation_sha256":"c42d0a208ca24dd43ad9e242215d7174c8906fb88d7e644830525d7c7504e1c9","expected_explanation":"A．温度T下平衡时c(N₂)＝c(O₂)＝c₂，c(NO)＝2(c₀－c₂)，所以K＝4(c₀－c₂)²/c₂²；选项使用c₁计算，A错误。\nB．恒容反应过程中体系总质量m和体积V都不变，ρ＝m/V不变，B正确。\nC．恒容充入Ar不改变N₂、O₂、NO的浓度，也不改变正、逆反应速率和平衡组成，不能得到曲线b，C错误。\nD．曲线b较快达到平衡，若由改变温度引起，则对应温度高于T；平衡时c(N₂)更小，说明升温使正反应程度增大，正反应应为吸热反应，ΔH＞0，D错误。\n故选B。","expected_stem":"一定条件下，等物质的量的N2(g)和O2(g)在恒容密闭容器中反应N2(g)＋\nO2(g)\n2NO(g)，下图曲线a 表示该反应在温度T 下N2 的浓度随时间的变化，\n曲线b 表示该反应在某一起始条件改变时N2 的浓度随时间的变化。下列叙述正确\n的是(\n)\nA.温度T 下，该反应的平衡常数K＝4（c0－c1）2\nc21\nB.温度T 下，随着反应的进行，混合气体的密度不变\nC.曲线b 对应的条件改变可能是充入氩气\nD.若曲线b 对应的条件改变是温度，可判断该反应的ΔH<0","expected_options":["温度T 下，该反应的平衡常数K＝4（c0－c1）2 c21","温度T 下，随着反应的进行，混合气体的密度不变","曲线b 对应的条件改变可能是充入氩气","若曲线b 对应的条件改变是温度，可判断该反应的ΔH<0"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"a1bfe0de1ddf652a5395a94568798af88b77340a501bb651fbc0306672aa288f","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/288bcf7c5958d854/5ba0ecf42f6d02b6f7005a01364608a2/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题一定条件下，等物质的量的N2(g)和O2(g)在原题题面","sha256":"117db14684fd90a3007a94424cf09232f884f5860d7e269cd7643ea44347984c","width":1055,"height":614},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/288bcf7c5958d854/5ba0ecf42f6d02b6f7005a01364608a2/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题一定条件下，等物质的量的N2(g)和O2(g)在原题解析","sha256":"13a247bca61b17346b0ed5e1a52beca4c4657e0a018efc080a27350ef038e2fa","width":1055,"height":2495}],"question_asset_sha256":"117db14684fd90a3007a94424cf09232f884f5860d7e269cd7643ea44347984c","analysis_asset_sha256":"13a247bca61b17346b0ed5e1a52beca4c4657e0a018efc080a27350ef038e2fa","expected_revision_token":"d968697aaf36eb7c0ecd38a7276842515f9abc244d160e39d6195afa2611f31f","expected_item_sha256":"e4b6785186a78f3f3ce937ad16be68715ab2cf6892f0007a0e8eccc5454a315f","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"36317d75adba0472887afc9d3b0fa1713dd394616cac692c8d770e4df20d71e8","analysis_png_sha256":"4c2c076960425fb96adb60493b5d507a9a7005edf1ba6a9703441d0547a966ae"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-81448444d56d3235","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-81448444d56d3235","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_4685686E0B6CE487_A77320904F7027EE_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_4685686E0B6CE487_8BB05473F9D524A5_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":0,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"eccb806be02bfa5d06ee3b8b911cb1bf953d0cdc6d0ef17ae3afbe16ba8da990","expected_explanation_sha256":"2738de37f1ce991d289928aa92ed3091829773e2e529726a405a43692d710738","expected_explanation":"A．使用对反应Ⅰ有选择性的催化剂可优先加快反应Ⅰ，从而增大氧化炉中NO的含量，A正确。\nB．由500 K升至700 K时，反应Ⅰ、Ⅱ的K都减小，说明二者正反应均放热；改变温度不能做到促进Ⅰ而抑制Ⅱ，B错误。\nC．反应Ⅰ、Ⅱ的正反应都是气体物质的量增大的反应，改变压强对二者平衡移动方向相同，不能促进Ⅰ而抑制Ⅱ，C错误。\nD．反应Ⅰ、Ⅱ、Ⅲ的K均随升温减小，三者正反应均放热，氧化炉出气进入氧化塔前应降低温度，不是进一步升温，D错误。\n故选A。","expected_stem":"反应Ⅰ、Ⅱ、Ⅲ均会在工业生产硝酸过程中发生，其中反应Ⅰ、Ⅱ发生在氧化\n炉中，反应Ⅲ发生在氧化塔中，不同温度下各反应的化学平衡常数如下表所示。\n化学平衡常数\n温度\n反应Ⅰ：\n反应Ⅱ：\n反应Ⅲ：\n(K)\n4NH3 ＋5O2\n4NO ＋\n4NH3 ＋3O2\n2N2 ＋\n2NO\n＋\n6H2O\n6H2O\nO2\n2NO2\n500\n1.1×1026\n7.0×1034\n1.3×102\n700\n2.1×1019\n2.6×1025\n1.0\n下列说法正确的是(\n)\nA.使用选择性催化反应Ⅰ的催化剂可增大氧化炉中NO 的含量\nB.通过改变氧化炉的温度可促进反应Ⅰ而抑制反应Ⅱ\nC.通过改变氧化炉的压强可促进反应Ⅰ而抑制反应Ⅱ\nD.氧化炉出气在进入氧化塔前应进一步提高温度","expected_options":["使用选择性催化反应Ⅰ的催化剂可增大氧化炉中NO 的含量","通过改变氧化炉的温度可促进反应Ⅰ而抑制反应Ⅱ","通过改变氧化炉的压强可促进反应Ⅰ而抑制反应Ⅱ","氧化炉出气在进入氧化塔前应进一步提高温度"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"6a2d5075588b514b3ae420727798f0b39c65c10a85186b762e81b4e71f0fd5a5","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/4685686e0b6ce487/c012a2a379fbcfb1c0d8fd28014ba16b/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题8原题题面","sha256":"3580ded9a3676eb9eb033fe5437db5931e0397bf48885516efef08946a22f1f6","width":1055,"height":625},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/4685686e0b6ce487/c012a2a379fbcfb1c0d8fd28014ba16b/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题8原题解析","sha256":"412386c96b97404922ec730d07cf013c999f37d10e567150fa6915b254641868","width":1055,"height":334}],"question_asset_sha256":"3580ded9a3676eb9eb033fe5437db5931e0397bf48885516efef08946a22f1f6","analysis_asset_sha256":"412386c96b97404922ec730d07cf013c999f37d10e567150fa6915b254641868","expected_revision_token":"f25f763aed9c52944da1a5c2559eaf41f0181a3e12cb1b723c13c1d85658716a","expected_item_sha256":"e23dbbb6694210d00cfc03beebaca5c4d0dab9747c04c82ddbbce82209f66701","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"0642a9c0cf7712ee524d0d8091da8377767201b825c458223df1fa86d9218084","analysis_png_sha256":"f42b200520b7de7a8563045ad84d397895e07988bd8693a202f4e8db2caeafcd"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-8708f21077881838","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-8708f21077881838","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_49B594A26DB71517_D5EF47AE89E8D09E_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_49B594A26DB71517_2D4B95E63CF8AFF6_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"52153da41f81d5afebeda3e44ea0c345d043275bfa656653993499cc73aa6ff2","expected_explanation_sha256":"7f93f16f5ad2cb3c6054ce0dfbf7f3eb7894b4b26726b3dbde476f205fd101cb","expected_explanation":"A．将反应①和②相加，得到CO₂(g)＋3H₂(g)⇌CH₃OH(g)＋H₂O(g)，ΔH＝＋41＋(－90)＝－49 kJ·mol⁻¹，不是＋49 kJ·mol⁻¹，A错误。\nB．同温同压下，X点是平衡点，Y点尚未达到平衡；继续反应可以由Y点达到X点，B错误。\nC．增大起始n(H₂)/n(CO₂)，平衡虽向正反应方向移动，但新增H₂不能被完全消耗，H₂的平衡转化率反而减小，C错误。\nD．图示高温时甲醇物质的量分数较大；为兼顾CO₂转化率和甲醇选择性，需要研发低温下CO₂转化率高、对甲醇选择性高的催化剂，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"二氧化碳催化加氢制甲醇是一种实现“碳中和”的\n有效方法。该过程通过如下步骤实现：\n－1\n①CO2(g)＋H2(g)\nCO(g)＋H2O(g)\nΔH＝＋41 kJ·mol\n－1\n②CO(g)＋2H2(g)\nCH3OH(g)\nΔH＝－90 kJ·mol\n在密闭容器中，反应物起始物质的量比n（H2）\n＝3，一定条件下达到平衡时，\nn（CO2）\n甲醇的物质的量分数x(CH3OH)随压强或温度变化的曲线如图所示。下列说法正\n确的是(\n)\nA.二氧化碳加氢制甲醇的总反应可表示为：CO2(g)＋3H2(g)\nCH3OH(g)＋H2O(g)\n－1\nΔH＝＋49 kJ·mol\nB.在210 ℃，5×105 Pa 下，反应至x(CH3OH)达到Y 点的值时，延长反应时间不\n能使x(CH3OH)达到X 点\nC.保持其他条件不变，增大起始物n（H2）\n的比值，可以提高H2 的平衡转化率\nn（CO2）\nD.为高效利用CO2，需研发低温下CO2 转化率高和甲醇选择性高的催化剂","expected_options":["二氧化碳加氢制甲醇的总反应可表示为：CO2(g)＋3H2(g) CH3OH(g)＋H2O(g) －1 ΔH＝＋49 kJ·mol","在210 ℃，5×105 Pa 下，反应至x(CH3OH)达到Y 点的值时，延长反应时间不 能使x(CH3OH)达到X 点","保持其他条件不变，增大起始物n（H2） 的比值，可以提高H2 的平衡转化率 n（CO2）","为高效利用CO2，需研发低温下CO2 转化率高和甲醇选择性高的催化剂"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"202871bbefcb2b814da4d9b8a3979b995efb9f54d0c0d2ef72461d48b88ca538","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/49b594a26db71517/73462a1e129b2ddfed47c1937ecb6ffb/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题14原题题面","sha256":"fdb7125d0fe3b6fa29c4fbcc70f9a6d39de3d5b6d78df9a0b1a1077320d6065e","width":1055,"height":715},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/49b594a26db71517/73462a1e129b2ddfed47c1937ecb6ffb/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题14原题解析","sha256":"c02fe4a552a0fb97b49ad1ffe5089b87fbc172082b902f2a1aca247a879eb934","width":1055,"height":381}],"question_asset_sha256":"fdb7125d0fe3b6fa29c4fbcc70f9a6d39de3d5b6d78df9a0b1a1077320d6065e","analysis_asset_sha256":"c02fe4a552a0fb97b49ad1ffe5089b87fbc172082b902f2a1aca247a879eb934","expected_revision_token":"b9058b6f70888afbd9334849e036718dc1c5977dce895b1237098a0461d1a077","expected_item_sha256":"26ac6c8cc5aa1c0c0f0cb21d1c6d2ed9cca74a1ad6370e3aff246466bd985c40","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"50fa856ee7674338c14a744a8e54196675530c88ced90f2371c8b2a13f327c5e","analysis_png_sha256":"f5d95a3e75fbc833c23ca98837a7db8a965f4e91c54a55f7bfef73831e64b474"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-87cfde903dcb97f0","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-87cfde903dcb97f0","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_AC59ADCD4E32148C_CFD10B957B50FEC5_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_AC59ADCD4E32148C_17F72D39B97CCCBE_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"97bc083de3e391601f8295cdc6b7c92bcd92501199b7ee43702510979bbb3e98","expected_explanation_sha256":"a4e799bc6b47c3d54a85d36cbf45d9ba5da96797b69f7d33611cfa14015eea5f","expected_explanation":"A．固定反应时间14 h比较温度时，140 ℃的产率96.6%最高，因此最佳温度是140 ℃，不是100 ℃，A错误。\nB．固定温度100 ℃比较时间时，14 h产率86.6%高于16 h的86.2%，因此最佳时间是14 h，不是16 h，B错误。\nC．温度由140 ℃升至160 ℃时产率由96.6%降至89.0%，可能是温度过高使催化剂活性降低，C正确。\nD．题图生成物两个苯基位于碳碳双键两侧，属于反式结构，不是顺式结构，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"苯乙烯与溴苯在一定条件下发生Heck 反应\n溴苯用量\n100\n100\n100\n100\n100\n100\n100\n(mmol)\n催化剂用量(mmol)\n2\n2\n2\n2\n2\n2\n2\n反应温度(℃)\n100\n100\n100\n100\n120\n140\n160\n反应时间(h)\n10\n12\n14\n16\n14\n14\n14\n产率(%)\n81.2\n84.4\n86.6\n86.2\n93.4\n96.6\n89.0\n根据上表数据，下列说法正确的是(\n)\nA.最佳反应温度为100 ℃\nB.最佳反应时间为16 h\nC.温度过高时催化剂活性可能降低\nD.反应产物是顺式结构","expected_options":["最佳反应温度为100 ℃","最佳反应时间为16 h","温度过高时催化剂活性可能降低","反应产物是顺式结构"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"2ed9d10eac656e130de72e0a2914fbadb0265a349fbbd025a138fd28dd34acf0","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/ac59adcd4e32148c/291442750bfa8f3d54e7d26a2dc5f3c4/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题6原题题面","sha256":"c8b36aa07787f0455a1934569fbeac342667dffd3c5082cd1406b392a8f0e215","width":1055,"height":667},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/ac59adcd4e32148c/291442750bfa8f3d54e7d26a2dc5f3c4/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题6原题解析","sha256":"5a7808579e78078fd0a90c6b4676e5cbf3ec0f0db510301d8e3db89b02ff19fb","width":1055,"height":259}],"question_asset_sha256":"c8b36aa07787f0455a1934569fbeac342667dffd3c5082cd1406b392a8f0e215","analysis_asset_sha256":"5a7808579e78078fd0a90c6b4676e5cbf3ec0f0db510301d8e3db89b02ff19fb","expected_revision_token":"355a70f1908c66a144b9c622747f469246653da3fc9b8386c321f1ec56874a9a","expected_item_sha256":"09cf06db5ffd96f749b7af7119400c1ac2c420acf35c4e7c9f85e32606fa3d55","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"9248c2c73dc06f14b814e8439ce3655aac763e396caee0f82b2e7665dcd872e4","analysis_png_sha256":"fcc3874998c485be98fd6af3d42ed59ff86ec8c4accb6a70104d57e0ddaa1eb5"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-88330552f8594b88","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-88330552f8594b88","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_51CA7F263CAAF61F_B16D2ED3C0BD34CE_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_51CA7F263CAAF61F_5F0F43FC4A3D2DF7_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"29c2aa8cc8ba5db593095831fbb104e2b89e6dfb71ab6a6455cce3d8d8e8eeea","expected_explanation_sha256":"1823d1a63829ee279bce65dc580c97e4f944a9106d34af8c15cec8d322e03361","expected_explanation":"①净化、干燥原料气主要是保护催化剂和设备，不直接提高平衡转化率，①不选。\n②加压使N₂＋3H₂⇌2NH₃的平衡向气体物质的量减小的正反应方向移动，可提高单程转化率，②应选。\n③催化剂只加快达到平衡的速率，不改变平衡转化率，③不选。\n④把NH₃液化分离，相当于降低生成物浓度，使平衡正向移动，提高原料转化率，④应选。\n⑤将未反应的N₂、H₂循环使用，可提高原料的总利用率，⑤应选。\n故②④⑤正确，选C。","expected_stem":"如图为工业合成氨的流程图。图中为提高原料转化率采取的措施是(\n)\nA.①②③\nB.①③⑤\nC.②④⑤\nD.②③④","expected_options":["①②③","①③⑤","②④⑤","②③④"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"238556db11cfcd6084ce9e7736eee688d75c6c57df9e5637b4297d8c58164e05","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"COMBINATION","required_markers":["①","②","③","④","⑤"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/51ca7f263caaf61f/cb5d7ed09ac3c4f44e86579193f059cf/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题题面","sha256":"af93cc6d617a229772c54dc8e9e5f8059edb3869087644b3e8829137ed33e9b7","width":1055,"height":303},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/51ca7f263caaf61f/cb5d7ed09ac3c4f44e86579193f059cf/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题解析","sha256":"104a566bde19aa554ac11701bea5ce8fba410c65e005ef33c63b178c788cc5a7","width":1055,"height":253}],"question_asset_sha256":"af93cc6d617a229772c54dc8e9e5f8059edb3869087644b3e8829137ed33e9b7","analysis_asset_sha256":"104a566bde19aa554ac11701bea5ce8fba410c65e005ef33c63b178c788cc5a7","expected_revision_token":"75b4bf91a79014d2bb18b61b9018657f1c98c54fb39da041c10d41edee032399","expected_item_sha256":"6e38f34ac131a1da3b6a5b69a90f2f9e528563d65ddcfbd6096df15c225feebc","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"d0b72c3cfff4293d5c4040e49392a324af9468fe768d627854841eff2fe2bc44","analysis_png_sha256":"58dd334564bb6ae3896e472c6b96bbd05103d4c14c0569284b2e3c96f3016f4b"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-8dc14228806aafc6","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-8dc14228806aafc6","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_9C582776A0EEDE82_7C1031D859131F64_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_9C582776A0EEDE82_8FF845F4D916E8D6_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"9438f8da1e1fdd02fdabb1c9a08735848fcb1371efb156ff2769f5f1f2c68a52","expected_explanation_sha256":"8d32fc24cadbae4f127981494b54bdcab6a5ea3fa9eec612b4bf6f4608eb623f","expected_explanation":"A．正反应放热，升高温度时平衡逆向移动，CH₃CH₂OH和H₂O均减少；二者生成量之比为1∶3，所以CH₃CH₂OH对应较低的曲线Ⅳ，不是曲线Ⅰ，A错误。\nB．a点温度高于b点；放热反应的平衡常数随温度升高而减小，所以Kₐ＜K_b，不是Kₐ＞K_b，B错误。\nC．设起始n(CO₂)＝a、n(H₂)＝3a，反应生成乙醇x mol。a点CO₂与H₂O物质的量相等，a－2x＝3x，得x＝a/5，所以CO₂转化率为2x/a＝40%，不是60%，C错误。\nD．正反应气体总物质的量减小。相同起始条件下，恒温恒压容器相对恒温恒容容器更有利于正向反应，所以乙醇产率甲＞乙，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"在某密闭容器中按CO2 与H2 的物质的量之\n比为1∶3 进行投料，发生反应2CO2(g)＋6H2(g)\nCH3CH2OH(g)＋3H2O(g)\nΔH<0，在5 MPa 下测得不同温度下平衡体系中各种物质的体积分数(V/%)如图所\n示，下列说法中正确的是(\n)\nA.表示CH3CH2OH 组分的曲线是Ⅰ\nB.图中曲线交点a、b 对应的上述反应平衡常数Ka>Kb\nC.图中曲线交点a 对应的CO2 转化率为60%\nD.若甲、乙两个密闭容器起始时的容积、温度及投料方式均相同，甲：恒温恒压，\n乙：恒温恒容，反应达平衡时CH3CH2OH 产率：甲>乙","expected_options":["表示CH3CH2OH 组分的曲线是Ⅰ","图中曲线交点a、b 对应的上述反应平衡常数Ka>Kb","图中曲线交点a 对应的CO2 转化率为60%","若甲、乙两个密闭容器起始时的容积、温度及投料方式均相同，甲：恒温恒压， 乙：恒温恒容，反应达平衡时CH3CH2OH 产率：甲>乙"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"8402d750fb9f5be427ade340f63368d7925a6973b322d2cba7e919c9029991be","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/9c582776a0eede82/cc4e8a82dc677e785dc14a1ce04b7ea4/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题(2022·江苏百校联考高三第一次考试)在某密闭原题题面","sha256":"791ff1bdab2279ea031e184973f154e0e27c6b304d868b70c44a402ba8b23863","width":1055,"height":652},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/9c582776a0eede82/cc4e8a82dc677e785dc14a1ce04b7ea4/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题(2022·江苏百校联考高三第一次考试)在某密闭原题解析","sha256":"11a9b9f150dbc32dfe2300e4ef47a2d9093865ef2f453035d8ce33fb04321da7","width":1055,"height":6878}],"question_asset_sha256":"791ff1bdab2279ea031e184973f154e0e27c6b304d868b70c44a402ba8b23863","analysis_asset_sha256":"11a9b9f150dbc32dfe2300e4ef47a2d9093865ef2f453035d8ce33fb04321da7","expected_revision_token":"c08ab5bc709fa0e5e1db5b4d2b0aa3325d3289de71b3bc686dad239930fdddeb","expected_item_sha256":"259a08652873ad36b7995b540830a29c60e6b721b9a609ef6dbad5fe75d4a812","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"2ef3b2131da1b77a23f729fbf1741fead31f142db5472995c098ba7958bb3629","analysis_png_sha256":"84da16373257d1fc1843749d434a4bfe16fed3a7b323e0a954a4827136eec19b"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-a5fd301d22477462","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-a5fd301d22477462","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_A1776A4F1F258AFA_696D099AB612D39E_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_A1776A4F1F258AFA_87C63648C9885D47_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"fc8de4339181bbc5f7226e0a2f40ddd46764b6c216003c10b1e38e80170186b7","expected_explanation_sha256":"dec02cf7706a43cbdbca61a49bba1694f79d6ae6e4329a0f0bad97d4a13fe0e3","expected_explanation":"A．升高温度有利于吸热的重整反应正向进行，可提高CH₄转化率；但增大压强会使气体物质的量增大的重整反应逆向移动，不利于提高CH₄转化率，所以A错误。\nB．由两个反应和1∶1投料可知，平衡时CO₂转化率高于CH₄转化率，因此较低的曲线B表示CH₄转化率，不是CO₂转化率，B错误。\nC．催化剂只能加快达到平衡的速率，不改变平衡转化率，不能使曲线A、B重叠，C错误。\nD．恒压800 K、1∶1投料时，在达到X点后增大n(CO₂)或减小压强，都可使重整反应进一步正向进行，使CH₄转化率达到Y点，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"CH4 与CO2 重整生成H2 和CO 的过程中主要发生下列反应\nCH4(g)＋CO2(g)\n2H2(g)＋2CO(g)\n－1\nΔH＝＋247.1 kJ·mol\nH2(g)＋CO2(g)\nH2O(g)＋CO(g)\n－1\nΔH＝＋41.2 kJ·mol\n在恒压、反应物起始物质的量比n(CH4)∶n(CO2)＝1∶1 条件下，CH4 和CO2 的平\n衡转化率随温度变化的曲线如图所示。下列有关说法正确的是(\n)\nA.升高温度、增大压强均有利于提高CH4 的平衡转化率\nB.曲线B 表示CO2 的平衡转化率随温度的变化\nC.相同条件下，改用高效催化剂能使曲线A 和曲线B 相重叠\nD.恒压、800 K、n(CH4)∶n(CO2)＝1∶1 条件下，反应至CH4 转化率达到X 点的\n值，改变除温度外的特定条件继续反应，CH4 转化率能达到Y 点的值","expected_options":["升高温度、增大压强均有利于提高CH4 的平衡转化率","曲线B 表示CO2 的平衡转化率随温度的变化","相同条件下，改用高效催化剂能使曲线A 和曲线B 相重叠","恒压、800 K、n(CH4)∶n(CO2)＝1∶1 条件下，反应至CH4 转化率达到X 点的 值，改变除温度外的特定条件继续反应，CH4 转化率能达到Y 点的值"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"beb9fc4a6af5e1434de40d5384923dd5cdcf8ab0e6b65164f6b6c49af73614a0","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/a1776a4f1f258afa/4d01b48e816c3f934fd06ec3315a6d86/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题题面","sha256":"098045fcfdcc8ffd92efbcb89589cc48c10bda138afbfa43f4d9d8cc87d61576","width":1055,"height":858},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/a1776a4f1f258afa/4d01b48e816c3f934fd06ec3315a6d86/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题解析","sha256":"6d6f229a1544c74d8968dd5068693577b5eb66e9bb9ba18159490fdfdb9feff6","width":1055,"height":428}],"question_asset_sha256":"098045fcfdcc8ffd92efbcb89589cc48c10bda138afbfa43f4d9d8cc87d61576","analysis_asset_sha256":"6d6f229a1544c74d8968dd5068693577b5eb66e9bb9ba18159490fdfdb9feff6","expected_revision_token":"ef93a4bc52f810f4cee132450c37aa32443d0ed346356f734fc70f345037527f","expected_item_sha256":"8cfec057ff286671fb2be02afc95532b7d35e543ad617ca91e4724d52068e7ff","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"dc4725ac6bce4f642425aed83e58d0647aa7ccc5b13e117d57bbb9385f850ff3","analysis_png_sha256":"206b0884ffee4f342b76a2607b08fec65d97e2e53836f707828e484a4bc866a7"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_EQUIL-ad3ff5d61154ae64","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_EQUIL-ad3ff5d61154ae64","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_EQUIL","old_question_id":"QH2O_373453508C89A4C4_95B7A55C2CD6F8CF_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_373453508C89A4C4_03CA46AF5D51ECC1_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"32369ea7b41ad1ffe6c62f8ebcb13b9238822a949dbcca6c7a01306c1919bcc8","expected_explanation_sha256":"9f7e71f9dbde093baa25ee0b35f5c1fc7c06365ea971b3b9071fbc7f2b0aa09c","expected_explanation":"A．温度由25 ℃升至30 ℃时平衡总压增大，说明Kp增大，升温有利于分解正反应，因此ΔH＞0，A正确。\nB．25 ℃平衡时NH₃与CO₂分压比为2∶1，总压为12.0 kPa，所以p(CO₂)＝4000 Pa、p(NH₃)＝8000 Pa；Kp＝p(CO₂)·p²(NH₃)＝2.56×10¹¹ Pa³，B正确。\nC．步骤Ⅰ中测压仪数值未稳定就关闭K₁，U形管左侧会残留空气，使测得的压强偏大，Kp测量值偏大，不是偏小，C错误。\nD．步骤Ⅱ读数时左侧液面偏高，说明左侧气压小于右侧，按读数计算会使Kp测量值偏大，D正确。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"氨基甲酸铵发生分解的化学方程式为NH2COONH4(s)\n2NH3(g)＋CO2(g)。\n利用如下装置测定不同温度下该反应以分压表示的化学平衡常数Kp，实验步骤如\n下：(Ⅰ)关闭K3，打开K1 和K2，开启真空泵抽气至测压仪数值稳定后关闭K1；\n(Ⅱ)关闭K2，缓慢开启K3 至U 形管两边液面相平并保持不变，读取压强数值。\n记录25 ℃、30 ℃下压强分别为12.0 kPa、17.1 kPa。下列说法错误的是(\n)\nA.氨基甲酸铵分解反应的ΔH>0\nB.该反应25 ℃时的化学平衡常数Kp＝2.56×1011 Pa3\nC.步骤Ⅰ中测压仪数值未稳定即关闭K1，Kp 测量值偏小\nD.步骤Ⅱ中读数时U 形管左侧液面偏高，Kp 测量值偏大","expected_options":["氨基甲酸铵分解反应的ΔH>0","该反应25 ℃时的化学平衡常数Kp＝2.56×1011 Pa3","步骤Ⅰ中测压仪数值未稳定即关闭K1，Kp 测量值偏小","步骤Ⅱ中读数时U 形管左侧液面偏高，Kp 测量值偏大"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"c4ff7a70582face4eb5062bc3ceb6f56641d87a233e10bb4f6986a17d3632eb1","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/373453508c89a4c4/379f970e89728f23a8b47afac46f7f69/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题13原题题面","sha256":"d96fc5947b3773c09f5868eb39f10cea3a350c2cf0afa4f3ef41ae2787968492","width":1055,"height":427},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/373453508c89a4c4/379f970e89728f23a8b47afac46f7f69/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题13原题解析","sha256":"f10473b4df1bdf595df05839c1ad37fce029f23ff8da6bbe0f931f863e076560","width":1055,"height":393}],"question_asset_sha256":"d96fc5947b3773c09f5868eb39f10cea3a350c2cf0afa4f3ef41ae2787968492","analysis_asset_sha256":"f10473b4df1bdf595df05839c1ad37fce029f23ff8da6bbe0f931f863e076560","expected_revision_token":"db2f720b65203a5f25c01e7dce0e463fcb1f196783f100667704170d4a122e6e","expected_item_sha256":"d891d826b3d597ec57001cc9320ac24b47f22212735a58f789ee821eac0b706d","source_pdf_sha256":"3ace5c3d99fe9d51a79782a3c3439faf73fa2c539ec58d659bdae4ffb23c5ffc","question_png_sha256":"5508e