O2)＝0.04 mol·L","①中H2 的平衡转化率为40%","①、②均达平衡时，①中各组分浓度与②相同"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"6002892887dc3638e8d362912e95cdb973c92f0e599f781e0b6f9ee8cf54cbb3","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/9eef7feeca24a775/03cc5352dcceb6908ab04183d6ab3ad8/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题7原题题面","sha256":"ae5cfbeb9aa95521f36fc80611d3679fb78a1ba0db9a695c503556d40ea195ae","width":1055,"height":549},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/9eef7feeca24a775/03cc5352dcceb6908ab04183d6ab3ad8/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题7原题解析","sha256":"c15e3f7fdd3872140d213a4cc21b0cfbcd75fca99cb5701cfbe471b600c1853f","width":1055,"height":646}],"question_asset_sha256":"ae5cfbeb9aa95521f36fc80611d3679fb78a1ba0db9a695c503556d40ea195ae","analysis_asset_sha256":"c15e3f7fdd3872140d213a4cc21b0cfbcd75fca99cb5701cfbe471b600c1853f","expected_revision_token":"c1523aa587829940f9bc80b51f16f32b2a8b7f38df69c725bae0292858bc4362","expected_item_sha256":"ffecbd3563218cac1ed134ccf97bfea290f49e8f72eeacad2e0ecf999507e477","source_pdf_sha256":"20fdf23de600d8ff8a303d11ebf354b9a39a9fde53900e011de9ad5eecf67579","question_png_sha256":"56e71767ef77dedadf0bff91f6fc7941c282db80329d4fac95c26271f203758e","analysis_png_sha256":"b242b04d9ce0b186fd2ae87c44f7194487b074fceca2010634aa295e5a206182"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_K-241587b13183aef8","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_K-241587b13183aef8","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_K","old_question_id":"QH2O_969EA71EC05B5C9F_D83D23DD53160A7A_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_969EA71EC05B5C9F_8BD3EC1573EFC4E3_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"7c5214c0d22d89dc687c721c2987b931cff6ebdaaff7ea080f87b12a385564a6","expected_explanation_sha256":"2e0c953c30f273e3c0634cb5fc26a824e023cff81a22516694790e9ad58f91d5","expected_explanation":"A．C(s)为固体，不写入平衡常数，故K＝c(CO)c(H₂)/c(H₂O)，A正确。\nB．增大压强时平衡向气体物质的量减小的逆反应方向移动，但温度不变，K不变；该项说K减小，B错误。\nC．该反应ΔH＞0，升高温度时K增大，不是减小，C错误。\nD．恒温恒压下充入Ar，容器体积增大，相当于减压，平衡向气体物质的量增大的正反应方向移动；温度不变，K不变，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"对于反应C(s)＋H2O(g)\nCO(g)＋H2(g)\nΔH>0，下列有关说法正确的是(\n)\nA.平衡常数表达式为K＝c（CO）·c（H2）\nc（C）·c（H2O）\nB.恒温条件下压缩容器的容积，平衡逆向移动，平衡常数K 减小\nC.升高体系温度，平衡常数K 减小\nD.恒温恒压条件下，通入氦气，平衡正向移动，平衡常数K 不发生变化","expected_options":["平衡常数表达式为K＝c（CO）·c（H2） c（C）·c（H2O）","恒温条件下压缩容器的容积，平衡逆向移动，平衡常数K 减小","升高体系温度，平衡常数K 减小","恒温恒压条件下，通入氦气，平衡正向移动，平衡常数K 不发生变化"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"4d6c84fcac63b668409cfb6470be51be08533da1e4b46bced5d749f4cab4207c","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/969ea71ec05b5c9f/e26d8c0d91a8f0c12084dd040cefae23/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题题面","sha256":"ce05d8e8024d2325e409060a04a39a64fe7356d66931a0f0ab15f9fe68e16394","width":1055,"height":288},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/969ea71ec05b5c9f/e26d8c0d91a8f0c12084dd040cefae23/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题解析","sha256":"8985af9b3aa55f36eec55ace2b9fabcb81ea6afe4e33e4d25463690efa3633ee","width":1055,"height":246}],"question_asset_sha256":"ce05d8e8024d2325e409060a04a39a64fe7356d66931a0f0ab15f9fe68e16394","analysis_asset_sha256":"8985af9b3aa55f36eec55ace2b9fabcb81ea6afe4e33e4d25463690efa3633ee","expected_revision_token":"8beb53cd0cba1464a0e77f28af2bbef860436c23de2c2d9e0c05b650eab2d6a7","expected_item_sha256":"70dc16983e7b89696d97145fb42669ae844b013f8fca1d6dcf8303fad61e18e0","source_pdf_sha256":"20fdf23de600d8ff8a303d11ebf354b9a39a9fde53900e011de9ad5eecf67579","question_png_sha256":"3697fdebe4991648d246dfee2173c75e098588c7e9833248654dfc82afb3cbb2","analysis_png_sha256":"ad86ef2f7f8a4f7c3d25cf6b0f892190aa57104cc9a4eb863dfdc9785d7e3ae8"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_K-3689060078fc8084","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_K-3689060078fc8084","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_K","old_question_id":"QH2O_935FD35CF53352A1_76B8EFB009E5CA5F_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_935FD35CF53352A1_43DDFA4767438E91_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"7332902e847bdb771161fd86cec3ede45d1c91149016de4a266b47b5c48d79c7","expected_explanation_sha256":"b1bfe301b5cdcaf09b350d205a94a0c4e658bb6c46aea6ffe40e6f9df27c5e1e","expected_explanation":"A．X、Y两组的转化率都为67%，且初始浓度均为a mol·L⁻¹，所以两组中c(MTP)都约为0.67a mol·L⁻¹，A正确。\nB．Z组转化率为98%，剩余TOME浓度约为0.02a mol·L⁻¹；按题给速率关系比较可得v(X)＞v(Z)，B正确。\nC．若Z组达到平衡，反应中生成的甲醇被连续移出，不能直接把0.98a当作甲醇的平衡浓度代入题给K表达式，C错误。\nD．X组0～150 min内MTP的平均生成速率为0.67a/150 mol·L⁻¹·min⁻¹，D正确。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"MTP 是一类重要的药物中间体，可以由TOME 经环\n化后合成。其反应式为：\n为了提高TOME 的转化率，反应进行时需及时从溶液体系中移出部分甲醇。TOME\n的转化率随反应时间的变化如图所示。设TOME 的初始浓度为a mol/L，反应过\n程中的液体体积变化忽略不计。下列说法错误的是(\n)\nA.X、Y 两点的MTP 的物质的量浓度相等\nB.X、Z 两点的瞬时速率大小为v(X)>v(Z)\nC.若Z 点处于化学平衡，则210 ℃时反应的平衡常数K＝0.98a×0.98a\n0.02a\nmol/L\nD.190 ℃时，0～150 min 之间的MTP 的平均反应速率为0.67a\n150\nmol/(L·min)","expected_options":["X、Y 两点的MTP 的物质的量浓度相等","X、Z 两点的瞬时速率大小为v(X)>v(Z)","若Z 点处于化学平衡，则210 ℃时反应的平衡常数K＝0.98a×0.98a 0.02a mol/L","190 ℃时，0～150 min 之间的MTP 的平均反应速率为0.67a 150 mol/(L·min)"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"c94f7643ac2e57825621e9318072acb403017cd62777242a34057b5f3d726777","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/935fd35cf53352a1/cf89a97d2990420300bb465ec9fbbb9e/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题8原题题面","sha256":"ee97949c3597c0704c2b83c0f21610f0bd6bc31629924a5bb2f01ea5c66ea911","width":1055,"height":879},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/935fd35cf53352a1/cf89a97d2990420300bb465ec9fbbb9e/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题8原题解析","sha256":"1f59b495b0f137485021f0849d76bb3ff6c4963ae970c9eea5422f5cf0c9796c","width":1055,"height":288}],"question_asset_sha256":"ee97949c3597c0704c2b83c0f21610f0bd6bc31629924a5bb2f01ea5c66ea911","analysis_asset_sha256":"1f59b495b0f137485021f0849d76bb3ff6c4963ae970c9eea5422f5cf0c9796c","expected_revision_token":"299ac57dcdedc08bdeb4e3709b72b840cab7c02182ffc0effe6d32c77357c23e","expected_item_sha256":"bdbfd5a9df9d6ebf7b2595e288a90755