 mol·L －1·min","K1、K2 的关系：K2>K1","T1、T2 的关系：T1<T2"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"3875908794b59d68e7ad03bac5d67aef8fc2604e3ad8d13181e0a9d53d8c3013","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/087b5429cd25ea3b/cbc6d602d47ec1049b4cb994c267e46a/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题10原题题面","sha256":"679945213073dceb380c96e905b11cef777595382802a5a208201094961f6991","width":1055,"height":573},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/087b5429cd25ea3b/cbc6d602d47ec1049b4cb994c267e46a/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题10原题解析","sha256":"f17a3bfb5e068644f2cf581b973836221a7ccb61f9d3d497b3958bdfd947b06a","width":1055,"height":362}],"question_asset_sha256":"679945213073dceb380c96e905b11cef777595382802a5a208201094961f6991","analysis_asset_sha256":"f17a3bfb5e068644f2cf581b973836221a7ccb61f9d3d497b3958bdfd947b06a","expected_revision_token":"988a09eb9c7b21263342947bdb1489f7a5b428423a1fe41f5ca0f8dc73d01321","expected_item_sha256":"83fcaede517e968a5601ed445c52fd72e7959b292a75957c22c42fa9a4be5376","source_pdf_sha256":"20fdf23de600d8ff8a303d11ebf354b9a39a9fde53900e011de9ad5eecf67579","question_png_sha256":"0b65821519b2d558a27c935793097e7548ea38c9401bcad08139d4af944014af","analysis_png_sha256":"7f98b01fb5dbef706965fb8a40b6a24f828c23b1498688672a523c2ed85a9eac"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_K-4e2f024b286adb15","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_K-4e2f024b286adb15","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_K","old_question_id":"QH2O_D141EC2CB8D201C3_9DA397EEE6A87A3E_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_D141EC2CB8D201C3_E608D3889ABB2785_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":0,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"d77e84d508c9bdb9d1bcbf4e907617a2042269558f2e27702e8c3bc25a88a9b9","expected_explanation_sha256":"edd666bc670469466dbd3b7b403297037d582cf27f939c557cb52a2ec45e8e39","expected_explanation":"由平衡时气体总物质的量为0.40 mol、n(ClNO)＝0.15 mol，结合两反应的计量关系可得反应进度x＝0.10 mol、y＝0.05 mol。\nA．NO₂的转化率为0.10/0.20×100%＝50%，A正确。\nB．平衡时c(NO)＝(0.20－2×0.05)/2＝0.05 mol·L⁻¹，不是0.025 mol·L⁻¹，B错误。\nC．K₂只与温度有关，同温度下恒压改变体系体积不会改变K₂，C错误。\nD．目标反应由2×反应①－反应②得到，所以K＝K₁²/K₂，不是K₁²－K₂，D错误。\n故选A。","expected_stem":"在恒温条件下，向盛有食盐的2 L 恒容密\n闭容器中加入0.2 mol NO2、0.2 mol NO 和0.1 mol Cl2，发生如下两个反应：\n①2NO2(g)＋NaCl(s)\nNaNO3(s)＋ClNO(g)\nΔH1＜0\nK1\n②2NO(g)＋Cl2(g)\n2ClNO(g)\nΔH2＜0\nK2\n10 分钟时反应达到平衡，测得容器内体系的压强减少20%，10 分钟内用ClNO(g)\n表示的平均反应速率v(ClNO)＝7.5×10\n－3 mol/(L·min)。下列说法正确的是(\n)\nA.平衡时NO2 的转化率为50%\nB.平衡后c(NO)＝2.5×10\n－2 mol/L\nC.其他条件保持不变，反应在恒压条件下进行，则平衡常数K2 增大\nD.反应4NO2(g)＋2NaCl(s)\n2NaNO3(s)＋2NO(g)＋Cl2(g)的平衡常数为K21－K2","expected_options":["平衡时NO2 的转化率为50%","平衡后c(NO)＝2.5×10 －2 mol/L","其他条件保持不变，反应在恒压条件下进行，则平衡常数K2 增大","反应4NO2(g)＋2NaCl(s) 2NaNO3(s)＋2NO(g)＋Cl2(g)的平衡常数为K21－K2"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"465f33c50231c62ac2abc8802a97f065fcbdbc9ec8659d9900ab6d760db806ef","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/d141ec2cb8d201c3/a06d2227abe89207e13faf2d21d8ee2a/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题10原题题面","sha256":"85001fe9873cc4388f6857900a14064ef97332c9252994ef10cdd97fa0b43ae1","width":1055,"height":475},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/d141ec2cb8d201c3/a06d2227abe89207e13faf2d21d8ee2a/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题10原题解析","sha256":"6fe4f0bc8a06ba31924a2ea2c15961bb74f13d9597a811b14d16702c231370a0","width":1055,"height":990}],"question_asset_sha256":"85001fe9873cc4388f6857900a14064ef97332c9252994ef10cdd97fa0b43ae1","analysis_asset_sha256":"6fe4f0bc8a06ba31924a2ea2c15961bb74f13d9597a811b14d16702c231370a0","expected_revision_token":"babb181d521482636bd8a520088dbcdab4b8974c51e5f840e08e0304571526de","expected_item_sha256":"cc4f7c474e5e9fe8c573a1e02024328ade97d9f56a665e093187e4eff81e6e5d","source_pdf_sha256":"20fdf23de600d8ff8a303d11ebf354b9a39a9fde53900e011de9ad5eecf67579","question_png_sha256":"a1c5b7ee9ed1519b41dc31621621792b01c1fe7389b74454299579c5a01fa154","analysis_png_sha256":"492d1353a2e4c9d193d58502f79a67c6b32bff4e612d8cc6c95338c833814020"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_K-63a79fa483855370","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_K-63a79fa483855370","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_K","old_question_id":"QH2O_159FB5A0AFE8BF9F_725A02756A9A8CD0_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_159FB5A0AFE8BF9F_CF01A11E817A2A4B_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":0,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"1ff18a101292618c6f8e967a730d380b9bf5feb38b98b1ae0c0c5c235f5b6487","expected_explanation_sha256":"4a83ae6fd8db4e2c2120901e303515acb0155b1753fd1642bb5886b1c19ca3b1","expected_explanation":"A．积碳反应和消碳反应都是吸热反应，升高温度时两平衡均正向移动，所以K积、K消都增大，A正确。\nB．升高温度会使积碳反应和消碳反应的速率都增大，不是一个减小、一个增大，B错误。\nC．积碳反应中催化剂X的活化能较低、效果较好；消碳反应中催化剂Y的活化能较低、效果较好，不能说X对两反应都更好，C错误。\nD．曲线显示升温过程中积碳量先增大后减小，说明高温区v消增大的倍数大于v积增大的倍数；该项关系相反，D错误。\n故选A。","expected_stem":"化学反应中催化剂活性会因积碳反应而降低，同时存在的消碳\n反应则使积碳量减少。相关数据如下表：\n积碳反应CH4(g)===C(s)\n消碳反应\nCO2(g) ＋\n反应\n＋2H2(g)\nC(s)===2CO(g)\nΔH/kJ·mol\n－1\n75\n172\n催化剂X\n33\n91\n活化能/\n(kJ·mol\n－1)\n催化剂Y\n43\n72\n在反应进料气组成、压强及反应时间相同的情况下，某催化剂表面的积碳量随温\n度的变化关系如图所示。升高温度时，下列关于积碳反应、消碳反应的平衡常数(K)\n和速率(v)的叙述正确的是(\n)\nA.K 积、K 消均增加\nB.v 积减小、v 消增加\nC.催化剂X 效果比Y 好\nD.v 消增加的倍数比v 积增加的倍数小","expected_options":["K 积、K 消均增加","v 积减小、v 消增加","催化剂X 效果比Y 好","v 消增加的倍数比v 积增加的倍数小"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"014cb07d0ba7d13f1e8fd511edd3365b31c31e054ec4a8ba00f2a50eac9b238f","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/159fb5a0afe8bf9f/e6abbcdb7c512aa6be30c1c16797c79a/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题14原题题面","sha256":"5a26294208e9be409f3908e723a153f2b2ce58b51e17313fb4e83a43e66afc66","width":1055,"height":672},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/159fb5a0afe8bf9f/e6abbcdb7c512aa6be30c1c16797c79a/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题14原题解析","sha256":"7d9d7d53a72023ea89c577af439d591c79ad5ee04561fe38704e7d3429980cb4","width":1055,"height":381}],"question_asset_sha256":"5a26294208e9be409f3908e723a153f2b2ce58b51e17313fb4e83a43e66afc66","analysis_asset_sha256":"7d9d7d5