引起平衡移动，但温度不变时K不变，B错误。\nC．平衡常数与反应方程式的写法和温度有关，C正确。\nD．通常K越大表示正反应进行程度越大，反应物平衡转化率越大，不是越小，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"下列关于平衡常数K 的说法正确的是(\n)\nA.加入催化剂可能会改变平衡常数K\nB.改变反应物浓度能改变平衡常数K\nC.平衡常数K 与反应本身及温度有关\nD.K 越大，反应物的转化率越小","expected_options":["加入催化剂可能会改变平衡常数K","改变反应物浓度能改变平衡常数K","平衡常数K 与反应本身及温度有关","K 越大，反应物的转化率越小"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"631931bcc76a5f1a7b49cf08ab0244ad65b870c287fce06a96004f3035eb4676","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/df5d5c0064ef5668/2d190a7ec237346c41d3999e1a2e58c5/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题题面","sha256":"5fb332f37b859b0076c48641ee87a4ccaf13ca4f2a5dbc3d6602b3aab5ff0981","width":1055,"height":246},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/df5d5c0064ef5668/2d190a7ec237346c41d3999e1a2e58c5/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题解析","sha256":"d2398bda856066dc0a0cc5205b4882b76afd3c4ae2000c10b9974479d5e9bbfb","width":1055,"height":194}],"question_asset_sha256":"5fb332f37b859b0076c48641ee87a4ccaf13ca4f2a5dbc3d6602b3aab5ff0981","analysis_asset_sha256":"d2398bda856066dc0a0cc5205b4882b76afd3c4ae2000c10b9974479d5e9bbfb","expected_revision_token":"02cfbde5ac004c908c4349856ffdc238ff62f411ef2efe692761685c1cf5af37","expected_item_sha256":"c7c0813049dfffcfc1224fe51fd627acd07fb07123f289a6060bf92e9ccf3d20","source_pdf_sha256":"20fdf23de600d8ff8a303d11ebf354b9a39a9fde53900e011de9ad5eecf67579","question_png_sha256":"885c8820d1d85b1f6c5066a41d88eae9ddd748104094ce643a15ea3fe8700794","analysis_png_sha256":"3a83e9535c33aeddf6ae27803b1421c17d7f605214d1d55529f712bbcc911634"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_K-79ca2d550f5d5c5a","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_K-79ca2d550f5d5c5a","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_K","old_question_id":"QH2O_0AE341D17D226227_BB13972B92F7A0BB_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_0AE341D17D226227_E7E30AAF02D89693_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"6c79cb0f1e63f669915ec2b33438900bdb0b44c68b4d64f65c9e109db7