8659bfd37d3c276d3dc9a6646c8e","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/f50fb16acf90cc97/029b7a4ac57de72fbb403a5b07a94dfe/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题7原题题面","sha256":"de2cba6d42715519f5418bc3392f6fb892bee71856c91d187a9145a5b624b7a6","width":1055,"height":457},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/f50fb16acf90cc97/029b7a4ac57de72fbb403a5b07a94dfe/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题7原题解析","sha256":"fe1f932ca664a97bf9e003705412b09a0f05f32573deb61e20eaf915a94c4376","width":1055,"height":256}],"question_asset_sha256":"de2cba6d42715519f5418bc3392f6fb892bee71856c91d187a9145a5b624b7a6","analysis_asset_sha256":"fe1f932ca664a97bf9e003705412b09a0f05f32573deb61e20eaf915a94c4376","expected_revision_token":"b8606c8a8afaa4e233c933b2fefb2b63dce279b2b30e693fed7349771bbb3123","expected_item_sha256":"5cf1157c5ed1c8700985a3544ec870a7ccce2affca197ff29b509730f98e7c61","source_pdf_sha256":"20fdf23de600d8ff8a303d11ebf354b9a39a9fde53900e011de9ad5eecf67579","question_png_sha256":"c3f8b41545d726e0deda73f5d44588af840697003bc3349eadd3737a4bd21bfe","analysis_png_sha256":"f5da8b0fd29c64913de012b78dd1a048eb9e2cf8674e002c4cfde2ebae91dc17"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_K-a158a19f66678f72","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_K-a158a19f66678f72","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_K","old_question_id":"QH2O_E1901E4AEF50FFEA_3125166E83350C2C_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_E1901E4AEF50FFEA_9C8D39CC5B792E59_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"eaced0bdfc4466c5c432581582681286dc252dbfc6bccbd21e364fba024fa848","expected_explanation_sha256":"ac49f39d66e64541b14d0c67e5a81b73e25d4b0a992d386d03f56d77d4f78586","expected_explanation":"A．a点尚未达到平衡，b点达到平衡；由平衡转化率随温度继续升高而下降可知正反应放热，低温时K较大，因此Kₐ＞K_b，A错误。\nB．b点以后转化率下降的主要原因是升温使放热反应的平衡逆向移动，不是催化剂失活，B错误。\nC．b点以前尚未达到平衡，延长反应时间；也可通过合适的条件改变使转化率达到阴影区域，并非只能延长时间，C错误。\nD．设初始c(CO)＝a mol·L⁻¹，50 ℃时CO转化率为x，则平衡时c(CO)＝a(1－x)、c(CO₂)＝ax、c(O₂)＝0.01 mol·L⁻¹，所以K＝c²(CO₂)/[c²(CO)c(O₂)]＝100x²/(1－x)²，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"为了模拟汽车尾气的净化，向密闭容器中投入一定量的CO 和\nO2，在催化剂(Ⅰ型、Ⅱ型)和不同温度下发生反应：2CO(g)＋O2(g)\n2CO2(g)，\n反应进行相同时间t(s)，测得CO 转化率与温度的关系曲线如图所示。下列说法正\n确的是(\n)\nA.该反应在a、b 两点对应的平衡常数大小关系：Ka<Kb\nB.b 点转化率明显下降最主要原因是温度升高催化剂失活\nC.在实验中CO 平衡转化率达到阴影部分数值只能采用延长反应时间的方案\nD.50 ℃、t s 时容器中O2 浓度为0.01 mol/L，该温度下反应平衡常数为\n100x2\n（1－x）2","expected_options":["该反应在a、b 两点对应的平衡常数大小关系：Ka<Kb","b 点转化率明显下降最主要原因是温度升高催化剂失活","在实验中CO 平衡转化率达到阴影部分数值只能采用延长反应时间的方案","50 ℃、t s 时容器中O2 浓度为0.01 mol/L，该温度下反应平衡常数为 100x2 （1－x）2"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"bc6c52d0f47dff0653337b0dafde76e2e0f098e51e834ca11118ad8838ab11ba","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/e1901e4aef50ffea/6cb68067f87ac4e76112c7ab70175b0c/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题13原题题面","sha256":"c5304efa89bea060d9389245681ee25462ffee82bbf0d8c4e087b8177cedbdd3","width":1055,"height":614},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/e1901e4aef50ffea/6cb68067f87ac4e76112c7ab70175b0c/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题13原题解析","sha256":"107391da47bfdf6d4cd79ce5d33b7a76006bfbe1104525588abc1a198b627b53","width":1055,"height":562}],"question_asset_sha256":"c5304efa89bea060d9389245681ee25462ffee82bbf0d8c4e087b8177cedbdd3","analysis_asset_sha256":"107391da47bfdf6d4cd79ce5d33b7a76006bfbe1104525588abc1a198b627b53","expected_revision_token":"701b9853992cdfc38afeeed07cde25248356330d9fb689b4e4a397b84234cc9e","expected_item_sha256":"69074ad4a06955b0c8f130b54e52d4722cab61a19c0508392fdf43471187f5cd","source_pdf_sha256":"20fdf23de600d8ff8a303d11ebf354b9a39a9fde53900e011de9ad5eecf67579","question_png_sha256":"254afe5a10e0d8fc6137c7f744a287b0b2ea5ad8c860cce216b8bc5bb8a1af38","analysis_png_sha256":"6c6484e9ca08297d8b62696cdb420042d09cbb2a6a8a1e7742a2897a3814d771"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_K-a1d459165997da03","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_K-a1d459165997da03","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_K","old_question_id":"QH2O_D5D7A34FFAD0F0C0_5A9F12423265E310_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_D5D7A34FFAD0F0C0_2DA90946A3677796_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"106b791bb5becc445a3adef0e2873f0f12af34e4881b119d34d8c596f8f92b31","expected_explanation_sha256":"bbb0de0b1e4d3dd9de3b1a74051e0b76eef085e9e2c6cc4130f065c45382a1a5","expected_explanation":"A．总反应为2O₃(g)⇌3O₂(g)，ΔH＜0。降低温度时平衡向放热的正反应方向移动，平衡常数增大，不是减小，A错误。\nB．反应①的K₁＝c(O₂)c([O])/c(O₃)，反应②的K₂＝c²(O₂)/[c([O])c(O₃)]；两反应相加得到总反应，所以K＝K₁K₂，不是K₁＋K₂，B错误。\nC．反应①为吸热反应，温度升高时平衡正向移动，c([O])增大，臭氧消毒效率提高，C正确。\nD．平衡常数只与温度有关。温度不变时改变压强，K₂不变，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"O3 是一种很好的消毒剂，具有高效、洁净、方便、经济等优点。O3 可溶于水，\n在水中易分解，产生的[O]为游离氧原子，有很强的杀菌消毒能力。常温常压下发\n生的反应如下；\n反应①\nO3\nO2＋[O]\nΔH>0\n平衡常数为K1；\n反应②\n[O]＋O3\n2O2\nΔH<0\n平衡常数为K2；\n总反应：2O3\n3O2\nΔH<0\n平衡常数为K。\n下列叙述正确的是(\n)\nA.降低温度，总反应K 减小\nB.K＝K1＋K2\nC.适当升温，可提高消毒效率\nD.压强增大，K2 减小","expected_options":["降低温度，总反应K 减小","K＝K1＋K2","适当升温，可提高消毒效率","压强增大，K2 减小"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"adfbf7b0d9b61afa6787869baa0ece8d9408b0e4094b1e0d30f822f4cc08a91a","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/d5d7a34ffad0f0c0/24d1cbb4fce8e1b7e1bd9d180ad7b5ad/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题题面","sha256":"83769566b9e9e4729f9f108da6a8528d771f337ff2bdbbd3f28b68885598b639","width":1055,"height":521},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/d5d7a34ffad0f0c0/24d1cbb4fce8e1b7e1bd9d180ad7b5ad/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题解析","sha256":"634a11a8b48f039079a24fe2ef6f369aadcf9c9fdbc74dd408e62abc8322917e","width":1055,"height":377}],"question_asset_sha256":"83769566b9e9e4729f9f108da6a8528d771f337ff2bdbbd3f28b68885598b639","analysis_asset_sha256":"634a11a8b48f039079a24fe2ef6f369aadcf9c9fdbc74dd408e62abc8322917e","expected_revision_token":"19dca0b821a7732b838b74b0af2149d9393edd26443ce204859bdce0a9dce752","expected_item_sha256":"65e5497a79b48793487f96fd440fff7afddc3c98ee4efad792aab5326694b97a","source_pdf_sha256":