","expected_explanation_sha256":"592efa64d445d0382269f811a65415a2710e24ecd2378a51c2c603ca662a5c44","expected_explanation":"A．K₁随温度升高而增大，说明反应①吸热，a＞0，A正确。\nB．反应②前后气体物质的量相等，改变压强不使平衡移动；温度不变时K₂也不变，B错误。\nC．加入CO会使反应①正向移动，但温度不变，K₁不变，C错误。\nD．K₂随温度升高而减小，说明反应②放热，b＜0；结合a＞0可得a＞b，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"设反应①Fe(s)＋CO2(g)\nFeO(s)＋CO(g)\nΔH＝a kJ/mol，反\n应②Fe(s)＋H2O(g)\nFeO(s)＋H2(g)\nΔH＝b kJ/mol，以上两反应的平衡常数分\n别为K1 和K2，在不同温度下，K1、K2 的值如下，下列有关叙述正确的是(\n)\nT/K\nK1\nK2\n973\n1.47\n2.38\n1 173\n2.15\n1.67\nA.b＞0\nB.在973 K 下增大压强，K2 增大\nC.在1 173 K 下，反应①平衡后再充入CO2，平衡正向移动，K1 增大\nD.a＞b","expected_options":["b＞0","在973 K 下增大压强，K2 增大","在1 173 K 下，反应①平衡后再充入CO2，平衡正向移动，K1 增大","a＞b"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"f295b32735f86d16180739a6e78d9bc2ec9f499b95ff5eb9cf9373a7fca15dfa","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/d27f4f97d81bd86b/d25ea3eedc6f20a5d037d3d23134711c/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题题面","sha256":"cbdb41ce5bcf9ac774a361384c809c97bd58e6ff4f156a97944904540bab1ac2","width":1055,"height":479},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/d27f4f97d81bd86b/d25ea3eedc6f20a5d037d3d23134711c/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题解析","sha256":"05afd4bf0381caabfcaa595f69a80cbd721d46f463c4a4abbd61c556a912e6be","width":1055,"height":287}],"question_asset_sha256":"cbdb41ce5bcf9ac774a361384c809c97bd58e6ff4f156a97944904540bab1ac2","analysis_asset_sha256":"05afd4bf0381caabfcaa595f69a80cbd721d46f463c4a4abbd61c556a912e6be","expected_revision_token":"07048d241a5ebf7af303405e0c2acf9e017ad07a5e0e5bdc789290a6bbe99e2e","expected_item_sha256":"b1d557aaf78d9a8fc0425a3e0e48a60a915ab54b4624e149a5daa35c8c0b3693","source_pdf_sha256":"20fdf23de600d8ff8a303d11ebf354b9a39a9fde53900e011de9ad5eecf67579","question_png_sha256":"3f45f40958fbb7326b607bf9bc85390ee9e32400506d0984a50cd658742e8d80","analysis_png_sha256":"5af948509a0bb3bc16e887f9c315f585de2637207a75f5025ca9f0a6c7e24253"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_K-d4a7