stion_image","path":"h2orig/6c3790c0d4137548/395797281197eab231eb6e6291466bf9/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题题面","sha256":"ed52ea66d5015b16597d47cc9d992b38fb414427f08d94eb3be5023a33e0866c","width":1055,"height":241},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/6c3790c0d4137548/395797281197eab231eb6e6291466bf9/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题解析","sha256":"53992f756542011cbce3f48c1f2d32776a06e67c0854eae88609844e90478df2","width":1055,"height":311}],"question_asset_sha256":"ed52ea66d5015b16597d47cc9d992b38fb414427f08d94eb3be5023a33e0866c","analysis_asset_sha256":"53992f756542011cbce3f48c1f2d32776a06e67c0854eae88609844e90478df2","expected_revision_token":"97dfb7414ef4ff5bb9bf46223cd05b02c63a3e083ff70f8de023e1c74236c23c","expected_item_sha256":"16f7db5a813792b5c480c4c8d58a2bd37901af1873175e588a444f338e9a75ec","source_pdf_sha256":"20fdf23de600d8ff8a303d11ebf354b9a39a9fde53900e011de9ad5eecf67579","question_png_sha256":"701d367d28e0a0e84258809d8b23e68dc7d156c854a20822e73cf937c7e9367c","analysis_png_sha256":"bcf09633b97b45b4d07b8ef6cc0fc534077e85ddc82cb9f1a3486b97b86f7176"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_K-e836ec1204d395f1","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_K-e836ec1204d395f1","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_K","old_question_id":"QH2O_9DEBCD55855C191E_B870BEB3D7C60FF3_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_9DEBCD55855C191E_5D8DC26C7FA6C28E_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"d3874daf7803430bceec1e4eaac19358f8c645a72360746c5f9bd69b27b7de2b","expected_explanation_sha256":"783801010e0be98fb8c0bb6eb46d7e00b3b5557d1ef31c586d87104246ab7694","expected_explanation":"A．反应CO(g)＋2H₂(g)⇌CH₃OH(g)的平衡常数K＝c(CH₃OH)/[c(CO)c²(H₂)]，选项漏写c(H₂)的平方，A错误。\nB．曲线在T₂时先达到平衡，说明T₂＞T₁；由T₂降至T₁后CH₃OH的物质的量增加，故K₁＞K₂，不是K₁＜K₂，B错误。\nC．降低温度时平衡向生成CH₃OH的方向移动，说明正反应放热，不是吸热，C错误。\nD．状态A由T₁升至T₂时平衡逆向移动，c(H₂)增大、c(CH₃OH)减小，所以c(H₂)/c(CH₃OH)增大，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"在恒容密闭容器中，由CO 合成甲醇：CO(g)＋2H2(g)\nCH3OH(g)，在其他条\n件不变的情况下研究温度对反应的影响，实验结果如图所示，下列说法正确的是\n(\n)\nA.平衡常数K＝\nc（CH3OH）\nc（CO）·c（H2）\nB.该反应在T1 时的平衡常数比T2 时的小\nC.CO 合成甲醇的反应为吸热反应\n增大\nD.处于A 点的反应体系从T1 变到T2，达到平衡时\nc（H2）\nc（CH3OH）","expected_options":["平衡常数K＝ c（CH3OH） c（CO）·c（H2）","该反应在T1 时的平衡常数比T2 时的小","CO 合成甲醇的反应为吸热反应 增大","处于A 点的反应体系从T1 变到T2，达到平衡时 c（H2） c（CH3OH）"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"da0301fe1075ceb47b980ab2bd1cab75c251eabf839b2e3f6599f8a8e5a5fd44","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/9debcd55855c191e/6132224bda5ed7dd24d7425e67078844/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题题面","sha256":"e1d5e5685a206b98496a02f804cc13960dfd57bd993686ef37807fedb5980b75","width":1055,"height":422},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/9debcd55855c191e/6132224bda5ed7dd24d7425e67078844/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题解析","sha256":"c8d37b62e8f8f573a0a4cc94d2624ab9dee3eb6b4dc6a641e3b85c0fb0a74273","width":1055,"height":468}],"question_asset_sha256":"e1d5e5685a206b98496a02f804cc13960dfd57bd993686ef37807fedb5980b75","analysis_asset_sha256":"c8d37b62e8f8f573a0a4cc94d2624ab9dee3eb6b4dc6a641e3b85c0fb0a74273","expected_revision_token":"9eb124ee26b1ef0da11c4896cc9cf46eae2f969c22de80b5529ead8b686240be","expected_item_sha256":"d9c6bc00993797f1db741c3aa0f35c9e2bb10719962396a2bfe83b2b8cb5c84e","source_pdf_sha256":"20fdf23de600d8ff8a303d11ebf354b9a39a9fde53900e011de9ad5eecf67579","question_png_sha256":"101e6606deb57e9b82748c671ca210371d5ebce24b070b1d494e1b2cffb1fda3","analysis_png_sha256":"e833d27847d0475f0db534b23de76e28e34bda3d42ba12ff918a2c343f61be7e"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_K-ee0500687634fd6c","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_K-ee0500687634fd6c","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_K","old_question_id":"QH2O_88AF4B3C503C374B_4305FB02B0415AAB_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_88AF4B3C503C374B_E5001A53FA7D9DA1_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"1ae50ee347fa3472548a1a837b16f9d8059267d722bdb697e239b1db305e70ad","expected_explanation_sha256":"4069424960c01976d915ce27f36feb9231354ad77f6f6e756dc72df46784b112","expected_explanation":"A．该反应的ΔS＜0，且在一定条件下能自发进行，可判断ΔH＜0；升高温度时平衡逆向移动，HCl的平衡转化率降低，A错误。\nB．平衡常数只与温度有关。同温度下改变HCl和O₂的投料比，K不变，B错误。\nC．达到平衡时正、逆反应速率相等；单位时间内断裂H—Cl键与形成H—O键的物质的量相等，可作为达到平衡的判据，C正确。\nD．H₂O为气体，应写入平衡常数，正确表达式为K＝c²(Cl₂)c²(H₂O)/[c⁴(HCl)c(O₂)]，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"Cl2 可用于生产漂白粉等化工产品。Cl2 的制备方法有：\n方法Ⅰ\nNaClO＋2HCl(浓)===NaCl＋Cl2↑＋H2O；\n－1\n方法Ⅱ\n4HCl(g)＋O2(g)===2H2O(g)＋2Cl2(g)\nΔH＝a kJ·mol\n上述两种方法涉及的反应在一定条件下均能自发进行。一定条件下，在密闭容器\n中利用方法Ⅱ制备Cl2，下列有关说法正确的是(\n)\nA.升高温度，可以提高HCl 的平衡转化率\n，该反应的平衡常数增大\nB.提高n（HCl）\nn（O2）\nC.若断开1 mol H—Cl 键的同时有1 mol H—O 键断开，则表明该反应达到平衡状\n态\nD.该反应的平衡常数表达式K＝\nc2（Cl2）\nc4（HCl）·c（O2）","expected_options":["升高温度，可以提高HCl 的平衡转化率 ，该反应的平衡常数增大","提高n（HCl） n（O2）","若断开1 mol H—Cl 键的同时有1 mol H—O 键断开，则表明该反应达到平衡状 态","该反应的平衡常数表达式K＝ c2（Cl2） c4（HCl）·c（O2）"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"75e455c4df6f1afffeb9fd7b5df435e3ef001c4370941ad3b690c5af9641bcac","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/88af4b3c503c374b/1cb29a83736efa9253bf1e602cbec168/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题4原题题面","sha256":"b087845e30a180cdbe5eb33bddc4964f43dd340a2dc0ecf37ce4834f3c8a887e","width":1055,"height":562},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/88af4b3c503c374b/1cb29a83736efa9253bf1e602cbec168/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题4原题解析","sha256":"cba8db21885872e6cab208f5877e43ed54a6c63fb1afad6714e1671d1bcddad4","width":1055,"height":375}],"question_asset_sha256":"b087845e30a180cdbe5eb33bddc4964f43dd340a2dc0ecf37ce4834f3c8a887e","analysis_asset_sha256":"cba8db21885872e6cab208f5877e43ed54a6c63fb1afad6714e1671d1bcddad4","expected_revision_token":"2fa8f1959145e8215d5e070ef9c6622ba8f30380dc54c800c4a7be5a8c4fae41","expected_item_sha256":"184941ef8db84d8a15eaeade13b8d4beb7bccbb127be158d07f837c7a8a6b777","source_pdf_sha256":"20fdf23de600d8ff8a303d11ebf354b9a39a9fde53900e011de9ad5eecf67579","question_png_sha256":"27ae4ad076252d024e2c23c624955ea33a3323f9139b41b409f9f28538220bfe","analysis_png_sha256":"da2e18957f32659c7b8634efab70cbe69063d082416c6ff95b1815e9e073e12f"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_K-f582cc7bfbe7c4ff","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_K-f582cc7bfbe7c4ff","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_K","old_question_id":"QH2O_2ABDE1435EBDBF4C_69D002865067A5C9_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_2ABDE1435EBDBF4C_FDB1DB9F48CD24B6_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"646d03dc5e7e3f80360187e87efc75ed11ca04d60d585ed988d8da3c0e85a0f3","expected_explanation_sha256":"a680a03331a8e6812011ed2b8b6cca0d89381e38262a68d3fd6c00b3f96a9121","expected_explanation":"设反应①、②的反应进度分别为a mol、b mol。由题意得a－b＝1.7、a＋b＝4.5，解得a＝3.1、b＝1.4；平衡时n(N₂O₅)＝4.0－3.1＝0.9 mol。\nA．将平衡量代入反应①的表达式，结果不是该项数值，A错误。\nB．将平衡量代入反应①的表达式，结果不是该项数值，B错误。\nC．容器体积为1 L，K₁＝c(N₂O₃)c(O₂)/c(N₂O₅)＝1.7×4.5/0.9＝8.5，C正确。\nD．该项数值与计算所得K₁＝8.5不符，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"在1 L 密闭容器中，充入4 mol N2O5，加热到t ℃，发生如下反\n应：\n①N2O5(g)\nN2O3(g)＋O2(g)；\n②N2O3(g)\nN2O(g)＋O2(g)\n反应达到平衡时，测得N2O3 为1.7 mol，O2 为4.5 mol。则t ℃时反应①的化学平\n衡常数为(\n)\nA.1.9\nB.7.65\nC.8.5\nD.9.1","expected_options":["1.9","7.65","8.5","9.1"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"8ce279560dd287bf75ebbac690b4eeb903e87542158eeace386df78d0c38bc2c","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/2abde1435ebdbf4c/ef081e72b98f9eff3daae0b1faf90ddf/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题5原题题面","sha256":"b92473296c13f0a3359eba5cfff0508014208561e64d53842f00c72ae81ae1e6","width":1055,"height":380},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/2abde1435ebdbf4c/ef081e72b98f9eff3daae0b1faf90ddf/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题5原题解析","sha256":"3aefffab7e2d48b427992b8d89a3e0ca17acf8e6f09de6289796256be0cad6aa","width":1055,"height":531}],"question_asset_sha256":"b92473296c13f0a3359eba5cfff0508014208561e64d53842f00c72ae81ae1e6","analysis_asset_sha256":"3aefffab7e2d48b427992b8d89a3e0ca17acf8e6f09de6289796256be0cad6aa","expected_revision_token":"39a9380e8a7c7168a52e433185930646ef23aa231495b5241255deb64779086c","expected_item_sha256":"1ed260a852c38df0d2db5651094ead342c1cbc366e2675de3f1138c226b271a5","source_pdf_sha256":"20fdf23de600d8ff8a303d11ebf354b9a39a9fde53900e011de9ad5eecf67579","question_png_sha256":"a981d63dc007bd2045c445cb552dd9e2f0ec80df7f133b1f2807b0d82d32f617","analysis_png_sha256":"5c12511b4aee3d218fa9c31e29606aa7f27ae012413b326de18d74c64162a89a"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_KSP-08165f903559eb8d","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_KSP-08165f903559eb8d","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_KSP","old_question_id":"QH2O_55C122F287064CD6_391DE0AA7167F575_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_55C122F287064CD6_C4FEE41431A269D5_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"940bd3dcec8f64e0d5dbf36afdf77aa3cc2a22a27118f3c53c9c1298b404a7d3","expected_explanation_sha256":"be8b9791756c9d1f304ae60e3c84e36c5462f4d1fbcbbfc92db9f5c4a74ef234","expected_explanation":"A．Zn²⁺水解可促进水的电离，但温度不变时K_w不变，因此题给说法整体错误，A错误。\nB．电荷守恒应为2c(Zn²⁺)＋c(H⁺)＝c(OH⁻)＋2c(SO₄²⁻)，题式漏写两个系数2，B错误。\nC．混合后c(SO₄²⁻)＝0.050 mol·L⁻¹、c(Ag⁺)＝0.010 mol·L⁻¹，Q＝c²(Ag⁺)c(SO₄²⁻)＝5.0×10⁻⁶＜K_sp(Ag₂SO₄)，不生成沉淀，C错误。\nD．以c(Zn²⁺)＜1.0×10⁻⁵ mol·L⁻¹作为沉淀完全标准，需c(OH⁻)≥1.0×10⁻⁶ mol·L⁻¹，即pH≥8，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"硫酸锌是制造锌钡白和锌盐的主要原料，也可用作印染媒染剂，医药上用于催\n－5，则下列\n吐剂。已知25 ℃时，Ksp[Zn(OH)2]＝1.0×10\n－17，Ksp(Ag2SO4)＝1.2×10\n说法正确的是(\n)\nA.在水中加入少量ZnSO4 固体时，水的电离平衡向正反应方向移动，Kw 变大\nB.在ZnSO4 溶液中各离子的浓度关系为c(Zn2＋)＋c(H\n＋)＝c(OH\n－)＋c(SO2－\n4 )\nC.在0.5 L 0.10 mol·L\n－1的ZnSO4溶液中加入等体积的0.02 mol·L\n－1的AgNO3溶液，\n即可生成Ag2SO4 沉淀\nD.常温下，要除去0.20 mol·L\n－1 ZnSO4 溶液中的Zn2＋，至少要调节pH≥8","expected_options":["在水中加入少量ZnSO4 固体时，水的电离平衡向正反应方向移动，Kw 变大","在ZnSO4 溶液中各离子的浓度关系为c(Zn2＋)＋c(H ＋)＝c(OH －)＋c(SO2－ 4 )","在0.5 L 0.10 mol·L －1的ZnSO4溶液中加入等体积的0.02 mol·L －1的AgNO3溶液， 即可生成Ag2SO4 沉淀","常温下，要除去0.20 mol·L －1 ZnSO4 溶液中的Zn2＋，至少要调节pH≥8"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"40bb92a592045bed274532d78b844f59f50c756a6e763bba4794b64937aa8b07","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_r