法正确的是(\n)\nA.图中a、b 两点c(Ag\n＋)相同\nB.把a 点的溶液加热蒸发掉一部分水，恢复到室温，可得到b 点的溶液\n－5\nC.该温度下，Ag2SO4 溶度积的数量级为10\nD.在c 点的溶液中加入少量Na2SO4 固体，溶液可变为a 点","expected_options":["图中a、b 两点c(Ag ＋)相同","把a 点的溶液加热蒸发掉一部分水，恢复到室温，可得到b 点的溶液 －5","该温度下，Ag2SO4 溶度积的数量级为10","在c 点的溶液中加入少量Na2SO4 固体，溶液可变为a 点"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"c9a4e70bc94151f6dfbc10e9b98ce30ae7c6e5cec557c93a23f24c4ac05c3963","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/3b2aaf80cfab722b/1d1c61672bbc44e906d40b851a507b59/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题题面","sha256":"a5b8e686f227ae43a92097dc611653ff3f8b4bf619ea46e66edaff3d385e65be","width":1055,"height":537},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/3b2aaf80cfab722b/1d1c61672bbc44e906d40b851a507b59/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题解析","sha256":"aeb30c2df9a6e6010f7607cd6b70a7496ed71e688ee417866345959a4add5039","width":1055,"height":2916}],"question_asset_sha256":"a5b8e686f227ae43a92097dc611653ff3f8b4bf619ea46e66edaff3d385e65be","analysis_asset_sha256":"aeb30c2df9a6e6010f7607cd6b70a7496ed71e688ee417866345959a4add5039","expected_revision_token":"2d7459fa70b9be48b2a0cb7e2444eee46ab155fca39fda4619e529b97d5e629a","expected_item_sha256":"e129a55f6f47f6a02adaeb2942bb1f4f43a28f3d860f4e9dadcb78b714ab597b","source_pdf_sha256":"d5a917a12bd0b03b1967abf1b9f94377527054e17c51e83733c7ae5f70ed7062","question_png_sha256":"8d7f228e3f9f1bd7f40253ab6ba3d6b8c5b8e183c5a6eb11ccf85838927114a8","analysis_png_sha256":"c4ded95ee37c3d4aefacf586fdf99028cbc8a4edee1c96432972c0bfc9415d6f"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_KSP-28fc1e1f10f20487","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_KSP-28fc1e1f10f20487","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_KSP","old_question_id":"QH2O_A4CD5D690BCCAA91_A0AB93855D478155_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_A4CD5D690BCCAA91_69826ACFB5B7DA70_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"31d8c1e31571036238c0205ff6714cf6f43c447d26433f0dd1b69418985c7a74","expected_explanation_sha256":"36c381467d2d3a0e4e7355e96c5a99e24ff2f9c70362e42e4b6752f6cb015b38","expected_explanation":"A．升温时K_w增大，且Na₂CO₃水解加深，c(OH⁻)不是减小，A错误。\nB．CaSO₄能转化为CaCO₃，说明在该条件下CaCO₃更难溶，应有K_sp(CaCO₃)＜K_sp(CaSO₄)，B错误。\nC．CaCO₃与盐酸反应生成可溶性盐、H₂O和CO₂，而CaSO₄与盐酸不满足相应复分解反应条件；这不是由硫酸和盐酸的酸性强弱决定的，C错误。\nD．沉淀转化的离子方程式为CO₃²⁻(aq)＋CaSO₄(s)⇌CaCO₃(s)＋SO₄²⁻(aq)，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"往锅炉注入Na2CO3 溶液浸泡，将水垢中的CaSO4 转化为CaCO3，再用盐酸去\n除，下列叙述中正确的是(\n)\nA.温度升高，Na2CO3 溶液的KW 增大，c(OH\n－)减小\nB.CaSO4 能转化为CaCO3，说明Ksp(CaCO3)＞Ksp(CaSO4)\nC.CaCO3 溶解于盐酸而CaSO4 不溶，是因为硫酸酸性强于盐酸\nD.沉淀转化的离子方程式为CO2－\n3 (aq)＋CaSO4(s)\nCaCO3(s)＋SO2－\n4 (aq)","expected_options":["温度升高，Na2CO3 溶液的KW 增大，c(OH －)减小","CaSO4 能转化为CaCO3，说明Ksp(CaCO3)＞Ksp(CaSO4)","CaCO3 溶解于盐酸而CaSO4 不溶，是因为硫酸酸性强于盐酸","沉淀转化的离子方程式为CO2－ 3 (aq)＋CaSO4(s) CaCO3(s)＋SO2－ 4 (aq)"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"65e1cdc79ef05eeb11026a122c16a3e504786511536599cd40011470048d55ff","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/a4cd5d690bccaa91/8d48cebd2df62c86901b192e8eb16832/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题题面","sha256":"9e70108f1bc5d442d34d4087ff67c1eadb283721664dc9fceba23ef5c9681d44","width":1055,"height":289},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/a4cd5d690bccaa91/8d48cebd2df62c86901b192e8eb16832/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题解析","sha256":"a16e529cb6d90f0d6372e49ad430d3cc6880fce473a5fd288587465a66721281","width":1055,"height":291}],"question_asset_sha256":"9e70108f1bc5d442d34d4087ff67c1eadb283721664dc9fceba23ef5c9681d44","analysis_asset_sha256":"a16e529cb6d90f0d6372e49ad430d3cc6880fce473a5fd288587465a66721281","expected_revision_token":"66bd05f0cdc200d34b55b93edfd34b418c25711fb7d14bf2de4c0372a716547e","expected_item_sha256":"f6c0abdd177038fe527fd232350ce1168b27d82c6a38fca59f6f5753c5e96180","source_pdf_sha256":"d5a917a12bd0b03b1967abf1b9f94377527054e17c51e83733c7ae5f70ed7062","question_png_sha256":"4507b8bf8dec45e0816456a91a581397a31ef6758b57a8759773fd08717dbefe","analysis_png_sha256":"4182ce47c91d5a4ce8330fddab946e12a725a3ea0c8058f2f067eb98b2e6156d"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_KSP-3fd8df6af34c0d96","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_KSP-3fd8df6af34c0d96","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_KSP","old_question_id":"QH2O_F4526B0AF6EC6334_68920834BB878A85_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_F4526B0AF6EC6334_1908301216B28E1F_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":1,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"c12e91a1c6a5846c1f2778bbe0557837017e380f4408a878f79c7281fe015063","expected_explanation_sha256":"ec187aae5df563dd484edfb089868cf4b669846968b39ad1ec3647376c1adaeb","expected_explanation":"A．由图上c(CrO₄²⁻)＝10⁻⁶ mol·L⁻¹、c(Ag⁺)＝10⁻³ mol·L⁻¹，得K_sp(Ag₂CrO₄)＝c²(Ag⁺)c(CrO₄²⁻)＝1.0×10⁻¹²，A正确。\nB．加入K₂CrO₄使c(CrO₄²⁻)增大，平衡左移、c(Ag⁺)减小，不会使溶液由Y点移到X点，B错误。\nC．Cl⁻开始沉淀所需c(Ag⁺)＝2.0×10⁻⁸ mol·L⁻¹，而CrO₄²⁻开始沉淀所需c(Ag⁺)＝1.0×10⁻⁵ mol·L⁻¹，所以AgCl先沉淀，C正确。\nD．反应Ag₂CrO₄(s)＋2Cl⁻(aq)⇌2AgCl(s)＋CrO₄²⁻(aq)的K＝K_sp(Ag₂CrO₄)/K_sp²(AgCl)＝2.5×10⁷，D正确。\n故选B。","expected_stem":"已知：①t ℃时，AgCl 的Ksp＝2.0×10\n－10；②t ℃时，Ag2CrO4 在水中的沉淀溶\n解平衡曲线如图所示。下列说法不正确的是(\n)\n－12\nA.在t ℃时，Ag2CrO4 的Ksp 为1.0×10\nB.在饱和Ag2CrO4 溶液中加入K2CrO4 固体，可使溶液由Y 点到X 点\nC.在t ℃时，用0.01 mol·L\n－1 AgNO3 溶液滴定20.00 mL 0.01 mol·L\n－1 KCl 和0.01\n－先沉淀\nmol·L\n－1 K2CrO4 的混合溶液，Cl\nD.在t ℃时，反应Ag2CrO4(s)＋2Cl\n－(aq)\n2AgCl(s)＋CrO2－\n4 (aq)的平衡常数K＝\n2.5×107","expected_options":["在t ℃时，Ag2CrO4 的Ksp 为1.0×10","在饱和Ag2CrO4 溶液中加入K2CrO4 固体，可使溶液由Y 点到X 点","在t ℃时，用0.01 mol·L －1 AgNO3 溶液滴定20.00 mL 0.01 mol·L －1 KCl 和0.01 －先沉淀 mol·L －1 K2CrO4 的混合溶液，Cl","在t ℃时，反应Ag2CrO4(s)＋2Cl －(aq) 2AgCl(s)＋CrO2－ 4 (aq)的平衡常数K＝ 2.5×107"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"4831469009ab4872b26cbc7559fdef486f1ca3138d4b9a0214e9d3708a9f4893","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/f4526b0af6ec6334/57f5f00b2d6f2e2f9c5e0fdd9560f2fc/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题13原题题面","sha256":"582cb5eeef83907b2ecd140d95d6b8cde25ec745babdaf1ea9ee7ef1302fba1a","width":1055,"height":543},{"kind":"analysis_im