线 －10","该温度下BaSO4 的Ksp(BaSO4)值为1.0×10","加适量BaCl2 固体可使溶液由a 点变到b 点 －5.1 时两溶液中c（SO2－","c(Ba2＋)＝10 3 ） ＝10y2－y1 4 ） c（CO2－"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"7a1d08ad5e4f0ce4e497d667c28d203473c7fa9d182d2477b0fdc886938568ff","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/26655b77cbb72640/e829a8d5e471b3cf00573964ccb85667/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题题面","sha256":"6e5193ddb63675dd9601da7be23bd565ff1618e21ce43713389b4a2f876ba7d6","width":1055,"height":626},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/26655b77cbb72640/e829a8d5e471b3cf00573964ccb85667/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题解析","sha256":"17fd967a11d2159c6c9365dd5e996907a13c99a39636a01b072190b244e48f7f","width":1055,"height":517}],"question_asset_sha256":"6e5193ddb63675dd9601da7be23bd565ff1618e21ce43713389b4a2f876ba7d6","analysis_asset_sha256":"17fd967a11d2159c6c9365dd5e996907a13c99a39636a01b072190b244e48f7f","expected_revision_token":"e98b0fb8cc4ddedd06f2c4b82d07efcc925b5c6ba9c409e99c0d056eb84e7718","expected_item_sha256":"037183b6eafc446fa1d16229dd68391b702b76c434e7f3ef0b7310d96e5db448","source_pdf_sha256":"d5a917a12bd0b03b1967abf1b9f94377527054e17c51e83733c7ae5f70ed7062","question_png_sha256":"238147982b94142b731fdc65a5655300ef6229babd16c093db9369d023f6af52","analysis_png_sha256":"667dd8cd6e80c02f8a7f19434085cce101b905f15ea1ba9a06e45ac463a328be"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_KSP-6e3dbbefcfa43648","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_KSP-6e3dbbefcfa43648","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_KSP","old_question_id":"QH2O_0146BB707F5C7AE9_AC43B09E08EF19E3_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_0146BB707F5C7AE9_E4E3D24D4BED53C7_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"57d9ed999932542b445f5cc19fa4ad9d9850e61eb45e6278ce7eb9b3aa9ce2ea","expected_explanation_sha256":"dd4f212b4a36b915c35aaa0429698422b52ddc120f4fd12f969db42ae86299ca","expected_explanation":"A．①中的红色沉淀为Ag₂CrO₄，浊液中存在Ag₂CrO₄(s)⇌2Ag⁺(aq)＋CrO₄²⁻(aq)，A正确。\nB．②中氨水与Ag⁺形成[Ag(NH₃)₂]⁺，降低自由Ag⁺浓度并促使沉淀溶解，所以溶液先浑浊后澄清，B正确。\nC．③中加入KCl后生成白色AgCl沉淀，颜色变化说明有AgCl生成，C正确。\nD．实验中存在AgNO₃过量及Ag⁺络合等条件差异，不能仅凭③的白色沉淀证明AgCl比Ag₂CrO₄更难溶，D错误。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"为研究沉淀的生成及其转化，某小组进行如图实验。①中现象：产生红色沉淀，\n②中现象：溶液先浑浊，后来澄清，③中现象：产生白色沉淀。关于该实验的分\n析不正确的是(\n)\nA.①浊液中存在平衡：Ag2CrO4(s)\n2Ag\n＋(aq)＋CrO2－\n4 (aq)\nB.②中溶液变澄清的原因：AgOH＋2NH3·H2O===[Ag(NH3)2]OH＋2H2O\nC.③中颜色变化说明有AgCl 生成\nD.该实验可以证明AgCl 比Ag2CrO4 更难溶","expected_options":["①浊液中存在平衡：Ag2CrO4(s) 2Ag ＋(aq)＋CrO2－ 4 (aq)","②中溶液变澄清的原因：AgOH＋2NH3·H2O===[Ag(NH3)2]OH＋2H2O","③中颜色变化说明有AgCl 生成","该实验可以证明AgCl 比Ag2CrO4 更难溶"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"f0d2605857564b643e821a11c52e63444ef19284b12042afb33bd800b910a391","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/0146bb707f5c7ae9/1bb8cae274fb469835f858ff17f25cea/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题4原题题面","sha256":"b29c7e972839c3b38aeae8208ef0e55708a81ee4f89ca94ad3b3c2320631a219","width":1055,"height":341},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/0146bb707f5c7ae9/1bb8cae274fb469835f858ff17f25cea/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题4原题解析","sha256":"d383e29db50359e1b324bf920422beb48a9cc25c58571d2b8e8fdba525cb5e8e","width":1055,"height":1976}],"question_asset_sha256":"b29c7e972839c3b38aeae8208ef0e55708a81ee4f89ca94ad3b3c2320631a219","analysis_asset_sha256":"d383e29db50359e1b324bf920422beb48a9cc25c58571d2b8e8fdba525cb5e8e","expected_revision_token":"4cd5a7370e64015419bc13993cb7115b7868a773a0615adaf913c6720cfeb74f","expected_item_sha256":"ea0a9ba4b7610525b4a5152d78f579f2c3c9ff97b9670649759db0b7921feecf","source_pdf_sha256":"d5a917a12bd0b03b1967abf1b9f94377527054e17c51e83733c7ae5f70ed7062","question_png_sha256":"bb5ba1ef1d394f28db0521e8782aaa866eb1ea5de00062ebeade7bfe6a1e2ec7","analysis_png_sha256":"571d2cf50db1021c7b58dc9428ee666632f15449c2b187969f2449a549ee02d6"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_KSP-80290bf57ca90cd7","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_KSP-80290bf57ca90cd7","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_KSP","old_question_id":"QH2O_01004012C2BC2C04_BDFF3DFF5FB3BD13_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_01004012C2BC2C04_7F1599CAE62CFC19_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"604b11225c4c436a9a058cc99dcd716d1c9123f9fa70d1dad39909dc903ea29f","expected_explanation_sha256":"f0e334afd6bc9190741b1976ec2f41a22fbdda3828c99b5fd73b3a4d59c2586c","expected_explanation":"A．胃酸会消耗CO₃²⁻，使BaCO₃的溶解平衡向右移动并增大c(Ba²⁺)；不用BaCO₃不能只用两者K_sp大小解释，A错误。\nB．Na₂CO₃进入胃中会被胃酸消耗，不能稳定地把Ba²⁺转化为难溶物，因此不能代替Na₂SO₄，B错误。\nC．按题给判断标准，c(Ba²⁺)＝1.0×10⁻⁵ mol·L⁻¹很小，不能据此判定会引起钡离子中毒，C错误。\nD．用0.36 mol·L⁻¹ Na₂SO₄处理时，c(Ba²⁺)≈K_sp(BaSO₄)/c(SO₄²⁻)＝1.1×10⁻¹⁰/0.36≈3.06×10⁻¹⁰ mol·L⁻¹，可显著降低Ba²⁺浓度，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"可溶性钡盐有毒，医院中常用硫酸钡这种钡盐作为内服造影剂。医院抢救钡离\n子中毒患者时，除催吐外，还需要向中毒者胃中灌入硫酸钠溶液。已知：某温度\n下，Ksp(BaCO3)＝2.6×10\n－9；Ksp(BaSO4)＝1.1×10\n－10。下列推断正确的是(\n)\nA.不用碳酸钡作为内服造影剂，是因为Ksp(BaCO3)>Ksp(BaSO4)\nB.抢救钡离子中毒患者时，若没有硫酸钠，可以用碳酸钠溶液代替\n－1 的溶液时，会引起钡离子中毒\nC.若误饮c(Ba2＋)＝1.0×10\n－5 mol·L\nD.可以用0.36 mol·L\n－1 的Na2SO4 溶液给钡离子中毒患者洗胃","expected_options":["不用碳酸钡作为内服造影剂，是因为Ksp(BaCO3)>Ksp(BaSO4)","抢救钡离子中毒患者时，若没有硫酸钠，可以用碳酸钠溶液代替 －1 的溶液时，会引起钡离子中毒","若误饮c(Ba2＋)＝1.0×10 －5 mol·L","可以用0.36 mol·L －1 的Na2SO4 溶液给钡离子中毒患者洗胃"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"197fa1ade3f7fc9876be7adfddbfe79aeccc2c694e56469cb933253996666f84","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/01004012c2bc2c04/a1b676c26e16eef8ef7635cfca615839/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题题面","sha256":"cedacac3aef6f9a0fda9888ee36e697c9601936371b6ae47a9103b2b86ceb367","width":1055,"height":340},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/01004012c2bc2c04/a1b676c26e16eef8ef7635cfca615839/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题解析","sha256":"7ca60594ee9fefc6d6a6b29a28ef5ee238b351a9e535115ff4eb3a5950e1908a","width":1055,"height":471}],"question_asset_sha256":"cedacac3aef6f9a0fda9888ee36e697c9601936371b6ae47a9103b2b86ceb367","analysis_asset_sha256":"7ca60594