,"Hg2＋先沉淀","同时沉淀"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"9a7629a59a7212d3ae38aff651f8ea92c4c78c09a4d967d4ff138cf561a64240","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/6b24d403f1c9025e/0e068e68c63397cf7c29ec913430aef7/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题题面","sha256":"0044ed3128cc7b25a1a438d628b6f356505c21c4c1863dbe7a7bc95a16a98f93","width":1055,"height":337},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/6b24d403f1c9025e/0e068e68c63397cf7c29ec913430aef7/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题解析","sha256":"a5f243131d6df1fac3ad5590c06b330346862069c7b73b3e56fa9021e0421f44","width":1055,"height":194}],"question_asset_sha256":"0044ed3128cc7b25a1a438d628b6f356505c21c4c1863dbe7a7bc95a16a98f93","analysis_asset_sha256":"a5f243131d6df1fac3ad5590c06b330346862069c7b73b3e56fa9021e0421f44","expected_revision_token":"39a31e5b186743449b1526b03e1dddab45d9dee49fa59772c2d6a41f14c321d6","expected_item_sha256":"5a141a31a9792dde589b1d89b065c5379e69d88c2b5e3bc92178d8944268e1cb","source_pdf_sha256":"d5a917a12bd0b03b1967abf1b9f94377527054e17c51e83733c7ae5f70ed7062","question_png_sha256":"71606068a656f69f8ee6b7bcd7980cfd9f09165a61a8925b42f2f86c25f05192","analysis_png_sha256":"939efd1bfd5d9da26407e612b06bc3eb0eba045bad9739569b87c38ca3471bc5"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_KSP-88c0452e61f1cff7","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_KSP-88c0452e61f1cff7","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_KSP","old_question_id":"QH2O_7A17717CE5A2FBE7_5343731559D3579A_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_7A17717CE5A2FBE7_C025C38833355661_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":1,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"1805522138fea6a03c20099254d66e48a5b249d2d970ad2ef3823867f12b74b8","expected_explanation_sha256":"fd0d5d0d3c226e7d2ec1e1955800eaea0a9ba4012288b68e5777ba5333879cfe","expected_explanation":"A．由图得K_sp(PbCO₃)＝10^(-13.1)＝7.9×10⁻¹⁴，其数量级为10⁻¹⁴，A正确。\nB．p点对应PbI₂饱和体系，I⁻不水解；q点对应PbCO₃饱和体系，CO₃²⁻水解会促进水的电离，所以p点水的电离程度小于q点，B错误。\nC．PbI₂满足K_sp＝c(Pb²⁺)c²(I⁻)，其对数关系斜率绝对值更大，因此L₁对应－lgc(Pb²⁺)与－lgc(I⁻)的关系，C正确。\nD．向p点溶液加入Na₂CO₃浓溶液，可使离子积超过K_sp(PbCO₃)，生成白色PbCO₃沉淀，D正确。\n故选B。","expected_stem":"某些难溶性铅盐可用作涂料，如秦俑彩绘中使用的铅白(PbCO3)\n和黄金雨中黄色的PbI2。室温下，PbCO3 和PbI2 在不同的溶液中分别达到溶解平\n衡时－lg c(Pb2＋)与－lg c(CO2－\n3 )或－lg c(I\n－)的关系如图所示。下列说法中错误的是\n(\n)\n－14\nA.Ksp(PbCO3)的数量级为10\nB.相同条件下，水的电离程度p 点大于q 点\nC.L1 对应的是－lg c(Pb2＋)与－lg c(I\n－)的关系变化\nD.p 点溶液中加入Na2CO3 浓溶液，可得白色沉淀","expected_options":["Ksp(PbCO3)的数量级为10","相同条件下，水的电离程度p 点大于q 点","L1 对应的是－lg c(Pb2＋)与－lg c(I －)的关系变化","p 点溶液中加入Na2CO3 浓溶液，可得白色沉淀"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"0ca4f5d66a216c5b1bd0ffe5687b882e411207574a74dfcc1442ca7c2733bd0e","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/7a17717ce5a2fbe7/a14ddbfdb362106ddf1190c6af9337c4/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题10原题题面","sha256":"91efb3aaa907068f3b0eaafa45af2c951e56272358f27e890c6e386222230218","width":1055,"height":637},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/7a17717ce5a2fbe7/a14ddbfdb362106ddf1190c6af9337c4/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题10原题解析","sha256":"947f6bd36a25dfc54d72d1f3826ca0c4a2a0e17801fe6fd0b33565730d546f6b","width":1055,"height":522}],"question_asset_sha256":"91efb3aaa907068f3b0eaafa45af2c951e56272358f27e890c6e386222230218","analysis_asset_sha256":"947f6bd36a25dfc54d72d1f3826ca0c4a2a0e17801fe6fd0b33565730d546f6b","expected_revision_token":"47a8d7b2423a804af6fcf77ef8dc7bc36c7fcaf073c5a1d8a32ccaddb0878ccd","expected_item_sha256":"c645a3fd40daac0c4267d52cd097e8e41480df267c95498b942455624003474f","source_pdf_sha256":"d5a917a12bd0b03b1967abf1b9f94377527054e17c51e83733c7ae5f70ed7062","question_png_sha256":"4d21ede5c10e4ec3b6bf00cd783778c3d53bbc5ab975eb9959729f76e7864da5","analysis_png_sha256":"3a9b0e2f6dc1ad9a34f6f81d8e3f48561b350aacbbd4ab2c8fb3a95d50543efd"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_KSP-996f533bcd1e2bab","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_KSP-996f533bcd1e2bab","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_KSP","old_question_id":"QH2O_8CFC066F9