，但平衡左移使c(Pb²⁺)减小，并非两者都增大，A错误。\nB．温度不变，PbI₂的K_sp不变，B错误。\nC．I⁻是沉淀溶解平衡的生成物，增大c(I⁻)使平衡向左移动，不是向右，C错误。\nD．平衡左移后，溶液中c(Pb²⁺)减小，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"25 ℃时，在含有大量PbI2的饱和溶液中存在着平衡PbI2(s)\nPb2＋(aq)＋2I\n－(aq)，\n加入KI 固体，下列说法正确的是(\n)\n－的浓度都增大\nA.溶液中Pb2＋和I\nB.溶度积常数Ksp 增大\nC.沉淀溶解平衡向右移动\nD.溶液中Pb2＋的浓度减小","expected_options":["溶液中Pb2＋和I","溶度积常数Ksp 增大","沉淀溶解平衡向右移动","溶液中Pb2＋的浓度减小"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"2258913cac6aa2b167e826f599ec68ea3da937d9eef15109fc7f2682e44adfad","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/fff789ceeb03b064/bb925e15dc8073763223b507d8edb19e/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题题面","sha256":"1d65d87e8b9f9303a8171db8cd7a1c7b3d06dd0ae0ef038804c615ee5709633b","width":1055,"height":288},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/fff789ceeb03b064/bb925e15dc8073763223b507d8edb19e/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题解析","sha256":"3123656c8a92293ef53f377f7048aa691e639acdae87e7930cd465e38913556f","width":1055,"height":190}],"question_asset_sha256":"1d65d87e8b9f9303a8171db8cd7a1c7b3d06dd0ae0ef038804c615ee5709633b","analysis_asset_sha256":"3123656c8a92293ef53f377f7048aa691e639acdae87e7930cd465e38913556f","expected_revision_token":"f4f4b161615e3c51b7c1b78b2597b07e1227998efc26edf16df939778bc92579","expected_item_sha256":"bdd2552a1b076af73d35466ea77338308fe300950d635a719127be8a52258d9a","source_pdf_sha256":"d5a917a12bd0b03b1967abf1b9f94377527054e17c51e83733c7ae5f70ed7062","question_png_sha256":"8605ba27e21a094227eef500ac34dbacaffe6b19ed6b399afc0b01d02a2c67a8","analysis_png_sha256":"4edb132ffdfa820a3b9150b00b96690df576f190f92a2e99ebf89fbb447407ce"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_KSP-c8856280823eb158","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_KSP-c8856280823eb158","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_KSP","old_question_id":"QH2O_134D9416B1BDCB55_8DF0D7F5781F4DC8_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_134D9416B1BDCB55_56CBD9797789A614_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"dda38e558898608fdf3fbb9b99143c40814549e7296b90409dd4cd7d21553604","expected_explanation_sha256":"e0753a57a57602e82f5543970d16d120b0971da2f59ff1c073b5c3dd234892b0","expected_explanation":"A．只要使c(Ba²⁺)c(CO₃²⁻)＞K_sp(BaCO₃)，BaSO₄就可在Na₂CO₃溶液中转化为BaCO₃，因此“无法制备”错误，A错误。\nB．反应①由固体生成4 mol气体，体系混乱度增大，ΔS＞0，B错误。\nC．反应②正反应吸热，升高温度使平衡右移，BaS反应更完全，C正确。\nD．通入CO₂先生成BaCO₃沉淀和水，导电性减弱；CO₂过量后生成可溶性Ba(HCO₃)₂，导电性又增强，不是不断减弱，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"Ksp(BaCO3)＝2.6×10\n－9，Ksp(BaSO4)＝1.1×10\n－10。以BaSO4\n为原料制备BaCO3 一种方法的部分反应为：\n①BaSO4(s)＋4C(s)=====\n高温BaS(s)＋4CO(g)\n②2BaS(aq)＋2H2O(l)\nBa(HS)2(aq)＋Ba(OH)2(aq)\nΔH＞0\n③Ba(OH)2＋CO2===BaCO3↓＋H2O。\n下列说法正确的是(\n)\nA.用Na2CO3 溶液浸泡BaSO4，无法制备BaCO3\nB.反应①的ΔS＜0\nC.反应②中升高温度，能使BaS 反应更完全\nD.反应③中通入CO2 至过量，溶液的导电性不断减弱","expected_options":["用Na2CO3 溶液浸泡BaSO4，无法制备BaCO3","反应①的ΔS＜0","反应②中升高温度，能使BaS 反应更完全","反应③中通入CO2 至过量，溶液的导电性不断减弱"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"510cc731a5bb7362be63e013fb87ecf2b18c05e4b1229d17b1c97f83e9fa2a3b","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/134d9416b1bdcb55/e6c8e5df5da8614f71ae98f6b3ed6ce7/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题6原题题面","sha256":"bebc7e4378b99447c449a132fee0e39cff56c1d6b49aa2d3e3de5c5d14afddc7","width":1055,"height":496},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/134d9416b1bdcb55/e6c8e5df5da8614f71ae98f6b3ed6ce7/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题6原题解析","sha256":"4a673ec328b0b95f3b82a59d5bf6a60bb89c6f2e33b78954aac3fb639fdd8807","width":1055,"height":331}],"question_asset_sha256":"bebc7e4378b99447c449a132fee0e39cff56c1d6b49aa2d3e3de5c5d14afddc7","analysis_asset_sha256":"4a673ec328b0b95f3b82a59d5bf6a60bb89c6f2e33b78954aac3fb639fdd8807","expected_revision_token":"5ba0b3a1e9fd412f0ba5687a03a886bfb802e5764b2fc731a94febf2f36820f5","expected_item_sha256":"59d79e3fbdca57e64a4e1c4027b2ab0a4a30283c46da527c0f6f4307f1241503","source_pdf_sha256":"d5a917a12bd0b03b1967abf1b9f94377527054e17c51e83733c7ae5f70ed7062","question_png_sha25