)≈2.0×10"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"355f9b033b4c4e55574aee493e1228ba483c2b5ba4d9a7a07167cd709b3c1f59","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/8d760f334df4571b/67a12316f10c1588f72b6196d2cf4104/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题题面","sha256":"118fa8b8138e133132cc09a9bd44de918addf2378544d5c1eaf0a8cd9cca1182","width":1055,"height":552},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/8d760f334df4571b/67a12316f10c1588f72b6196d2cf4104/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题解析","sha256":"195989f5ff5100dbf667d243759ca83bee97ec6235af12f431127bfc2f11075a","width":1055,"height":1119}],"question_asset_sha256":"118fa8b8138e133132cc09a9bd44de918addf2378544d5c1eaf0a8cd9cca1182","analysis_asset_sha256":"195989f5ff5100dbf667d243759ca83bee97ec6235af12f431127bfc2f11075a","expected_revision_token":"322f4e87cc84e82afc4708607c099044ad13485e398f7f6e42d7888d77d3b821","expected_item_sha256":"158cd877649ac72261b54301d7f87dbb734722698c47237eb8422df881a26998","source_pdf_sha256":"d5a917a12bd0b03b1967abf1b9f94377527054e17c51e83733c7ae5f70ed7062","question_png_sha256":"41cb4a92acebc3e17fd415c5a024e1e08e2ba2c271c66d9546448148cbfb95fd","analysis_png_sha256":"a46a2d607f0ee640c8c69ede4a5c4f7810f0eb8f9ec9ceb4062b5452c1e6f624"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_KSP-d1272e9b4a3e6129","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_KSP-d1272e9b4a3e6129","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_KSP","old_question_id":"QH2O_7BE1521413577435_357E937BFDBDD5CD_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_7BE1521413577435_D9F2AF1DF0765FEA_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":0,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"9d4e1c784bb18feddb152f541e1f53d97d8ff0a624bce4f8d4e8ebb66c58013a","expected_explanation_sha256":"e98435495ecbf9e9ed9f6e14457265df54108460e6a967c29dba6867424c777b","expected_explanation":"A．硫化物使Pb²⁺形成PbS，其溶解度为1.84×10⁻¹⁴ g，在三种铅盐中最小，除铅最完全，A正确。\nB．PbSO₄的溶解度为1.03×10⁻⁴ g，明显大于PbS，硫酸盐不是最佳沉淀剂，B错误。\nC．PbCO₃的溶解度为1.81×10⁻⁷ g，也大于PbS，碳酸盐不是最佳沉淀剂，C错误。\nD．三种沉淀的溶解度相差很大，除Pb²⁺的效果不同，不能说均可作为最佳选择，D错误。\n故选A。","expected_stem":"要使工业废水中的Pb2＋沉淀，可用硫酸盐、碳酸盐、硫化物等作沉淀剂，已知\nPb2＋与这些离子形成的化合物的溶解度如下：\n化合物\nPbSO4\nPbCO3\nPbS\n溶解度/g\n1.03×10\n－4\n1.81×10\n－7\n1.84×10\n－14\n由上表中数据可知，沉淀剂最好选用(\n)\nA.硫化物\nB.硫酸盐\nC.碳酸盐\nD.以上沉淀剂均可","expected_options":["硫化物","硫酸盐","碳酸盐","以上沉淀剂均可"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"08e0555b5f0462f1a2b364272bf7072d03c4afedfabbe60e8f126a7bb6959536","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/7be1521413577435/8b44b4639575ed3d9eb8d59c4d613b0a/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题题面","sha256":"5448c24e6a1b58b7bc26f90698e58003e69d61dcc2bc6aa66f84346c29218b1e","width":1055,"height":431},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/7be1521413577435/8b44b4639575ed3d9eb8d59c4d613b0a/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题解析","sha256":"8f1fd59d7891ca2db2ead40b177186242bd81ae812d5460163008716dad40bb7","width":1055,"height":144}],"question_asset_sha256":"5448c24e6a1b58b7bc26f90698e58003e69d61dcc2bc6aa66f84346c29218b1e","analysis_asset_sha256":"8f1fd59d7891ca2db2ead40b177186242bd81ae812d5460163008716dad40bb7","expected_revision_token":"724f5c6ac51f410e02756d8bcbca58876187aa10bd7eb42de1d2ed31fe12bc76","expected_item_sha256":"93bac9b5a4789f96b1b5fc6608f0bc334f925b6533b709b746576cd936c89560","source_pdf_sha256":"d5a917a12bd0b03b1967abf1b9f94377527054e17c51e83733c7ae5f70ed7062","question_png_sha256":"4445f9448ac30ed34a7d818ad3c0439a65ea2427e4a4dad8d69c9ab57b3f18e4","analysis_png_sha256":"389f5e83273abf1988c0c024cbd5eb3014976b4fc3d713737deb1c108c10797b"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_KSP-d7671e6602e60723","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_KSP-d7671e6602e60723","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_KSP","old_question_id":"QH2O_6621D22478C6035B_B241DB233FFC0E67_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_6621D22478C6035B_3866A9B1AA91C0ED_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":1,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"fd94c282fec5c69337915f5281474327e0585f318a586d730e3bdc6337af1ae5","expected_explanation_sha256":"ba6b10acd6d21efd0e245dc13b6ae1ca29cbbb2319df1b1c336f6f1c662f71a1","expected_explanation":"A．AgCl浊液中存在AgCl(s)⇌Ag⁺(aq)＋Cl⁻(aq)，A正确。\nB．氨水能络合Ag⁺并溶解AgCl，但不能与试管上附着的银单质直接反应，所以不能据此用氨水洗银镜，B错误。\nC．加入氨水后AgCl浊液变澄清，说明NH₃与Ag⁺形成配离子的作用足以使AgCl溶解，C正确。\nD．加入浓硝酸后H⁺消耗NH₃·H₂O，配离子平衡逆向移动并释放Ag⁺，Ag⁺再与Cl⁻形成AgCl沉淀，D正确。\n故选B。","expected_stem":"向AgCl 浊液中滴加氨水后可得到澄清溶液，继续滴加浓硝酸后又有沉淀生成。\n经查资料得知：Ag\n＋＋2NH3·H2O\n[Ag(NH3)2]\n＋＋2H2O ，平衡常数记为\nK{[Ag(NH3)2]\n＋}，下列分析不正确的是(\n)\nA.浊液中存在溶解平衡：AgCl(s)\nAg\n＋(aq)＋Cl\n－(aq)\nB.实验表明实验室可用氨水洗涤附着有银的试管\n－强\nC.由实验可以判断：NH3 结合Ag\n＋的能力比Cl\nD.由资料信息可推知：加浓硝酸后生成的沉淀为AgCl","expected_options":["浊液中存在溶解平衡：AgCl(s) Ag ＋(aq)＋Cl －(aq)","实验表明实验室可用氨水洗涤附着有银的试管 －强","由实验可以判断：NH3 结合Ag ＋的能力比Cl","由资料信息可推知：加浓硝酸后生成的沉淀为AgCl"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"26ff496915fc19df6cab021caa0dbb10d8ee3446109c7bd80fd1f4cf6c760d2a","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/6621d22478c6035b/f167c5925b287305efd8082ea9f5f588/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题题面","sha256":"792611a33a5cf26b26fad3335e22e174d7e5b4d3ab3422d8570f1c07425f1cdd","width":1055,"height":334},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/6621d22478c6035b/f167c5925b287305efd8082ea9f5f588/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题解析","sha256":"1e201d4c972c2078085052d984d43cf3c86db601f35d795ea25ae9b1da06d1bf","width":1055,"height":334}],"question_asset_sha256":"792611a33a5cf26b26fad3335e22e174d7e5b4d3ab3422d8570f1c07425f1cdd","analysis_asset_sha256":"1e201d4c972c2078085052d984d43cf3c86db601f35d795ea25ae9b1da06d1bf","expected_revision_token":"af45daa242984344486fb619651f69a9ce715e56cd04a6446a04bf106a44c9e1","expected_item_sha256":"213360025967b91511e5a30e672fc7237263ef33009aa337f2e1f5c96d3fba7f","source_pdf_sha256":"d5a917a12bd0b03b1967abf1b9f94377527054e17c51e83733c7ae5f70ed7062","question_png_sha256":"c46b01ab75e79fc205f16eb5a3f6abb214a169cf28dcaba384ab5d841b96b29a","analysis_png_sha256":"10d8a54e53d038657c70c511635acdd34b6851f824480a39d7c73d6e6595dc4a"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_KSP-df4d55ae00bf6074","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_KSP-df4d55ae00bf6074","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_KSP","old_question_id":"QH2O_494D394CCF026091_3E780EFCF227EBE8_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_494D394CCF026091_954375A2E36C8132_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"f972903db1ffbfea80df8c22d2259309be620255a97137ac03e0a1b4153df901","expected_explanation_sha256":"7ebce0bf18780dddf5216d9207e6947b8dadf31d518efe31004036220b3c99c8","expected_explanation":"A．AgCl开始沉淀所需c(Ag⁺)＝1.56×10⁻⁷ mol·L⁻¹，小于Ag₂CrO₄开始沉淀所需的约3.35×10⁻⁵ mol·L⁻¹，因此AgCl先沉淀，A错误。\nB．等体积混合后c(Ag⁺)＝c(CrO₄²⁻)＝1.0×10⁻⁴ mol·L⁻¹，Q＝1.0×10⁻¹²＜1.12×10⁻¹²，不生成Ag₂CrO₄沉淀，B错误。\nC．盐酸既消耗CH₃COO⁻又提供Cl⁻，反应可写为CH₃COOAg(s)＋H⁺(aq)＋Cl⁻(aq)⇌CH₃COOH(aq)＋AgCl(s)，C正确。\nD．加入Ag₂S固体带来的Ag⁺产生同离子效应，使AgCl溶解平衡左移，AgCl溶解度不会增大，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"已知：298 K 时，物质的溶度积如表所示。\n化学式\nCH3COOAg\nAgCl\nAg2CrO4\nAg2S\nKsp\n2.3×10\n－3\n1.56×10\n－10\n1.12×10\n－12\n6.7×10\n－15\n下列说法正确的是(\n)\n－1\nA.将0.001 mol·L\n－1 的AgNO3溶液逐滴滴入0.001 mol·L\n－1的KCl 和0.001 mol·L\n的K2CrO4 的混合液中，则先产生Ag2CrO4 沉淀\n－1 的\nB.向2.0×10\n－4 mol·L\n－1 的K2CrO4 溶液中加入等体积的2.0×10\n－4 mol·L\nAgNO3 溶液，则有Ag2CrO4 沉淀生成(忽略混合时溶液体积的变化)\nC.向CH3COOAg 悬浊液中加入盐酸，发生反应的离子方程式为CH3COOAg(s)＋\nH\n＋(aq)＋Cl\n－(aq)\nCH3COOH(aq)＋AgCl(s)\nD.向AgCl 悬浊液中加入Ag2S 固体，AgCl 的溶解度增大","expected_options":["将0.001 mol·L －1 的AgNO3溶液逐滴滴入0.001 mol·L －1的KCl 和0.001 mol·L 的K2CrO4 的混合液中，则先产生Ag2CrO4 沉淀 －1 的","向2.0×10 －4 mol·L －1 的K2CrO4 溶液中加入等体积的2.0×10 －4 mol·L AgNO3 溶液，则有Ag2CrO4 沉淀生成(忽略混合时溶液体积的变化)","向CH3COOAg 悬浊液中加入盐酸，发生反应的离子方程式为CH3COOAg(s)＋ H ＋(aq)＋Cl －(aq) CH3COOH(aq)＋AgCl(s)","向AgCl 悬浊液中加入Ag2S 固体，AgCl 的溶解度增大"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"9dd95e3374171a92d6f15cb3c3e972249ca751a18682b974754e7a10d9d97684","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/494d394ccf026091/dbe3b428d6a8e05c90eeb43d8f25f6d2/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题9原题题面","sha256":"c2505585c9a54a984de0bf0865808f94cca0b270afa2971b8acce5d5252d2d5e","width":1055,"height":530},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/494d394ccf026091/dbe3b428d6a8e05c90eeb43d8f25f6d2/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题9原题解析","sha256":"4c5f6965a4d72dbf38d2c21faa08fbab04cac1d1088a82af8f4b8fb91fc899af","width":1055,"height":658}],"question_asset_sha256":"c2505585c9a54a984de0bf0865808f94cca0b270afa2971b8acce5d5252d2d5e","analysis_asset_sha256":"4c5f6965a4d72dbf38d2c21faa08fbab04cac1d1088a82af8f4b8fb91fc899af","expected_revision_token":"e1f510b67f2ef677c1665d9118939d019a47c35235c3cfab50914247e56c8579","expected_item_sha256":"b9a4f29a0d94185b8ec0d355b46fc40cdc1a0d3c9538526fad0a331670b15165","source_pdf_sha256":"d5a917a12bd0b03b1967abf1b9f94377527054e17c51e83733c7ae5f70ed7062","question_png_sha256":"27627777b96974efe243e50967837713431446ce8919c8db7226b24a1d014cbe","analysis_png_sha256":"12fc206943607ad90cf6025d289dcdd6d55debc437f2272d62edf615c3ca6212"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_KSP-e080bdcd70c58ebf","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_KSP-e080bdcd70c58ebf","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_KSP","old_question_id":"QH2O_90921159C5A3B655_A77C5572D91322CF_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_90921159C5A3B655_3A3D4850126383B5_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"77604aaf5fe9d3bfe64d80e05db1a3f10c52a4bc5c835f1ac411f292b653ff2c","expected_explanation_sha256":"48fc3627d42f61e2209aa014e0afdfed53929c365f27647bc360ca307be74f1a","expected_explanation":"A．KCl、KI在混合液中的实际浓度未知，黄色沉淀现象不能单独作为比较K_sp(AgCl)与K_sp(AgI)的充分证据，A错误。\nB．AgCl与Ag₂CrO₄的组成类型不同，不能仅由沉淀转化现象直接比较两个K_sp数值大小，B错误。\nC．若KCl浓度足够大，AgBr悬浊液中可出现c(Ag⁺)·c(Cl⁻)＞K_sp(AgCl)，从而生成AgCl沉淀，C正确。\nD．等体积混合后c(Ag⁺)＝c(SO₄²⁻)＝0.010 mol·L⁻¹，Q＝c²(Ag⁺)c(SO₄²⁻)＝1.0×10⁻⁶＜1.4×10⁻⁵，不生成Ag₂SO₄沉淀，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"已知几种难溶电解质的溶度积常数Ksp(25 ℃)见表：\n难溶电解质\nAgCl\nAgBr\nAgI\nAg2SO4\nAg2CrO4\n8.5×10\n－\n1.4×10\n－\n1.12×10\n－\nKsp\n1.8×10\n－10\n5.4×10\n－\n13\n17\n5\n12\n下列叙述正确的是(\n)\nA.向2 mL KCl、KI 混合溶液中滴加2 滴0.01 mol·L\n－1 的AgNO3 溶液，振荡沉淀\n呈黄色，说明Ksp(AgCl)＞Ksp(AgI)\nB.向0.1 mol·L\n－1的Na2CrO4溶液中滴入AgNO3溶液至不再有砖红色沉淀(Ag2CrO4)\n产生，再滴加0.1 mol·L\n－1 的NaCl 溶液，砖红色沉淀逐渐转变为白色，说明\nKsp(AgCl)<Ksp(Ag2CrO4)\nC.向AgBr 的悬浊液中滴加KCl 溶液可能会生成AgCl 沉淀\nD.向100 mL 0.02 mol·L\n－1 的Na2SO4 溶液中加入100 mL 0.02 mol·L\n－1 的AgNO3 溶\n液，有白色沉淀生成","expected_options":["向2 mL KCl、KI 混合溶液中滴加2 滴0.01 mol·L －1 的AgNO3 溶液，振荡沉淀 呈黄色，说明Ksp(AgCl)＞Ksp(AgI)","向0.1 mol·L －1的Na2CrO4溶液中滴入AgNO3溶液至不再有砖红色沉淀(Ag2CrO4) 产生，再滴加0.1 mol·L －1 的NaCl 溶液，砖红色沉淀逐渐转变为白色，说明 Ksp(AgCl)<Ksp(Ag2CrO4)","向AgBr 的悬浊液中滴加KCl 溶液可能会生成AgCl 沉淀","向100 mL 0.02 mol·L －1 的Na2SO4 溶液中加入100 mL 0.02 mol·L －1 的AgNO3 溶 液，有白色沉淀生成"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"899f21626ad7f1b2494ba90aef16bbf8484292e7a37e41b97b22ece7db5c96d6","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/90921159c5a3b655/11f162228b904f4f09ffd38d9cea40c4/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题题面","sha256":"66f04460c1f5cc387aad63237eddb6114b05738a8cc5dab382368b02c379a484","width":1055,"height":608},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/90921159c5a3b655/11f162228b904f4f09ffd38d9cea40c4/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题解析","sha256":"74cce27e1086de0b3cb4eed7e234d32352deb4b47320df41a26256375ff89554","width":1055,"height":1432}],"question_asset_sha256":"66f04460c1f5cc387aad63237eddb6114b05738a8cc5dab382368b02c379a484","analysis_asset_sha256":"74cce27e1086de0b3cb4eed7e234d32352deb4b47320df41a26256375ff89554","expected_revision_token":"1101bfe1626742ca40ffca1d5ff9d8a859865731b2ac29d5be93dee3068d5d8f","expected_item_sha256":"2493592ed14b88bf438c2412ea8d3c51d0317b11355b36bd24058ccb558c497e","source_pdf_sha256":"d5a917a12bd0b03b1967abf1b9f94377527054e17c51e83733c7ae5f70ed7062","question_png_sha256":"28e5d11f2ce94585b96ff1d823cd80fc69dcca603803097b77a6de65f35b5755","analysis_png_sha256":"646adc1018f75126ea30555d6aadca25494a939f34b299c7ac460ae991a179e4"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_KSP-e6576766173912b1","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_KSP-e6576766173912b1","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_KSP","old_question_id":"QH2O_91F4E81406350839_67361F0BC65CF847_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_91F4E81406350839_C8C0BBAE1D46F9C6_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":0,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"2acb61193a423f8c6a23239b29c67db242baa899c34db37e2c3502c3467d2247","expected_explanation_sha256":"4987af213990751b5b2ca292cd4cbfbf502f81ece9543aaf053b9c83b23d332a","expected_explanation":"A．Fe(OH)₃开始沉淀所需c(OH⁻)＝[4.0×10⁻³⁸/0.01]^(1/3)≈1.6×10⁻¹² mol·L⁻¹，在四者中最小，因此Fe³⁺最先沉淀，A正确。\nB．Cr(OH)₃开始沉淀所需c(OH⁻)＝[7.0×10⁻³¹/0.01]^(1/3)≈4.1×10⁻¹⁰ mol·L⁻¹，大于Fe³⁺所需浓度，B错误。\nC．Zn(OH)₂开始沉淀所需c(OH⁻)＝[1.0×10⁻¹⁷/0.01]^(1/2)≈3.2×10⁻⁸ mol·L⁻¹，不是最小值，C错误。\nD．Mg(OH)₂开始沉淀所需c(OH⁻)＝[1.8×10⁻¹¹/0.01]^(1/2)≈4.2×10⁻⁵ mol·L⁻¹，不是最小值，D错误。\n故选A。","expected_stem":"在溶液中有浓度均为0.01 mol·L\n－1 的Fe3＋、Cr3＋、Zn2＋、Mg2＋\n－31，\n等离子。已知：25 ℃时，Ksp[Fe(OH)3]＝4.0×10\n－38，Ksp[Cr(OH)3]＝7.0×10\n－11。当向其中滴加氢氧化钠溶\nKsp[Zn(OH)2]＝1.0×10\n－17，Ksp[Mg(OH)2]＝1.8×10\n液时，最先沉淀的离子是(\n)\nA.Fe3＋\nB.Cr3＋\nC.Zn2＋\nD.Mg2＋","expected_options":["Fe3＋","Cr3＋","Zn2＋","Mg2＋"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"284760a952c537e73bcbb56bc1212f2791766000fdf920b964fd80c02229e1c1","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/91f4e81406350839/1a7f701e512c56f66f3482cd97a8f038/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题在溶液中有浓度均为0.01 mol·L原题题面","sha256":"42cb568a86a256e85c46ac815ef23d3993975a7df0e4d683ea2688962d86b56f","width":1055,"height":291},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/91f4e81406350839/1a7f701e512c56f66f3482cd97a8f038/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题在溶液中有浓度均为0.01 mol·L原题解析","sha256":"b9528e0460ddc82948cd1361678dfc8224ddb828a804b1aac523a089328ad0d6","width":1055,"height":3926}],"question_asset_sha256":"42cb568a86a256e85c46ac815ef23d3993975a7df0e4d683ea2688962d86b56f","analysis_asset_sha256":"b9528e0460ddc82948cd1361678dfc8224ddb828a804b1aac523a089328ad0d6","expected_revision_token":"c1fecbad6b36681b47bd4203ad0abf7b58e8cc5f7de9c7554c7290f5161201dc","expected_item_sha256":"a41be3da084038949fcbe7071b7aa8b446adb36e6a28b065daa29eeacee4e7e2","source_pdf_sha256":"d5a917a12bd0b03b1967abf1b9f94377527054e17c51e83733c7ae5f70ed7062","question_png_sha256":"9a3326289f58b8472e4db726e09bae08a31fdb988b9ec013394985f046766996","analysis_png_sha256":"3802e762b1ba59bf1feca54ab71bb830ce36df0a60c6f37991f71b6acc98413b"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_KSP-eae4f1294352abd6","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_KSP-eae4f1294352abd6","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_KSP","old_question_id":"QH2O_6CBB4B579596A800_39E214EC6611ABEB_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_6CBB4B579596A800_393563E213CF58A8_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"a042859e1fccc6167cacf758b3feffd4883fff61b2b5363e949de4fd367ce99d","expected_explanation_sha256":"126636730b07f3a60b8334fabd23702e5de8f567bd8fd703a91c157dd110f039","expected_explanation":"A．Mg(OH)₂虽难溶，仍存在少量溶解，所以过滤后的滤液中含少量Mg²⁺，A正确。\nB．浊液中有Mg(OH)₂固体和溶液，存在Mg(OH)₂(s)⇌Mg²⁺(aq)＋2OH⁻(aq)，B正确。\nC．实验②中原浊液含过量NaOH，加入FeCl₃可直接生成Fe(OH)₃，不能比较两种沉淀的难溶程度；实验③的沉淀转化才可作相应判断。因此“②和③均能说明”错误，C不正确。\nD．NH₄⁺能与OH⁻反应，降低c(OH⁻)，使Mg(OH)₂的溶解平衡向右移动，沉淀可溶解，D正确。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"某兴趣小组进行下列实验：\n①将0.1 mol·L\n－1 MgCl2 溶液和0.5 mol·L\n－1 NaOH 溶液等体积混合得到浊液\n②取少量①中浊液，滴加0.1 mol·L\n－1 FeCl3 溶液，出现红褐色沉淀\n③将①中浊液过滤，取少量白色沉淀，滴加0.1 mol·L\n－1 FeCl3 溶液，白色沉淀变\n为红褐色沉淀\n④另取少量白色沉淀，滴加饱和NH4Cl 溶液，沉淀溶解\n下列说法中不正确的是(\n)\nA.将①中所得浊液过滤，所得滤液中含少量Mg2＋\nB.①中浊液中存在沉淀溶解平衡：Mg(OH)2(s)\nMg2＋(aq)＋2OH\n－(aq)\nC.实验②和③均能说明Fe(OH)3 比Mg(OH)2 难溶\n＋\n4 可能是④中沉淀溶解的原因\nD.NH4Cl 溶液中的NH","expected_options":["将①中所得浊液过滤，所得滤液中含少量Mg2＋","①中浊液中存在沉淀溶解平衡：Mg(OH)2(s) Mg2＋(aq)＋2OH －(aq)","实验②和③均能说明Fe(OH)3 比Mg(OH)2 难溶 ＋ 4 可能是④中沉淀溶解的原因","NH4Cl 溶液中的NH"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"271cd9d0ee7e22cbf615509e2491826315627cdefd7a844e43ca99fdcee47499","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/6cbb4b579596a800/8656b820b84c2462904ce7e333e78949/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题5原题题面","sha256":"b4d06e08ef607a185c039c1b50e7c635a2da90bb5b4d08fd7a60f5351d8fbd1a","width":1055,"height":522},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/6cbb4b579596a800/8656b820b84c2462904ce7e333e78949/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题5原题解析","sha256":"5500c9cda4673ab829db8b013ee3c0b37c15cc53ce483d086193d32a383bfd98","width":1055,"height":428}],"question_asset_sha256":"b4d06e08ef607a185c039c1b50e7c635a2da90bb5b4d08fd7a60f5351d8fbd1a","analysis_asset_sha256":"5500c9cda4673ab829db8b013ee3c0b37c15cc53ce483d086193d32a383bfd98","expected_revision_token":"2ae064cc9916a4e8a4af13155efa1e55e801c702484cad3db97f76d0d1b8fda6","expected_item_sha256":"9e10ecdc9f72de5e7021d73b02aba43639dda61d08bd465f4eb6446fa12f2518","source_pdf_sha256":"d5a917a12bd0b03b1967abf1b9f94377527054e17c51e83733c7ae5f70ed7062","question_png_sha256":"b094b0ba25eb5bf7b14ada23aa56d6a61d54e4b85520a800718c90df0f4abb49","analysis_png_sha256":"e7709720bd17b217c8d919d1034ffebe0401d5e42d257b24b865abca3bb43bcd"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_KSP-fd703f7626cbe052","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_KSP-fd703f7626cbe052","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_KSP","old_question_id":"QH2O_9CE6440E11C05502_D6AF4DB8241F5CCF_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_9CE6440E11C05502_D01F34D997BCC309_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"7b7434ab55f818f639488983b1392e9d819c9f3b59d5e455e7519c1dd27b81b0","expected_explanation_sha256":"fd363a79c1cbc622ae0e8982edf130a7eb1931dd79a1232ae5a67c282b6e6227","expected_explanation":"A．终点加入25 mL AgNO₃时，c(Ag⁺)＝c(Cl⁻)＝10^(-4.75) mol·L⁻¹，所以K_sp(AgCl)＝10^(-9.5)，其数量级为10⁻¹⁰，A正确。\nB．曲线各点均表示有AgCl固体存在时的沉淀溶解平衡，满足c(Ag⁺)·c(Cl⁻)＝K_sp(AgCl)，B正确。\nC．Cl⁻初始浓度改为0.0400 mol·L⁻¹时，反应终点应消耗20 mL AgNO₃；图中a点对应约15 mL，终点不能由c移到a，C错误。\nD．改用等浓度Br⁻时终点消耗AgNO₃的体积不变；因K_sp(AgBr)更小，终点的卤离子浓度更低，终点由c向b方向移动，D正确。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"用0.100 mol·L\n－1 AgNO3滴定50.0 mL 0.050 0 mol·L\n－1 Cl\n滴定曲线如图所示。下列有关描述错误的是(\n)\n－10\nA.根据曲线数据计算可知Ksp(AgCl)的数量级为10\nB.曲线上各点的溶液满足关系式c(Ag\n＋)·c(Cl\n－)＝Ksp(AgCl)\nC.相同实验条件下，若改为0.040 0 mol·L\n－1 Cl\n－，反应终点c 移到a\nD.相同实验条件下，若改为0.050 0 mol·L\n－1 Br\n－，反应终点c 向b 方向移动","expected_options":["根据曲线数据计算可知Ksp(AgCl)的数量级为10","曲线上各点的溶液满足关系式c(Ag ＋)·c(Cl －)＝Ksp(AgCl)","相同实验条件下，若改为0.040 0 mol·L －1 Cl －，反应终点c 移到a","相同实验条件下，若改为0.050 0 mol·L －1 Br －，反应终点c 向b 方向移动"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"86699796aac9d90f95a7d15157af528fbb5f7925737e8672c9e9037df4ba787e","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/9ce6440e11c05502/128535251f6428234a112002c60e526e/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题4原题题面","sha256":"89788069aa9afc7a6054580c7951ee532b70014bc720b845dd9ff0c8c94a1461","width":1055,"height":545},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/9ce6440e11c05502/128535251f6428234a112002c60e526e/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题4原题解析","sha256":"98f64a8fbb2aae79ae87636f29a9d66ec97d558efe398ab9d4b86d06222bb0fa","width":1055,"height":480}],"question_asset_sha256":"89788069aa9afc7a6054580c7951ee532b70014bc720b845dd9ff0c8c94a1461","analysis_asset_sha256":"98f64a8fbb2aae79ae87636f29a9d66ec97d558efe398ab9d4b86d06222bb0fa","expected_revision_token":"27f59e22581f5d883712d0b271e0b39fd57e4be55a93d10908691c950d266124","expected_item_sha256":"ebd24df43e9b110d1c8d5556f68efa23af27fd9b543a3b276336678a07154f8e","source_pdf_sha256":"d5a917a12bd0b03b1967abf1b9f94377527054e17c51e83733c7ae5f70ed7062","question_png_sha256":"528f4077fd73f3933fe5f9329a5cf29d116a7f3942c2da19077dfa6d24962ba7","analysis_png_sha256":"a6ec9c8b7fdcdb9bb512acb941b2d310a47ad1133f181b582c279dbb82acaacf"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_PH_HYDRO-075658249dd1b47f","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_PH_HYDRO-075658249dd1b47f","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_PH_HYDRO","old_question_id":"QH2O_77C64D6A4DA5B552_6F410FF0B29C6C3F_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_77C64D6A4DA5B552_77E1A619362AE8F3_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":0,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"d30844aa44154a8300a6fdaefce23ddbee0a2fefb1189582f8ff6527335d67ad","expected_explanation_sha256":"d979c8417cae3c3664f70e9477282faa187c3937918cc3eddbefb656d3ddc205","expected_explanation":"A．a点为氯水，HCl完全电离而HClO部分电离，所以c(H⁺)＞c(Cl⁻)＞c(ClO⁻)，A正确。\nB．b点反应生成Na₂SO₄和HCl，pH＝2时c(H⁺)＝0.010 mol·L⁻¹，且c(Cl⁻)＝0.010 mol·L⁻¹、c(SO₄²⁻)＝0.005 mol·L⁻¹，二者不相等，B错误。\nC．c点溶液仍含Cl⁻，题给等式漏写该离子，C错误。\nD．d点pH＝7，电荷守恒还应包含HSO₃⁻，正确关系不等于题给式，D错误。\n故选A。","expected_stem":"常温下向某浓度的氯水中逐滴滴入Na2SO3 溶液，无气体逸出，溶液pH 变化如\n图所示。下列关系正确的是(\n)\nA.a 点：c(H\n＋)>c(Cl\n－)>(ClO\n－)\nB.b 点：c(Cl\n－)＝c(SO2－\n4 )＝0.005 mol·L\n－1\nC.c 点：c(Na\n＋)＝2c(HSO\n－\n3 )＋2c(SO2－\n3 )＋2c(SO2－\n4 )\nD.d 点：c(Na\n＋)＝c(Cl\n－)＋2c(SO2－\n3 )＋2c(SO2－\n4 )","expected_options":["a 点：c(H ＋)>c(Cl －)>(ClO －)","b 点：c(Cl －)＝c(SO2－ 4 )＝0.005 mol·L －1","c 点：c(Na ＋)＝2c(HSO － 3 )＋2c(SO2－ 3 )＋2c(SO2－ 4 )","d 点：c(Na ＋)＝c(Cl －)＋2c(SO2－ 3 )＋2c(SO2－ 4 )"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"80f19b7a9a1f7aa8e968872f57a22e17d1766ed8af0266cbe252ab2b8df7e96d","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/77c64d6a4da5b552/a01fc8f1c3fef28790b829b9f5ef5967/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题6原题题面","sha256":"836e3de0e72c3cbc1e6994fd0d100558d72882dc9c7954732ae8bbb3bc595e49","width":1055,"height":445},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/77c64d6a4da5b552/a01fc8f1c3fef28790b829b9f5ef5967/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题6原题解析","sha256":"09466ad42e101f072a24086b4ce026cde907aaeeff1d9a168aeca1a0e63570b7","width":1055,"height":486}],"question_asset_sha256":"836e3de0e72c3cbc1e6994fd0d100558d72882dc9c7954732ae8bbb3bc595e49","analysis_asset_sha256":"09466ad42e101f072a24086b4ce026cde907aaeeff1d9a168aeca1a0e63570b7","expected_revision_token":"2367535a01ec6defe0e8c2ea811740e2c1555bc564b09fec94252357977c1ddc","expected_item_sha256":"593f91c66ef6520da242b31c1d7da6c8d834e004de895e5f1a325da68ff4ce63","source_pdf_sha256":"c5bd2159a7716277d39ec6313506bb72dc520a64e3187fd2685e067ddd30fc76","question_png_sha256":"ad4975517a56eb42ee5a73b3f