明HA⁻的电离程度大于水解程度，所以c(A²⁻)＞c(H₂A)，C错误。\nD．c点为Na₂A溶液，其质子守恒为c(OH⁻)＝c(H⁺)＋c(HA⁻)＋2c(H₂A)，移项即得题给关系，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"25 ℃时，用0.1 mol·L\n－1 NaOH 溶液滴定20.00\nmL 0.1 mol·L\n－1 二元弱酸H2A(Ka1＝1.2×10\n－2，Ka2＝5.6×10\n－8)溶液，滴定过程中\n溶液的pH 变化曲线如图所示。下列说法正确的是(\n)\nA.溶液中水的电离程度：d 点>c 点>b 点>a 点\n－12\nB.Na2A 的水解平衡常数Kh1 约为1×10\nC.b 点溶液显酸性，其中c(H2A)>c(A2－)\nD.c 点溶液中c(HA\n－)＋2c(H2A)＝c(OH\n－)－c(H\n＋)","expected_options":["溶液中水的电离程度：d 点>c 点>b 点>a 点 －12","Na2A 的水解平衡常数Kh1 约为1×10","b 点溶液显酸性，其中c(H2A)>c(A2－)","c 点溶液中c(HA －)＋2c(H2A)＝c(OH －)－c(H ＋)"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"0b7406c2ed4412991123e1f1b7372ed951a0cbcc6a52c151d9175e40076ca664","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/2145ff03370b386c/92acf13716cfa0421eae5c81980ac93f/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题题面","sha256":"52991a66a2bd6d1d897d0965077e8cced7910fc94ef2cbb09c7e6a3797e38f80","width":1055,"height":560},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/2145ff03370b386c/92acf13716cfa0421eae5c81980ac93f/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题解析","sha256":"7d935c5afc2c2f0a203961823a755c45f45e2920aae2c9aefa02c6ea31a8fdf6","width":1055,"height":2616}],"question_asset_sha256":"52991a66a2bd6d1d897d0965077e8cced7910fc94ef2cbb09c7e6a3797e38f80","analysis_asset_sha256":"7d935c5afc2c2f0a203961823a755c45f45e2920aae2c9aefa02c6ea31a8fdf6","expected_revision_token":"780c9ebb3425588414ea658d27ccd90799aa27cd3241fd671315fe84261728a3","expected_item_sha256":"08587a5dd72971aecb21057f1d60f88eb00d95faeb87c694c6ce1498924775f1","source_pdf_sha256":"c5bd2159a7716277d39ec6313506bb72dc520a64e3187fd2685e067ddd30fc76","question_png_sha256":"237ddc72f22b5dd909c3590b0c428953a4305ff910ca7e50e2717858c4178934","analysis_png_sha256":"6b1ca7c98cb2c032c99e298d7a54a2561b758ea1cdb186b9ff50dcf76b4801b1"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_PH_HYDRO-328a64f7746417a8","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_PH_HYDRO-328a64f7746417a8","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_PH_HYDRO","old_quest