02a2db63a3e5ae8794393","expected_explanation":"A．点①含等物质的量CH₃COOH和CH₃COONa。结合物料守恒与电荷守恒可得c(CH₃COOH)＋2c(H⁺)＝c(CH₃COO⁻)＋2c(OH⁻)，题式少了系数2，A错误。\nB．点②pH＝7，c(H⁺)＝c(OH⁻)；由电荷守恒得c(Na⁺)＝c(CH₃COO⁻)，不是题给物料关系，B错误。\nC．点③主要溶质为CH₃COONa，粒子顺序为c(Na⁺)＞c(CH₃COO⁻)＞c(OH⁻)＞c(H⁺)，C错误。\nD．滴定初段可形成大量CH₃COOH和少量CH₃COONa的混合液，可能出现题给浓度顺序，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"常温下，用0.100 0 mol·L\n－1 NaOH 溶液滴定20.00 mL 0.100 0 mol·L\n1 CH3COOH 溶液所得滴定曲线如下图。下列说法正确的是(\n)\nA.点①所示溶液中：c(CH3COO\n－)＋c(OH\n－)＝c(CH3COOH)＋c(H\n＋)\nB.点②所示溶液中：c(Na\n＋)＝c(CH3COOH)＋c(CH3COO\n－)\nC.点③所示溶液中：c(Na\n＋)>c(OH\n－)>c(CH3COO\n－)>c(H\n＋)\nD.滴定过程中可能出现：c(CH3COOH)>c(CH3COO\n－)>c(H\n＋)>c(Na\n＋)>c(OH\n－)","expected_options":["点①所示溶液中：c(CH3COO －)＋c(OH －)＝c(CH3COOH)＋c(H ＋)","点②所示溶液中：c(Na ＋)＝c(CH3COOH)＋c(CH3COO －)","点③所示溶液中：c(Na ＋)>c(OH －)>c(CH3COO －)>c(H ＋)","滴定过程中可能出现：c(CH3COOH)>c(CH3COO －)>c(H ＋)>c(Na ＋)>c(OH －)"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"fbeb95ae116b0cc04b44f1c939c93819768d0bfc164403f66cfaea1fa1b8bf61","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/60455af15f3060fe/e26dbcaa4fd0a2cc82d72733409ce98c/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题常温下，用0.100 0 mol·L原题题面","sha256":"dbff6575df988b0d557b12a77f6be0c598ad1986b8cf661e9ff81b0b1bc8c148","width":1055,"height":420},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/60455af15f3060fe/e26dbcaa4fd0a2cc82d72733409ce98c/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题常温下，用0.100 0 mol·L原题解析","sha256":"b86b2f93b814033186c077879233ddc3ef33a146a83f16474d8267bf5f4909b3","width":1055,"height":1321}],"question_asset_sha256":"dbff6575df988b0d557b12a77f6be0c598ad1986b8cf661e9ff81b0b1bc8c148","analysis_asset_sha256":"b86b2f93b814033186c077879233ddc3ef33a146a83f16474d8267bf5f4909b3","expected_revision_token":"0d8d3aa2ba25e6deafc6c510addb3328c46811d36579feeed62d8b326941ea24","expected_item_sha256":"0c1d82ea4b94314ebdd3569be9b9eb4b8ac2f2b328a938e367def0ef9e4a0e3f","source_pdf_sha256":"c5bd2159a7716277d39ec6313506bb72dc520a64e3187fd2685e06