band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_PH_HYDRO","old_question_id":"QH2O_4A88BDA05A0C0AFA_5736925F1A4C8B3C_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_4A88BDA05A0C0AFA_9BBA666CCA1A5BCF_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"84356cc708ec100d3122bfb0570e3ac12f3443f4a5ad504226b484b7cb082edc","expected_explanation_sha256":"39900db4baff4ac7b228ee3ab8f11067e1e358c7cbd0c2ae2184f2901f3bff8f","expected_explanation":"A．a点δ(A²⁻)＝δ(HA⁻)，故Kₐ₂＝c(H⁺)＝10⁻¹⁰·²⁵；该项把它写成Kₐ₁，A错误。\nB．由分布曲线读出c点c(HA⁻)＞c(H₂A)＞c(A²⁻)，不是题给顺序，B错误。\nC．第一次滴定突跃发生在碱性范围，可选酚酞作指示剂，C正确。\nD．加入20.00 mL盐酸时A²⁻恰好转化为HA⁻。初始Na₂A浓度为0.1000×20.00/20.00＝0.1000 mol·L⁻¹，不是0.2000 mol·L⁻¹，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"用0.100 0 mol·L\n－1 盐酸滴定20.00 mL Na2A 溶液，溶液中H2A、\nHA\n－、A2－的分布分数δ随pH 变化曲线及滴定曲线如图。下列说法正确的是(\n)\n]\n[如A2－分布分数：δ(A2－)＝\nc（A2－）\nc（H2A）＋c（HA\n－）＋c（A2－）\n－10.25\nA.H2A 的Ka1 为10\nB.c 点：c(HA\n－)>c(A2－)>c(H2A)\nC.第一次突变，可选酚酞作指示剂\n－1\nD.c(Na2A)＝0.200 0 mol·L","expected_options":["H2A 的Ka1 为10","c 点：c(HA －)>c(A2－)>c(H2A)","第一次突变，可选酚酞作指示剂 －1","c(Na2A)＝0.200 0 mol·L"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"1966af323fbfac8ee07d97ccd34c53173038e691334ba510b2b85952f7c828a3","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/4a88bda05a0c0afa/86bd6994dd9417314d9be75cbbb01223/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题10原题题面","sha256":"2bd41e2b570e13be63fd86f554232e747ca95b2a6acafb4e86d9c23c11661dbc","width":1055,"height":665},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/4a88bda05a0c0afa/86bd6994dd9417314d9be75cbbb01223/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题10原题解析","sha256":"2c34de0d33bdf503b2d045aa74130fbd9f1d333b47243bffa48932b3a55e874f","width":1055,"height":409}],"question_asset_sha256":"2bd41e2b570e13be63fd86f554232e747ca95b2a6acafb4e86d9c23c11661dbc","analysis_asset_sha256":"2c34de0d33bdf503b2d045aa74130fbd9f1d333b47243bffa48932b3a55e874f","expected_revision_token":"f31ff68bc8ce9969ea05f83d5e4433d6979a2d11640dfd682e324eef1072b7e1","expected_item_sha256":"0f7f43202acb0f642a2bffdcf73cc08ebac84b1745e3636daf5e0bfc2bb7a3d7","source_pdf_sha256":"c5bd2159a7716277d39ec6313506bb72dc520a64e3187fd2685e067ddd30fc76","question_png_sha256":"82c86c22e53fa5818e24f398edd17ec473203e09d8b70bdd483b7d826f9335c2","analysis_png_sha256":"5b25296b095e06e729873155e679d20705bba5cf05faf95f9e1984fe008d86ad"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_PH_HYDRO-c365935675142355","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_PH_HYDRO-c365935675142355","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_PH_HYDRO","old_question_id":"QH2O_958BADA916F9A774_6D51F11CDBE3BF2B_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_958BADA916F9A774_503349914FAF1759_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":1,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"310ff89b7db354006da65fef482f7a6873960daf05f958dac04e4dc61905d63e","expected_explanation_sha256":"9b72a37e22b0ccbbc356b96d12145227ac74c18b17451e3621a1044991cf9353","expected_explanation":"A．FeCl₃溶液pH＜7，是Fe³⁺水解产生H⁺所致，A正确。\nB．若X是0.003 mol·L⁻¹ KCl溶液，分别滴加等量强酸、强碱后pH变化应近似对称；图中并不对称，所以X不可能是该KCl溶液，B错误。\nC．FeCl₃溶液加酸或加碱都会引起水解平衡移动，使pH变化比对照组缓和；曲线c、d能说明水解平衡发生移动，C正确。\nD．Fe³⁺水解可生成Fe(OH)₃胶体，浑浊度增大表示水解被促进，减小表示水解被抑制，可用于判断移动方向，D正确。\n故选B。","expected_stem":"某同学探究溶液的酸碱性对FeCl3 水解平衡的影响，实验方案如下：配制50 mL\n0.001 mol·L\n－1 FeCl3 溶液、50 mL 对照组溶液X，向两种溶液中分别滴加1 滴1\nmol·L\n－1 HCl 溶液、1 滴1 mol·L\n－1 NaOH 溶液，测得溶液pH 随时间变化的曲线如\n下图所示。\n下列说法不正确的是(\n)\nA.依据M 点对应的pH，说明Fe3＋发生了水解反应\nB.对照组溶液X 的组成可能是0.003 mol·L\n－1 KCl 溶液\nC.依据曲线c 和d 说明Fe3＋水解平衡发生了移动\nD.通过仪器检测体系浑浊度的变化，可表征水解平衡移动的方向","expected_options":["依据M 点对应的pH，说明Fe3＋发生了水解反应","对照组溶液X 的组成可能是0.003 mol·L －1 KCl 溶液","依据曲线c 和d 说明Fe3＋水解平衡发生了移动","通过仪器检测体系浑浊度的变化，可表征水解平衡移动的方向"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"85dd97b0543b5f34d510195dc412be4060fc58310f2d909c2c1bbc82b9e76af3","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/958bada916f9a774/fc0e9ce06169abfebe97d0991fbfdc58/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题4原题题面","sha256":"a86bb771e8b2223f4f1b894bff126b2ea7515d9fd5c602b0feef429d5fa5618a","width":1055,"height":694},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/958bada916f9a774/fc0e9ce06169abfebe97d0991fbfdc58/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题4原题解析","sha256":"0689d6076149830441ddd3e2009bdabad609fdfb57c5c5f1a8bf483752491529","width":1055,"height":539}],"question_asset_sha256":"a86bb771e8b2223f4f1b894bff126b2ea7515d9fd5c602b0feef429d5fa5618a","analysis_asset_sha256":"0689d6076149830441ddd3e2009bdabad609fdfb57c5c5f1a8bf483752491529","expected_revision_token":"9cdafb4fa6fad27268ef005ba8d2bb16ab3f61b32dd3ae07450c565665bdc1a8","expected_item_sha256":"0ad360cecf74c62778e863729bb264227f28ec484c4d0befdd8cb0b908d4e41f","source_pdf_sha256":"c5bd2159a7716277d39ec6313506bb72dc520a64e3187fd2685e067ddd30fc76","question_png_sha256":"43a4c0d4a7ebd7c1f908b8a4d98854b074bcc7b506187b3ec98ce06f7b60542b","analysis_png_sha256":"63298ceb9f27ff175f8e33e8b8a6248300f1c3c74603779c7daa97cd329d4b69"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_PH_HYDRO-d694a8422b382bff","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_PH_HYDRO-d694a8422b382bff","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_PH_HYDRO","old_question_id":"QH2O_36D3D8866A3D6757_61B5434CA6B54F1C_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_36D3D8866A3D6757_D58C7348AF6E816B_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"db6d0e277dd09a00463a8c88b0d70dd1a2b20d09af41afc93d5ad2f1495b6c82","expected_explanation_sha256":"9c36df1a11e1daef97c92a288f9943d6718fd2a042bb1319842a1a8f0239832a","expected_explanation":"A．天然硬水的形成与水中含较多Ca²⁺、Mg²⁺有关，但这不是盐类水解造成的，A错误。\nB．NH₄Cl是强酸弱碱盐，NH₄⁺水解使溶液显酸性，能帮助除锈；该应用与盐类水解有关，B错误。\nC．惰性电极电解食盐水得到H₂、Cl₂和NaOH，再由Cl₂与NaOH反应制消毒液；该过程不是盐类水解，C错误。\nD．Na₂CO₃溶液中CO₃²⁻水解生成OH⁻。滴入BaCl₂后CO₃²⁻生成BaCO₃沉淀，水解程度减弱、碱性下降，酚酞红色逐渐褪去，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"生活中处处有化学，下列有关说法正确的是(\n)\nA.天然弱碱性水呈碱性的原因是其中含有较多的Mg2＋、Ca2＋等离子\nB.焊接时用NH4Cl 溶液除锈与盐类水解无关\nC.生活中用电解食盐水的方法制取消毒液，运用了盐类的水解原理\nD.在滴有酚酞的Na2CO3 溶液中慢慢滴入BaCl2 溶液，溶液的红色逐渐褪去","expected_options":["天然弱碱性水呈碱性的原因是其中含有较多的Mg2＋、Ca2＋等离子","焊接时用NH4Cl 溶液除锈与盐类水解无关","生活中用电解食盐水的方法制取消毒液，运用了盐类的水解原理","在滴有酚酞的Na2CO3 溶液中慢慢滴入BaCl2 溶液，溶液的红色逐渐褪去"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"a6473794bbca806b2dc9b6805364a17c7b73f51538da325e17643a7961aa106d","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/36d3d8866a3d6757/8eeb9517944499298450bb9460304af8/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题题面","sha256":"ea1f56e42ff1e1f945ffb218da51f15848bfe83dd17919fd79ea16c017c0d3ce","width":1055,"height":240},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/36d3d8866a3d6757/8eeb9517944499298450bb9460304af8/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题解析","sha256":"04d9b44a3f5d253f9d7987d0b837e414489845d749250e473692c906dccab5dd","width":1055,"height":328}],"question_asset_sha256":"ea1f56e42ff1e1f945ffb218da51f15848bfe83dd17919fd79ea16c017c0d3ce","analysis_asset_sha256":"04d9b44a3f5d253f9d7987d0b837e414489845d749250e473692c906dccab5dd","expected_revision_token":"22e0559a53f65f7ee5b1c287da1825960383ec09f506edd04804bea4c5770c04","expected_item_sha256":"38c91f3bbc63f570b48ecd35e71a425405f4d3c43a0f03d7bc0b58358db63b8f","source_pdf_sha256":"c5bd2159a7716277d39ec6313506bb72dc520a64e3187fd2685e067ddd30fc76","question_png_sha256":"cfde20ba0b16e20bce07886a04a63bb872097b8d89bfe1b9f2171200a382bfcf","analysis_png_sha256":"04def1f08855e033088c2926c921fbaac687c196991d2cf19978ad6dee32e211"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_PH_HYDRO-d76f58a97073f754","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_PH_HYDRO-d76f58a97073f754","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_KSP","old_question_id":"QH2O_DE8FBCD8D531BF75_972027863A50C740_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_DE8FBCD8D531BF75_E827BF1AAC160321_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"772afc187e2a76dde824536b4b009ce085017f62dc5594af5a50be6665a681cd","expected_explanation_sha256":"b8ae00b3ebe366284574ff0b4c657ec3cebe14f1449322c22e7d9d60cd3972b4","expected_explanation":"A．NaHCO₃溶液pH约为8，说明HCO₃⁻水解程度大于电离程度，因此c(H₂CO₃)＞c(CO₃²⁻)，A正确。\nB．实验2已有BaCO₃沉淀，上层清液与沉淀处于平衡时满足c(Ba²⁺)c(CO₃²⁻)＝K_sp(BaCO₃)，B正确。\nC．实验3等物质的量HCO₃⁻与OH⁻反应后主要得到CO₃²⁻，质子守恒应为c(OH⁻)＝c(H⁺)＋c(HCO₃⁻)＋2c(H₂CO₃)，题式漏写系数2，C错误。\nD．Al³⁺与HCO₃⁻相互促进水解，生成Al(OH)₃沉淀和CO₂气体，D正确。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"室温下，通过下列实验探究NaHCO3 溶液的性质。\n实验\n实验操作和现象\n1\n用pH 试纸测得0.1 mol·L\n－1 NaHCO3 溶液的pH 约为8\n－1 NaHCO3 溶液中加入过量0.1 mol·L\n－1 Ba(OH)2 溶液，产\n2\n向0.1 mol·L\n生白色沉淀\n3\n向0.1 mol·L\n－1 NaHCO3 溶液中加入等体积0.1 mol·L\n－1 NaOH 溶液\n4\n向浓NaHCO3 溶液中加入浓Al2(SO4)3 溶液，有气体和沉淀生成\n下列说法不正确的是(\n)\nA.实验1 的溶液中存在c(H2CO3)>c(CO2－\n3 )\nB.实验2 所得上层清液中存在c(Ba2＋)·c(CO2－\n3 )＝Ksp(BaCO3)\nC.实验3 反应后的溶液中存在c(OH\n－)＝c(H\n＋)＋c(HCO\n－\n3 )＋c(H2CO3)\nD.实验4 中生成的气体是CO2","expected_options":["实验1 的溶液中存在c(H2CO3)>c(CO2－ 3 )","实验2 所得上层清液中存在c(Ba2＋)·c(CO2－ 3 )＝Ksp(BaCO3)","实验3 反应后的溶液中存在c(OH －)＝c(H ＋)＋c(HCO － 3 )＋c(H2CO3)","实验4 中生成的气体是CO2"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"af01eae946806d7d4f6871f5c901abec9c5c21a3c42b0665c2241824f2f052d2","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/de8fbcd8d531bf75/5c572bf7a128c79ec7a75976e9dce7db/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题7原题题面","sha256":"b4511d92578170c968cc7f62cd238ce3af977dc4f7b5da814436ccee9e6b1ca6","width":1055,"height":571},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/de8fbcd8d531bf75/5c572bf7a128c79ec7a75976e9dce7db/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题7原题解析","sha256":"8e3e00bfcb3d62a0740118ead71541996d56e6a4ca2266b8dc20bb2cdfabeca2","width":1055,"height":1598}],"question_asset_sha256":"b4511d92578170c968cc7f62cd238ce3af977dc4f7b5da814436ccee9e6b1ca6","analysis_asset_sha256":"8e3e00bfcb3d62a0740118ead71541996d56e6a4ca2266b8dc20bb2cdfabeca2","expected_revision_token":"37a621f7a4d9092b92ac2273af817c1689340bcad9a1ee23a2c58544654ae29b","expected_item_sha256":"ec814648a2c187e2a4456d114a2e4221e038734ee273fffc2df56d0b380254aa","source_pdf_sha256":"c5bd2159a7716277d39ec6313506bb72dc520a64e3187fd2685e067ddd30fc76","question_png_sha256":"842258931256388faa1e4abe7c5f2c3d0c7b4574216d7f9b27f2d7011f88892d","analysis_png_sha256":"e5866239426911c99114994814b8db23cbc4e95014fd98871684512ac1a78155"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_PH_HYDRO-d7d440c878b0f6cb","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_PH_HYDRO-d7d440c878b0f6cb","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_PH_HYDRO","old_question_id":"QH2O_3428A6E1A581AA53_39E47DB73D097603_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_3428A6E1A581AA53_114F913A1559CE21_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"88d82a10d0bf6a5fdc04e5def550725541c1d03c768164f6efa145eb06602c8f","expected_explanation_sha256":"4a96dd83a314369453558f20437f1c03f1d2abaa6dc8e28c8f5bdc13d195639e","expected_explanation":"A．纯碱Na₂CO₃是强碱弱酸盐，CO₃²⁻水解使溶液呈碱性，加热促进水解，有利于去油污，A有关。\nB．Mg(OH)₂消耗Fe³⁺水解产生的H⁺，促进Fe³⁺水解并生成Fe(OH)₃沉淀，可除去MgCl₂中的少量FeCl₃，B有关。\nC．稀硫酸或浓氨水除铜绿分别利用酸碱反应或络合等作用，不是盐类水解，C无关。\nD．长期施用硫酸铵后NH₄⁺水解可使土壤酸化，熟石灰用于中和酸性，D有关。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"盐类水解在工农业生产和日常生活中有着广泛的应用。下列有关应用或说法与\n盐类水解无关的是(\n)\nA.用热的纯碱溶液洗涤餐具上的油污\nB.加入足量Mg(OH)2 粉末充分反应并过滤以除去MgCl2 溶液中的少量FeCl3\nC.用稀硫酸或浓氨水除去铜器表面的铜绿\nD.长期施用硫酸铵化肥的土壤，易变酸性，可施用适量的熟石灰","expected_options":["用热的纯碱溶液洗涤餐具上的油污","加入足量Mg(OH)2 粉末充分反应并过滤以除去MgCl2 溶液中的少量FeCl3","用稀硫酸或浓氨水除去铜器表面的铜绿","长期施用硫酸铵化肥的土壤，易变酸性，可施用适量的熟石灰"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"0b07dfcacd44b8acd5eb720fc8fa5fa8df4e9c35263290828f78823eff5360f7","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/3428a6e1a581aa53/65fccf469d03509060d6807d6068f41f/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题题面","sha256":"1c83691ce537aeab594a94a7ff6fa7e3872609f5bfd9540421b977fc167efdd9","width":1055,"height":287},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/3428a6e1a581aa53/65fccf469d03509060d6807d6068f41f/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题解析","sha256":"9e237d2fbfa34efb9cd8124d670c7f6b02d32e92a6dbf32f2a465a1e6f8c7a15","width":1055,"height":147}],"question_asset_sha256":"1c83691ce537aeab594a94a7ff6fa7e3872609f5bfd9540421b977fc167efdd9","analysis_asset_sha256":"9e237d2fbfa34efb9cd8124d670c7f6b02d32e92a6dbf32f2a465a1e6f8c7a15","expected_revision_token":"b332970ef3685d028e4ac8214bbd0bf2c71abd17070ad06aedb89c53c50dd3cc","expected_item_sha256":"427ebbd5e73ce2207be0c1d293e90bc587e56e5d45590980c9be9ff2c9340f1e","source_pdf_sha256":"c5bd2159a7716277d39ec6313506bb72dc520a64e3187fd2685e067ddd30fc76","question_png_sha256":"243056e053220bceee180fc249423cfcb0635cc7549056c72f9457dea204f698","analysis_png_sha256":"270f8b80a090df700ab3eab36d1f5af57f000873f91b09443838af5b495839f3"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_PH_HYDRO-e99ce7fa666138e6","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_PH_HYDRO-e99ce7fa666138e6","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_PH_HYDRO","old_question_id":"QH2O_1577AD95300DEEA6_9882ED9E367BD75C_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_1577AD95300DEEA6_E329B49C0EEE7230_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"ca43e004cb5760474821a6119fb25473c7ac2a704c4b4bb38efe8545d759ddd2","expected_explanation_sha256":"fb63a11cf5bc97d3c5a8b94b07c3375867e98ce5d6631d051c2b8f0506c9b011","expected_explanation":"A．曲线Ⅲ对应HPP。曲线Ⅱ与Ⅲ交点pH＝8，此时c(HPP)＝c(HPPH⁺)、c(OH⁻)＝10⁻⁶ mol·L⁻¹，所以K_b1＝10⁻⁶，不是10⁻⁸，A错误。\nB．HPP的K_b1＝10⁻⁶，HPPH⁺的水解常数K_h＝K_w/K_b1＝10⁻⁸；HPP电离作用更强，等量HPP和HPPHCl的溶液显碱性，不是酸性，B错误。\nC．HPP与过量稀硫酸反应，两个碱性中心均质子化，得到酸式盐HPPH₂(HSO₄)₂，C正确。\nD．HPPH₂Cl₂溶液的质子守恒为c(H⁺)＝c(OH⁻)＋2c(HPP)＋c(HPPH⁺)，题给关系不正确，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"某有机胺(HPP)为二元弱碱，在水中的电离方式与氨相似：HPP\n＋H2O\nHPPH\n＋＋OH\n－，HPPH\n＋＋H2O\nHPPH2＋\n2 ＋OH\n－。常温下，HPP 水溶\n液中HPP、HPPH\n＋、HPPH 2＋\n2 的分布系数(δ)随pH 的变化关系如图所示。下列说\n法正确的是(\n)\n－8\nA.常温下，HPP 的一级电离常数Kb1＝10\nB.常温下，含等量HPP 和HPPHCl 的溶液显酸性\nC.HPP 与过量稀硫酸反应得到的盐为HPPH2(HSO4)2\nD.HPPH2Cl2 溶液中：c(H\n＋)＝c(HPPH\n＋)＋c(HPP)＋c(OH\n－)","expected_options":["常温下，HPP 的一级电离常数Kb1＝10","常温下，含等量HPP 和HPPHCl 的溶液显酸性","HPP 与过量稀硫酸反应得到的盐为HPPH2(HSO4)2","HPPH2Cl2 溶液中：c(H ＋)＝c(HPPH ＋)＋c(HPP)＋c(OH －)"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"00d91379d86f42cf1e10582dbfa6481925a7cfb9756cd3c7f8c51a0bff436d9e","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/1577ad95300deea6/b307435f19d4e6ef965d7920573a9afb/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题14原题题面","sha256":"056e9ab5da1cce61a52984878