中性时，氨水滴入量大于20 mL，c(NH\n＋\n4 )<c(Cl\n－)","expected_options":["在氨水滴定前，HCl 和CH3COOH 的混合液中c(Cl －)>c(CH3COO －)","当滴入氨水10 mL 时，c(NH ＋ 4 )＋c(NH3·H2O)＝c(CH3COO －)＋c(CH3COOH)","当滴入氨水20 mL 时，c(CH3COOH)＋c(H ＋)＝c(NH3·H2O)＋c(OH －)","当溶液呈中性时，氨水滴入量大于20 mL，c(NH ＋ 4 )<c(Cl －)"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"6e9b246925b8e51c4222bba1c2605029a475b42b334077baa0bb5a079dc26d7f","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/8c6b84752d193fb4/d782a4d72c275753d1f517bfb963ef39/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题题面","sha256":"50ab6fbba41be003f50b06aef8a0c6ded693374816ef0c85f6de31a03ec33427","width":1055,"height":293},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/8c6b84752d193fb4/d782a4d72c275753d1f517bfb963ef39/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题解析","sha256":"677aa7647595dd052faf95498dce091c72233a91067c17f7029e7a4e88254e08","width":1055,"height":477}],"question_asset_sha256":"50ab6fbba41be003f50b06aef8a0c6ded693374816ef0c85f6de31a03ec33427","analysis_asset_sha256":"677aa7647595dd052faf95498dce091c72233a91067c17f7029e7a4e88254e08","expected_revision_token":"37d69061cace14e475aba64af28278f98f0e379870d31de41b0a540385f15243","expected_item_sha256":"2d5fc4e6a5c46903934dcf8a9e83969f07e362afab84f90343371d0a0d4c8f0a","source_pdf_sha256":"c5bd2159a7716277d39ec6313506bb72dc520a64e3187fd2685e067ddd30fc76","question_png_sha256":"8c1ed9d6bf2a7559185098e594fa63b38bba533d8b5349ef78c5010fc5b70732","analysis_png_sha256":"c3547c9d059847c37dfc989ad6eabbedb0cfd48a9099ebc7eaee7d05aae74ab3"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_PH_HYDRO-ed9213e6df7ba8e2","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_PH_HYDRO-ed9213e6df7ba8e2","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_PH_HYDRO","old_question_id":"QH2O_EC360B4E68F6A656_D376D461A6B9CD1F_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_EC360B4E68F6A656_6D21FD0CBF550034_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"3f917562b690f7c1d6f248a0b03f3c42f2bdbb3af2c873025a2b7e8015b350c5","expected_explanation_sha256":"b1f81d663372950b579dc7927bbc319e7473f686f0f9bb989741bf86b6b8bfd2","expected_explanation":"A．NaHA溶液呈酸性，可能是强酸的酸式盐，也可能是弱酸的酸式盐，不能据此断定H₂A为强酸，A错误。\nB．可溶性正盐BA呈中性，既可能是强酸强碱盐，也可能是水解程度接近的弱酸弱碱盐，不能据此断定为强酸强碱盐，B错误。\nC．醋酸越稀，电离度越大。0.010 mol·L⁻¹溶液的电离度α₁应大于0.10 mol·L⁻¹溶液的α₂，C错误。\nD．pH＝10.00时c(OH⁻)＝10⁻⁴ mol·L⁻¹。Na₂CO₃水解产生OH⁻，水每电离1 mol OH⁻也电离1 mol H⁺，所以100 mL溶液中由水电离出的H⁺为0.100×10⁻⁴＝1.0×10⁻⁵ mol，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"25 ℃时，下列说法正确的是(\n)\nA.NaHA 溶液呈酸性，可以推测H2A 为强酸\nB.可溶性正盐BA 溶液呈中性，可以推测BA 为强酸强碱盐\nC.0.010 mol·L\n－1、0.10 mol·L\n－1 的醋酸溶液的电离度分别为α1、α2，则α1<α2\nD.100 mL pH＝10.00 的Na2CO3 溶液中水电离出H\n＋的物质的量为1.0×10\n－5 mol","expected_options":["NaHA 溶液呈酸性，可以推测H2A 为强酸","可溶性正盐BA 溶液呈中性，可以推测BA 为强酸强碱盐","0.010 mol·L －1、0.10 mol·L －1 的醋酸溶液的电离度分别为α1、α2，则α1<α2","100 mL pH＝10.00 的Na2CO3 溶液中水电离出H ＋的物质的量为1.0×10 －5 mol"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"141812e4632a531bab792ac599df4763b352a6afd0989340bd492a9c45b14d53","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/ec360b4e68f6a656/752edf6b631495a47a49a389dc5f5f6a/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题题面","sha256":"60aa0b7fc53c304670edb34048435f639f573eb067f2d27916aa60e9be4ba8fb","width":1055,"height":251},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/ec360b4e68f6a656/752edf6b631495a47a49a389dc5f5f6a/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题解析","sha256":"bc337a14050633782231342bf626ec4b727fc7dc79946441708ea0121d5c34b9","width":1055,"height":428}],"question_asset_sha256":"60aa0b7fc53c304670edb34048435f639f573eb067f2d27916aa60e9be4ba8fb","analysis_asset_sha256":"bc337a14050633782231342bf626ec4b727fc7dc79946441708ea0121d5c34b9","expected_revision_token":"1c82e2a7a9a84ff70f44b40a0f99157b61b7a6fa0575393ff1b35ebf2bb28d93","expected_item_sha256":"8f1add2e14d49a88793a139d7dfd5ad894da2d78571444de33d95052441364b7","source_pdf_sha256":"c5bd2159a7716277d39ec6313506bb72dc520a64e3187fd2685e067ddd30fc76","question_png_sha256":"6d30f3b7bcd16e63179322814209bd3558fb70c745d