(HY)>Ka(HZ)\nC.当pH＝7 时，三种溶液中：c(X\n－)＝c(Y\n－)＝c(Z\n－)\nD.分别滴加20.00 mL 盐酸后，再将三种溶液混合：c(X\n－)＋c(Y\n－)＋c(Z\n－)＝c(H\n＋)\n－c(OH\n－)","expected_options":["该NaX 溶液中：c(Na ＋)>c(X －)>c(OH －)>c(H ＋)","三种一元弱酸的电离常数：Ka(HX)>Ka(HY)>Ka(HZ)","当pH＝7 时，三种溶液中：c(X －)＝c(Y －)＝c(Z －)","分别滴加20.00 mL 盐酸后，再将三种溶液混合：c(X －)＋c(Y －)＋c(Z －)＝c(H ＋) －c(OH －)"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"a81312c31b5b843a52508c41b80ff18687ff5e46f9c1f12383356c7684761618","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/04f75a5664428550/7c41192a8125684b0f35e67344c13f45/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题4原题题面","sha256":"b9f4491acdcf279c942e51cd6e7966e5c3be5f2e70b05ff177b5222491c8f26b","width":1055,"height":571},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/04f75a5664428550/7c41192a8125684b0f35e67344c13f45/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题4原题解析","sha256":"984c951a02e5bf59e3884c8ca79120882ef85f9bef344313ae412544abbbbc0d","width":1055,"height":574}],"question_asset_sha256":"b9f4491acdcf279c942e51cd6e7966e5c3be5f2e70b05ff177b5222491c8f26b","analysis_asset_sha256":"984c951a02e5bf59e3884c8ca79120882ef85f9bef344313ae412544abbbbc0d","expected_revision_token":"fe8b7b23229c140b2a00d0e132abac2feac5592ce46e6cb5aec8b92953b00f7c","expected_item_sha256":"43d8d3d4fd78497a55b05e402bcb83121c7a2eadbdc2158965729ffcfe70125a","source_pdf_sha256":"c5bd2159a7716277d39ec6313506bb72dc520a64e3187fd2685e067ddd30fc76","question_png_sha256":"21f88d1bb08a27308f0a0145cf284b61ed66655a451117627049f62de6b43270","analysis_png_sha256":"8bddcbb040121418aa179f63bb108ec9d0209af3514cfc111e3fccc8aa90936b"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_RATE-00491226180fd47e","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_RATE-00491226180fd47e","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_RATE","old_question_id":"QH2O_2212F4F3FF420E94_91C0375AFB2F91CE_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_2212F4F3FF420E94_87796A28D4B800D2_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":1,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"b919fa85e3eeaf4c42e5d42b5ac7ceca206a265de0289d2924fc7fd2522db4a1","expected_explanation_sha256":"1bf6d5fbf7747c276be12827c51cff9d2790a1644e18f55f71ac8d1e82d7efc8","expected_explanation":"A．Na与水反应时，水是纯液体，增加水的用量不改变其浓度，反应速率不因此减小，A错误。\nB．向稀硫酸中加入K₂SO₄溶液，溶液体积增大，H⁺浓度减小，Al与稀硫酸反应生成H₂的速率减小，B正确。\nC．将冷水改为热水，温度升高，Mg与水反应速率加快，C错误。\nD．碳粉是固体，若接触面积不变，仅增加碳粉用量不改变反应速率，D错误。\n故选B。","expected_stem":"下列措施可使H2 的生成速率减小的是(\n)\nA.Na 与H2O 反应制取H2，增加H2O 的用量\nB.Al 与稀硫酸反应制取H2，向稀硫酸中加入K2SO4 溶液\nC.Mg 与H2O 反应制取H2，将冷水改为热水\nD.碳粉与H2O(g)反应制取H2，增加碳粉的用量","expected_options":["Na 与H2O 反应制取H2，增加H2O 的用量","Al 与稀硫酸反应制取H2，向稀硫酸中加入K2SO4 溶液","Mg 与H2O 反应制取H2，将冷水改为热水","碳粉与H2O(g)反应制取H2，增加碳粉的用量"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"d2d168fac88b92ffc748295a9d38d708e226af6b0d5fa024cf287e3c1ee3a88a","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/2212f4f3ff420e94/aa088ff71de567aed03cffee0e934261/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题4原题题面","sha256":"4855628f97c829d2dae2dce03a3b94bf064ba87bba5beebc662278af99908c2c","width":1055,"height":240},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/2212f4f3ff420e94/aa088ff71de567aed03cffee0e934261/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题4原题解析","sha256":"c5e1c8d0aa929853eae426c5e012c20ce3b8a223efcb3965e1f2c44228e26940","width":1055,"height":237}],"question_asset_sha256":"4855628f97c829d2dae2dce03a3b94bf064ba87bba5beebc662278af99908c2c","analysis_asset_sha256":"c5e1c8d0aa929853eae426c5e012c20ce3b8a223efcb3965e1f2c44228e26940","expected_revision_token":"5c43e08fc80e492c8bba31c10c831de7944fd13569c4f553a858beacb99ba69a","expected_item_sha256":"162c1292570fe81c88b8f00641b54d301e28cdebf9f1f312f7b29425d14025ad","source_pdf_sha256":"252c9819e96ecc99f30377f7b243d74742bcf302abad48f42f1a891233289354","question_png_sha256":"e4a26ffc1bfd6460ea238f895f8e57d9582cc3e7f78368e5ed7f85aecee2a8bb","analysis_png_sha256":"0cd626c8350017c3b28ca0fdfc1aa8322ce62b71a4a883c810e14bd2a533a7e7"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_RATE-0e075a6d45535c81","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_RATE-0e075a6d45535c81","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_RATE","old_question_id":"QH2O_24EADAED86B11164_F8AC71699E8EFC7D_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_24EADAED86B11164_065D34EBD26C5351_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"bcfc3f92da6653227a2f3c1cf8abb7c99abcbdfc48a3c01ab29f28a6dd7d4bdc","expected_explanation_sha256":"ce07e84d0885e78ea702bc2262a59d54be208438dbea16b82991c0d782ec9708","expected_explanation":"8 min内生成Z 1.6 mol，容器体积为10 L，所以v(Z)＝1.6 mol÷(10 L×8 min)＝0.02 mol·L⁻¹·min⁻¹。由3X＋Y⇌2Z＋W得各物质速率之比为3∶1∶2∶1。\nA．v(X)＝3/2v(Z)＝0.03 mol·L⁻¹·min⁻¹，不是0.30 mol·L⁻¹·min⁻¹，A错误。\nB．v(Y)＝1/2v(Z)＝0.01 mol·L⁻¹·min⁻¹，不是0.02 mol·L⁻¹·min⁻¹，B错误。\nC．v(Z)＝0.02 mol·L⁻¹·min⁻¹，C正确。\nD．v(W)＝1/2v(Z)＝0.01 mol·L⁻¹·min⁻¹，不是0.10 mol·L⁻¹·min⁻¹，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"在一定温度下，将气体X 和Y 各3 mol 充入10 L 恒容密闭容器中，发生反应：\n3X(g)＋Y(g)\n2Z(g)＋W(g)。经过8 min，反应达到平衡状态，此时Z 的物质的\n量为1.6 mol。下列关于反应开始至第8 min 时的平均反应速率的计算正确的是\n(\n)\n－1\nA.v(X)＝0.30 mol·L\n－1·min\n－1\nB.v(Y)＝0.02 mol·L\n－1·min\n－1\nC.v(Z)＝0.02 mol·L\n－1·min\n－1\nD.v(W)＝0.10 mol·L\n－1·min","expected_options":["v(X)＝0.30 mol·L －1·min －1","v(Y)＝0.02 mol·L －1·min －1","v(Z)＝0.02 mol·L －1·min －1","v(W)＝0.10 mol·L －1·min"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"a32e602d36d27a93cba4e7d79c102b5cd041c04afd2e2cc062389c499070252e","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/24eadaed86b11164/40bd5cc1f041c46294e0c0b91350cef2/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题题面","sha256":"ce99d8c474f20677528ff22c6cd0a933e891e94a75599744b3fe99ec90c11e4b","width":1055,"height":381},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/24eadaed86b11164/40bd5cc1f041c46294e0c0b91350cef2/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题解析","sha256":"7399efef431fe787aea6057a26106ab4ef6326a3c58699311e3f26b8d10015d5","width":1055,"height":217}],"question_asset_sha256":"ce99d8c474f20677528ff22c6cd0a933e891e94a75599744b3fe99ec90c11e4b","analysis_asset_sha256":"7399efef431fe787aea6057a26106ab4ef6326a3c58699311e3f26b8d10015d5","expected_revision_token":"06197e8cae7f74b9e48fa35c2ee1cb30b0c1017d209a10ad98afc8ef77c7e494","expected_item_sha256":"15450a00462ccc9966b52f08ef392ccbc7ce4e10a0ef799b1aeed0ceae8665c0","source_pdf_sha256":"252c9819e96ecc99f30377f7b243d74742bcf302abad48f42f1a891233289354","question_png_sha256":"b96d71c8c38aa85c8d8a0167233e72c5d3dc056832873b2018faa9eb3189bc45","analysis_png_sha256":"43504b33dffdba9828b3b58f20afd1f07658ae2c18cacbf4eda269d559d6fb0e"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_RATE-125152d0038ce34d","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_RATE-125152d0038ce34d","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_RATE","old_question_id":"QH2O_4BF41B57689442A1_7542F8ADDFC5A225_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_4BF41B57689442A1_02D3D72B7CDF8181_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":1,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"10d1252640cd8392a909ca6e1a03c1112d7774ae28dae751e1cdfdd9409fae9d","expected_explanation_sha256":"10d1252640cd8392a909ca6e1a03c1112d7774ae28dae751e1cdfdd9409fae9d","expected_explanation":"A．FeO\n＋为中间产物，不作催化剂，故A 错误；\nB．由信息可知，第一步为慢\n反应，活化能较大，则第一步中Fe\n＋与N2O 的碰撞仅部分有效，故B 正确；\nC．第\n二步反应不影响总反应达到平衡所用的时间，则第二步反应速率大于第一步反应\n速率，故C 错误；\nD．CO 参与第二步反应，且不影响达到平衡的时间，则增大CO\n的浓度对处理N2O 的反应速率几乎无影响，故D 错误。","expected_stem":"处理、回收CO 是环境科学家研究的热点课题。CO 用于处理\n大气污染物N2O，发生的反应为：\nN2O(g)＋CO(g)\nCO2(g)＋N2(g)\n＋”作催化剂，其总反应分两步进行：\nΔH＝－365 kJ·mol\n－1。上述反应可用“Fe\n第一步：Fe\n＋＋N2O===FeO\n＋＋N2；\n第二步：FeO\n＋＋CO===Fe\n＋＋CO2，第二步反应不影响总反应达到平衡所用的时间。\n下列说法中正确的是(\n)\n＋也是该反应的催化剂\nA.FeO\nB.第一步中Fe\n＋与N2O 的碰撞仅部分有效\nC.第二步反应速率小于第一步反应速率\nD.增大CO 的浓度可显著增大处理N2O 的反应速率","expected_options":["FeO","第一步中Fe ＋与N2O 的碰撞仅部分有效","第二步反应速率小于第一步反应速率","增大CO 的浓度可显著增大处理N2O 的反应速率"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"a9248cf4c24083d790d4a51f1e2319f0b1a84b9eeaf34f2ffb897a9b9c34dbe8","audit_status":"PASS","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/4bf41b57689442a1/b8163883c302bad3b3dc81592f10ab94/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题13原题题面","sha256":"ab2e906c3ece3bc1fee3c1b2ee57ef18c0db9ee4b8ed0047bc7ab24179d7fa78","width":1055,"height":527},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/4bf41b57689442a1/b8163883c302bad3b3dc81592f10ab94/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题13原题解析","sha256":"c8231a280c52fe419695c2df66175eb258eedc8aa8465f22d9ebe96b4365335f","width":1055,"height":287}],"question_asset_sha256":"ab2e906c3ece3bc1fee3c1b2ee57ef18c0db9ee4b8ed0047bc7ab24179d7fa78","analysis_asset_sha256":"c8231a280c52fe419695c2df66175eb258eedc8aa8465f22d9ebe96b4365335f","expected_revision_token":"1298612e7d1c6de2ec0f02104227e0cf5c7efdac1dcd1ad6af38fb254af29759","expected_item_sha256":"1b77e97af83a410651d3b498ca3ca4555df7146e50472cbdb0e403547eebfae1","source_pdf_sha256":"252c9819e96ecc99f30377f7b243d74742bcf302abad48f42f1a891233289354","question_png_sha256":"c79f5e61f86a9e58db510f778fb666c23e38f2ae896e89dd5fc0d20ff012ebe6","analysis_png_sha256":"7054a8cbb8d9831267b76e06aa202ecd6c3a910bf49aabf98547e708653e756a"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_RATE-240f63dfa56de586","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_RATE-240f63dfa56de586","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_RATE","old_question_id":"QH2O_D0DE93325EFCC686_72B1CEAD52AB8671_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_D0DE93325EFCC686_68CEF8414B4F6B75_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"0a16de91d1938324f385a09ec01e35f71b0795fbffb112ff251812f57d3ef3fc","expected_explanation_sha256":"b2df5f2de33c20e97f3e6c0d09004c94f2e4038a33b99c8ac414747bea108fca","expected_explanation":"A．增大反应物浓度会增大单位体积内活化分子数，但活化分子百分数不变，所以A错误。\nB．缩小容器体积使压强增大时，单位体积内活化分子数增多，但活化分子百分数不变，所以B错误。\nC．升高温度使更多普通分子获得足够能量，活化分子百分数增大，不是减小，所以C错误。\nD．催化剂改变反应历程、降低活化能，从而增大活化分子百分数，可显著加快反应速率，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"下列说法正确的是(\n)\nA.增大反应物浓度，可增大单位体积内活化分子的百分数，从而使有效碰撞次数\n增多\nB.有气体参加的化学反应，若增大压强(即缩小反应容器的容积)，可增大活化分\n子的百分数，从而使反应速率增大\nC.升高温度能使化学反应速率增大的主要原因是减小了反应物分子中活化分子的\n百分数\nD.催化剂能增大单位体积内活化分子的百分数，从而成千上万倍地增大反应速率","expected_options":["增大反应物浓度，可增大单位体积内活化分子的百分数，从而使有效碰撞次数 增多","有气体参加的化学反应，若增大压强(即缩小反应容器的容积)，可增大活化分 子的百分数，从而使反应速率增大","升高温度能使化学反应速率增大的主要原因是减小了反应物分子中活化分子的 百分数","催化剂能增大单位体积内活化分子的百分数，从而成千上万倍地增大反应速率"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"02caca38043fd845e44701feb28a354fe094e40e2db9872c01d7e10cfa999a16","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/d0de93325efcc686/781cab0bd50f6579e118c6d5d83a1f5c/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题5原题题面","sha256":"4ccc2ee3b33dddac5f878111a6df86558b574e8dece27c8a02ae035f83f1bd12","width":1055,"height":381},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/d0de93325efcc686/781cab0bd50f6579e118c6d5d83a1f5c/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题5原题解析","sha256":"c5df22167b2110aa389dd86256c600d7fef3d47a6a3929ad5171d9361ee4aa4b","width":1055,"height":387}],"question_asset_sha256":"4ccc2ee3b33dddac5f878111a6df86558b574e8dece27c8a02ae035f83f1bd12","analysis_asset_sha256":"c5df22167b2110aa389dd86256c600d7fef3d47a6a3929ad5171d9361ee4aa4b","expected_revision_token":"653e1926910af6387adfe6f7c4ccc27ec83a8a7dfe610af36f894382e5efe41e","expected_item_sha256":"f0447bd1c8ddb2ef8da8b8819706ba50a033906e827a76962690a78357937039","source_pdf_sha256":"252c9819e96ecc99f30377f7b243d74742bcf302abad48f42f1a891233289354","question_png_sha256":"88bfa8da143fae56f5fd1be10c2243509b71a385dae7256c4640ec47471eafdd","analysis_png_sha256":"2e5fa84c0848da5c5dbcf0363969b5ec0f36442f01fd75a87799c65c6b25befa"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_RATE-37b143745941e160","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_RATE-37b143745941e160","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_RATE","old_question_id":"QH2O_3BD4FFA27C14D237_983EF29945C5883F_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_3BD4FFA27C14D237_FC60029B4671011A_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":0,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"a568102fcf5bcd7425a92ae6e04e2ffc10d63c07e382bd7cb9c7a627a6213a7c","expected_explanation_sha256":"0e84f352b1ded7e2ca2dc81fcfaf4752a607f80df2a620dbb8f849c39033cc5d","expected_explanation":"A．由反应历程可知，NH₃、NO、O₂均参加反应，总反应为4NH₃＋2NO＋2O₂→3N₂＋6H₂O；题给方程式缺少NO且系数不符，A错误。\nB．Ti⁴⁺···NH₂—N＝O在反应过程中生成，随后又被消耗，属于中间产物，B正确。\nC．Ti⁴⁺参与反应过程，但反应前后恢复，质量和化学性质不变，属于催化剂，C正确。\nD．Ti⁴⁺···NH₂—N＝O→Ti⁴⁺＋N₂＋H₂O由一种反应物生成多种生成物，属于分解反应，D正确。\n故选A。","expected_stem":"据文献报道，某反应的反应历程如图所示：\n下列有关该历程的说法错误的是(\n)\nA.总反应化学方程式为4NH3＋3O2 =====\n催化剂2N2＋6H2O\nB.Ti4＋…NH2－N===O 是中间产物\nC.Ti4＋是催化剂\nD.Ti4＋…NH2－N===O―→Ti4＋＋N2＋H2O 属于分解反应","expected_options":["总反应化学方程式为4NH3＋3O2 ===== 催化剂2N2＋6H2O","Ti4＋…NH2－N===O 是中间产物","Ti4＋是催化剂","Ti4＋…NH2－N===O―→Ti4＋＋N2＋H2O 属于分解反应"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"fc33726b0ba14857fd2d6dbda0bec1fd6499b33379058674cf078b127c710054","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/3bd4ffa27c14d237/430645a0393770428dc8762b035b11e0/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题题面","sha256":"997a457a1d46b1f8e839da2ba6df59771cd5a1f0bd1b93ca6deecfa8be8579fa","width":1055,"height":553},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/3bd4ffa27c14d237/430645a0393770428dc8762b035b11e0/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题解析","sha256":"02918991a1589828779e5c884a3a45482d6e7bb19100c222d93cc7bddea254fb","width":1055,"height":350}],"question_asset_sha256":"997a457a1d46b1f8e839da2ba6df59771cd5a1f0bd1b93ca6deecfa8be8579fa","analysis_asset_sha256":"02918991a1589828779e5c884a3a45482d6e7bb19100c222d93cc7bddea254fb","expected_revision_token":"76ba760e9e82867a34790a8450ed437362fb4ab6d5ca2ebc95403b0d66c47832","expected_item_sha256":"c78f1b141451bef0cd34fc0d3d5a40a1954a0f3605c6cbe8d64f0a2946ffacce","source_pdf_sha256":"252c9819e96ecc99f30377f7b243d74742bcf302abad48f42f1a891233289354","question_png_sha256":"9f28f74e980e49040f8d9374158cf3fbb376d5c35c80f80cbce324f88693efd7","analysis_png_sha256":"dd598ab0b539fffb294c50b929bcd2e2e69e0aeed87fc12952d1b8546f6d0452"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_RATE-4149883c196e0377","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_RATE-4149883c196e0377","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_RATE","old_question_id":"QH2O_01FF989D82ED09BE_84171F27F74B8D5B_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_01FF989D82ED09BE_802149B530C83412_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"aca1233267bc7f42f8b725c2d06e2f11404eb134c18240d95f05d41d76a590c5","expected_explanation_sha256":"aca1233267bc7f42f8b725c2d06e2f11404eb134c18240d95f05d41d76a590c5","expected_explanation":"A．由图可知，反应物的总能量高于生成物的总能量，该反应为放热反应，\nA 错；\nB．升高温度，不能降低反应的活化能，即Ea1、Ea2 均不变，但可以加快反\n应速率，B 错；\nC．反应的焓变和反应的途径无关，只与反应的始态和终态有关，\n则增大反应物的浓度，不改变焓变的大小，但增大反应物Cl2 的浓度，可提高反\n应速率，C 项正确；\nD．第一步反应的活化能大于第二步反应的活化能，第一步反\n应单位体积内活化分子百分数低于第二步反应，所以第一步反应的速率小于第二\n步反应的速率，D 错。","expected_stem":"如图(Ea表示活化能)是CH4与Cl2生成CH3Cl 的部分反应过程中\n各物质的能量变化关系图，下列说法正确的是(\n)\nA.题述反应为吸热反应\nB.升高温度，Ea1、Ea2 均减小，反应速率加快\nC.增大Cl2 的浓度，可提高反应速率，但不影响ΔH 的大小\nD.第一步反应的速率大于第二步反应的速率","expected_options":["题述反应为吸热反应","升高温度，Ea1、Ea2 均减小，反应速率加快","增大Cl2 的浓度，可提高反应速率，但不影响ΔH 的大小","第一步反应的速率大于第二步反应的速率"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"67a42239e75899e60fa4420e02346e102449db240fcdc579f8a5861d96b75515","audit_status":"PASS","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/01ff989d82ed09be/601dd1a062486a5790e6b1b678274f5f/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题7原题题面","sha256":"c4ab68db0c70870a48bf816df53614f507c3f56abda4d294409f82e511e4a04c","width":1055,"height":506},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/01ff989d82ed09be/601dd1a062486a5790e6b1b678274f5f/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题7原题解析","sha256":"c51069a69c00e91cf39c18232804d8ec4f528b7aeb714316020759bb9c54e5e2","width":1055,"height":380}],"question_asset_sha256":"c4ab68db0c70870a48bf816df53614f507c3f56abda4d294409f82e511e4a04c","analysis_asset_sha256":"c51069a69c00e91cf39c18232804d8ec4f528b7aeb714316020759bb9c54e5e2","expected_revision_token":"f72c854e793b17061c9e5dcfe60d9761c8bb82c29d531199bb224a87938f8618","expected_item_sha256":"6efebf696fbdc50a1abbd326e2fe13f3be3ec345bff0729298c47abb19efc72a","source_pdf_sha256":"252c9819e96ecc99f30377f7b243d74742bcf302abad48f42f1a891233289354","question_png_sha256":"85971fea3bb996bf0f30ca55ef16405d7ec6b661b1e676b6c90370b29cf461a8","analysis_png_sha256":"350c441f1e7aa008585df6bbadef6508f5f8c579774f8f49a60058e7c531f535"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_RATE-677a21e42351afeb","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_RATE-677a21e42351afeb","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_RATE","old_question_id":"QH2O_F7A8D7DBE5B62DAA_ED6D52027C5BE960_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_F7A8D7DBE5B62DAA_8776A9DB54DDFF3B_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"114d8a291422069ae398824d939a13c2f199d7f41b0a8c090d4fa90b19b8d577","expected_explanation_sha256":"65f8fd6994e64a097907924cf3cfdaad049a27a0e67c406b546213142d42d0e1","expected_explanation":"A．t₃以后各物质浓度不再变化，说明反应达到平衡，但正、逆反应仍在进行，反应没有停止，A错误。\nB．t₂～t₃时浓度仍在变化，正、逆反应速率不相等；t₃～t₄时处于平衡，正、逆反应速率相等，所以t₂～t₄内不能始终说正反应速率大于逆反应速率，B错误。\nC．t₁到t₃，W、X、Y、Z的浓度变化量分别为4、2、6、2 mol·L⁻¹，最简比为2∶1∶3∶1，所以反应为2W(g)＋X(g)⇌3Y(g)＋Z(g)，C正确。\nD．t₂～t₃内W的浓度减少1 mol·L⁻¹，时间单位是s，所以v(W)＝1/(t₃－t₂) mol·L⁻¹·s⁻¹，不是mol·L⁻¹·min⁻¹，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"在一密闭容器中通入W、X、Y、Z 四种气体，保持一定温度，\n在t1～t4 时测得各物质的浓度如表，则下列判断正确的是(\n)\n测定时刻/s\n－1\nt1\nt2\nt3\nt4\n物质浓度/mol·L\nW\n6\n3\n2\n2\nX\n3\n1.5\n1\n1\nY\n2.5\n7\n8.5\n8.5\nZ\n1\n2.5\n3\n3\nA.在t3 时反应已经停止\nB.t2～t4 内正反应速率大于逆反应速率\nC.在容器中发生的反应为2W(g)＋X(g)\n3Y(g)＋Z(g)\n－1\nmol·L\n－1·min\nD.在t2～t3 内W 的平均反应速率为\n1\nt3－t2","expected_options":["在t3 时反应已经停止","t2～t4 内正反应速率大于逆反应速率","在容器中发生的反应为2W(g)＋X(g) 3Y(g)＋Z(g) －1 mol·L －1·min","在t2～t3 内W 的平均反应速率为 1 t3－t2"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"62eae6737cd977c6924e54da977dd2a1208b61d2c9f619d2a47187eaea77f7fd","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/f7a8d7dbe5b62daa/2e630ce02c2eeff12d6c90a8b2e835a5/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题8原题题面","sha256":"18892051e7f88ca46af822aa5c705ad9d07c20ee0697b1093165fa9411fdec80","width":1055,"height":613},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/f7a8d7dbe5b62daa/2e630ce02c2eeff12d6c90a8b2e835a5/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题8原题解析","sha256":"bcaaa6500b2691e3f7d3e485424ac24db20c485a44