],"expected_content_fingerprint":"e47df463d15bc05bcfaba5769aec631c410a1d016bf9972b97e46c95e719759f","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/8a86854517777d6a/2f6358633cf862a7d866865345e569fc/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题题面","sha256":"14fd6218edc45343a0f0d575a4b73fa36f6f0a4845fd3c798646c6652b7cadfa","width":1055,"height":599},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/8a86854517777d6a/2f6358633cf862a7d866865345e569fc/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题解析","sha256":"2329361b847ed2ce3ccb06bffb2bb5649e334a37158c39f7608cea55832b3f05","width":1055,"height":625}],"question_asset_sha256":"14fd6218edc45343a0f0d575a4b73fa36f6f0a4845fd3c798646c6652b7cadfa","analysis_asset_sha256":"2329361b847ed2ce3ccb06bffb2bb5649e334a37158c39f7608cea55832b3f05","expected_revision_token":"23f5e32d18233c196c6dcc37fcbe955c12ccf144eabcca9b226e50cb4d4eda8d","expected_item_sha256":"37a08fd5cad456d9bae00c6ecd2d4d5093b965e810ba22b5905ddaed0930ec91","source_pdf_sha256":"252c9819e96ecc99f30377f7b243d74742bcf302abad48f42f1a891233289354","question_png_sha256":"62138d85abd438d38393b4ec5dadf7b5cba8a8089c722a5b5acb007724755fe6","analysis_png_sha256":"00315aa0431b6704e4f0bab57025df612948dccd34304f0722836d0ea98d5aee"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_RATE-6c6062007300b808","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_RATE-6c6062007300b808","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_RATE","old_question_id":"QH2O_3AD4265C4FA5EC79_63A6087A0C574863_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_3AD4265C4FA5EC79_A35EB4974B32BA7C_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"cf1a4b7270f141e64eb42e5afe772eb96f7a5c3d782a63f1661afcd60de2252c","expected_explanation_sha256":"f22b964ce027442cfd82fab3a5225d77b1c6aceed77be0b562b403beaaba7e8b","expected_explanation":"设4 min时反应进度为x mol，则生成H₂O为6x mol；各物质的量依次为n(NH₃)＝4－4x、n(O₂)＝3－3x、n(N₂)＝2x、n(H₂O)＝6x，总物质的量为7＋x。由6x/(7＋x)＝0.40得x＝0.50。\nA．v(N₂)＝(2×0.50 mol)÷(2 L×4 min)＝0.125 mol·L⁻¹·min⁻¹，A正确。\nB．v(H₂O)＝3v(N₂)＝0.375 mol·L⁻¹·min⁻¹，B正确。\nC．v(O₂)＝3/2v(N₂)＝0.1875 mol·L⁻¹·min⁻¹，不是0.225 mol·L⁻¹·min⁻¹，C错误。\nD．v(NH₃)＝2v(N₂)＝0.250 mol·L⁻¹·min⁻¹，D正确。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"现向一容积不变的2 L 密闭容器中充入4 mol NH3和3 mol O2，发生反应：4NH3(g)\n＋3O2(g)\n2N2(g)＋6H2O(g)，4 min 后，测得生成的H2O 占混合气体体积的40%，\n则下列表示此段时间内该反应的平均速率不正确的是(\n)\n－1\nA.v(N2)＝0.125 mol·L\n－1·min\n－1\nB.v(H2O)＝0.375 mol·L\n－1·min\n－1\nC.v(O2)＝0.225 mol·L\n－1·min\n－1\nD.v(NH3)＝0.250 mol·L\n－1·min","expected_options":["v(N2)＝0.125 mol·L －1·min －1","v(H2O)＝0.375 mol·L －1·min －1","v(O2)＝0.225 mol·L －1·min －1","v(NH3)＝0.250 mol·L －1·min"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"6575daa870d2e982a76454d33f76bfd22ce9ec3c259462149c32664653ac54a9","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/3ad4265c4fa5ec79/dd9da454ac3b6cab7a8236c67767a67c/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题题面","sha256":"b77e1287d7c3868b53eeece4a11fe330e8e40305692eace562db5c89a727f9bb","width":1055,"height":334},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/3ad4265c4fa5ec79/dd9da454ac3b6cab7a8236c67767a67c/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题解析","sha256":"8425d5deede977f84950f21cb182c798b1f445b5362d94737daa3448d7d7c5b5","width":1055,"height":988}],"question_asset_sha256":"b77e1287d7c3868b53eeece4a11fe330e8e40305692eace562db5c89a727f9bb","analysis_asset_sha256":"8425d5deede977f84950f21cb182c798b1f445b5362d94737daa3448d7d7c5b5","expected_revision_token":"6fccca335a597f2586e32bea0b7daa4aa7c08a7585de9351d31bde2e65e81e41","expected_item_sha256":"f60c67dd114ffd9713f3f33e2a1a35f5654c4533748872f719a2ba0e36d2ab90","source_pdf_sha256":"252c9819e96ecc99f30377f7b243d74742bcf302abad48f42f1a891233289354","question_png_sha256":"8f43cdc9f44c90f80f983b4b70061f08661e3fb6b9dda9851b0e21985f112c70","analysis_png_sha256":"28a699f60784dad6466023f3c3bae61eba3a06a6d8a444c468bbe019fd5dd777"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_RATE-705e95780fb70acf","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_RATE-705e95780fb70acf","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_RATE","old_question_id":"QH2O_F0810F4BCF733C48_A675E118BC57A1DB_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_F0810F4BCF733C48_981AD737D55F192A_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"d1a81bfe34f24aae0dedb5eeea5404a44b9b0b74e0ce0186ef41e35483961a58","expected_explanation_sha256":"0107ed8212f9547e4ec3f17c4a45dc539126ac94fa8c98e01aa402d5348fa3c1","expected_explanation":"A．As＋NO₂→AsO＋NO中，N由＋4价降为＋2价，NO₂作氧化剂，所以相同条件下氧化性NO₂＞NO，A正确。\nB．三条反应中，As与NO反应的活化能最大，相同条件下反应速率最慢，B正确。\nC．升高温度能提高活化分子百分数并加快反应，但不会增大反应本身的活化能，C错误。\nD．图中As与NO₂反应的ln k随温度变化很小，说明升高温度不能显著加快该反应，D正确。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"某课题组研究煤燃烧过程中氮氧化物氧化砷的微观机理，得到\n如下图像和数据。(其中k 为速率常数，Ea 为活化能)。对于所研究的三个反应，\n下列说法错误的是(\n)\n反应动力学参数\n反应\nEa/(kJ·mol\n－1)\nAs＋N2O―→AsO＋N2\n78.45\nAs＋NO2―→AsO＋NO\n2.58\nAs＋NO―→AsO＋N\n155.85\nA.相同条件下的氧化性：NO2>NO\nB.相同条件下，As 与NO 的反应速率最慢\nC.升高温度能增大As 与N2O 反应的活化能\nD.升高温度不能显著加快As 与NO2 的反应速率","expected_options":["相同条件下的氧化性：NO2>NO","相同条件下，As 与NO 的反应速率最慢","升高温度能增大As 与N2O 反应的活化能","升高温度不能显著加快As 与NO2 的反应速率"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"c604c64daa8898b40c0714ee7517c8765acd6a780f60d8fa27f070a5a2e5d099","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/f0810f4bcf733c48/9d6e93624341b349810f9dc20b507bbc/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题14原题题面","sha256":"2ad984466a76fbbfe0bf4776453ab2e4c8417d6429f17a0fc7449f44588acabd","width":1055,"height":789},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/f0810f4bcf733c48/9d6e93624341b349810f9dc20b507bbc/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题14原题解析","sha256":"edbdaaf067e66d6cadf5b39b0c2128ab759d3487648978d23b14d285de0b6295","width":1055,"height":334}],"question_asset_sha256":"2ad984466a76fbbfe0bf4776453ab2e4c8417d6429f17a0fc7449f44588acabd","analysis_asset_sha256":"edbdaaf067e66d6cadf5b39b0c2128ab759d3487648978d23b14d285de0b6295","expected_revision_token":"36e7a25726bada9a3a551ff217864fbb9846f285cde77652117923e6485d628e","expected_item_sha25