速率为0.1 mol·L －1·s","反应进行到6 s 时，各物质的反应速率相等"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"a4a9aebb084e7e4ccadf5995a471b72b44c57cd38a1dbed124f8246f4fe19af7","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/b04252dfb60cc870/0af3de75a9c10b2fbe108237e144b4f9/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题题面","sha256":"158c4842e7436a81aa2f7f254df822d5a4906f6ecf006c45e1cee097289e2124","width":1055,"height":475},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/b04252dfb60cc870/0af3de75a9c10b2fbe108237e144b4f9/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题解析","sha256":"8c43513280e87e4e3bcd07de4559e19a77a588835a23ee4f4346afca949815bb","width":1055,"height":412}],"question_asset_sha256":"158c4842e7436a81aa2f7f254df822d5a4906f6ecf006c45e1cee097289e2124","analysis_asset_sha256":"8c43513280e87e4e3bcd07de4559e19a77a588835a23ee4f4346afca949815bb","expected_revision_token":"26077b4333bcc72b5ebd6885d4b4bd697d4e67c94c063d6612129e0eacdddfa7","expected_item_sha256":"616c61da11e94ab455410d432b3f68c6393ac667e9a482a005caf5e7463d6880","source_pdf_sha256":"252c9819e96ecc99f30377f7b243d74742bcf302abad48f42f1a891233289354","question_png_sha256":"f9a3d8f6afff1919eff5ab4a6ad1a2e8ac9b4315c18d752c7f084e21dc01b489","analysis_png_sha256":"dad30ba81542c3011d299861d7c492ba0d4559ba0319f50a4cc1c43b85630a49"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_RATE-77f6e3a345f37326","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_RATE-77f6e3a345f37326","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_RATE","old_question_id":"QH2O_08F3F58E71FAB29E_EF4F07AD4381863A_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_08F3F58E71FAB29E_651610D051F20342_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"6fa552b0a83c7225abfc9bd09eb2325c5d6553f8bf26da7c0d7d18a08a35be78","expected_explanation_sha256":"67c8b4f0893ab3ffb94d2a1dd1e721cf5271af3b93dff9d405f3a10b42214e29","expected_explanation":"A．600～1200 s内，N₂O₅浓度减小0.96－0.66＝0.30 mol·L⁻¹，NO₂浓度增加量为其2倍，即0.60 mol·L⁻¹，所以v(NO₂)＝0.60/600＝1.0×10⁻³ mol·L⁻¹·s⁻¹，不是5.0×10⁻⁴ mol·L⁻¹·s⁻¹，A错误。\nB．到2220 s时，N₂O₅的物质的量减少量为(1.40－0.35) mol·L⁻¹×0.100 L＝0.105 mol，生成O₂为0.105×1/2＝0.0525 mol，标准状况下体积为0.0525×22.4＝1.176 L，不是11.8 L，B错误。\nC．平衡时正、逆反应速率相等；按化学计量数换算，应有2v正(N₂O₅)＝v逆(NO₂)，不是v正(N₂O₅)＝2v逆(NO₂)，C错误。\nD．由表中600～1710 s和1710～2820 s可知，N₂O₅浓度每经过1110 s变为原来的一半；从0.24 mol·L⁻¹降至0.12 mol·L⁻¹还需1110 s，所以x＝2820＋1110＝3930，D正确。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"一定温度下：在N2O5 的四氯化碳溶液(100 mL)中发生分解\n反应：2N2O5\n4NO2＋O2。在不同时刻测量放出的O2 体积，换算成N2O5 浓度\n如下表：\nt/s\n0\n600\n1 200\n1 710\n2 220\n2 820\nx\nc(N2O5)/(mol·L\n－1)\n1.40\n0.96\n0.66\n0.48\n0.35\n0.24\n0.12\n下列说法正确的是(\n)\n－1\nA.600～1 200 s，生成NO2 的平均速率为5.0×10\n－4 mol·L\n－1·s\nB.反应2 220 s 时，放出的O2 体积为11.8 L(标准状况)\nC.反应达到平衡时，v 正(N2O5)＝2v 逆(NO2)\nD.推测上表中的x 为3 930","expected_options":["600～1 200 s，生成NO2 的平均速率为5.0×10 －4 mol·L －1·s","反应2 220 s 时，放出的O2 体积为11.8 L(标准状况)","反应达到平衡时，v 正(N2O5)＝2v 逆(NO2)","推测上表中的x 为3 930"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"0ddcc55a0a710cfa8bf5b6080226874edcfb9b42a4c1745328cd4c4211f3a298","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/08f3f58e71fab29e/4a6d9a78dbc7adc0e12c955b97bb8197/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题题面","sha256":"599a0886ba46dce66017b685d7f63fcb1b96e2a225589904b42b0aa213bc0d68","width":1055,"height":478},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/08f3f58e71fab29e/4a6d9a78dbc7adc0e12c955b97bb8197/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题1原题解析","sha256":"55a7f06f9bb7f2ad89ff26c8e65256b159d9d4bb51ded60479826a563d9a9714","width":1055,"height":646}],"question_asset_sha256":"599a0886ba46dce66017b685d7f63fcb1b96e2a225589904b42b0aa213bc0d68","analysis_asset_sha256":"55a7f06f9bb7f2ad89ff26c8e65256b159d9d4bb51ded60479826a563d9a9714","expected_revision_token":"6b4fbff53b29b6b6c7a593c7c83ac7c87f5d4aca1c441e4fd04c665c5e603b20","expected_item_sha256":"cff4571cde2cbcae6976c83c37926320b747123aec2030155b54bac454a76515","source_pdf_sha256":"252c9819e96ecc99f30377f7b243d74742bcf302abad48f42f1a891233289354","question_png_sha256":"260669c5878fb85baa76b06c18d29b2b06a195b219446136780a791b547a7556","analysis_png_sha256":"19fb8f1721c97c6f6467613bfb6912782a5e4d4a437dfdcd9da0f1081bcad37c"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_RATE-917dd49ae864be04","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_RATE-917dd49ae864be04","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_RATE","old_question_id":"QH2O_348DC463D1B2F86A_6EB7DA57A4ABBC74_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_348DC463D1B2F86A_B78BE68BF0AB846D_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":2,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"08e71b7ef0d91019e208b3166ec5ff898a69bd3ee896fc3453d9da3da318df84","expected_explanation_sha256":"90dd6d5ea4ad0a9ca91f01ae2109f80927aa451768e22bbccb49e5b1cf1dc4c6","expected_explanation":"A．降低温度会使反应①、②的速率都减小，不会使反应②速率增大，A错误。\nB．两反应都有气体参加，增大压强会使反应①、②的速率都增大；反应①速率不会不变，B错误。\nC．增大压强会增大气体反应物的浓度，所以反应①、②的速率都增大，C正确。\nD．升高温度会使反应①、②的速率都增大，不会使反应②速率减小，D错误。\n故选C。","expected_stem":"一定温度下，反应①C(s) ＋CO2(g)===2CO(g)\nΔH>0 ，反应②2SO2(g) ＋\nO2(g)===2SO3(g)\nΔH<0。下列有关以上两个反应的说法正确的是(\n)\nA.降低温度反应①的速率减小，反应②的速率增大\nB.增大压强反应①的速率不变，反应②的速率增大\nC.增大压强反应①的速率增大，反应②的速率增大\nD.升高温度反应①的速率增大，反应②的速率减小","expected_options":["降低温度反应①的速率减小，反应②的速率增大","增大压强反应①的速率不变，反应②的速率增大","增大压强反应①的速率增大，反应②的速率增大","升高温度反应①的速率增大，反应②的速率减小"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"01c90b42bf7f19c7b430734980d4f7aa82aed57552d786ea4d741caede636377","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/348dc463d1b2f86a/a451e820bd74a3634ddb6d63679a8dc4/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题题面","sha256":"dcbb4bf13a74861fa1dcb3594de9897c6fcfc5e31f77e69bccf8bc349c1c1614","width":1055,"height":287},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/348dc463d1b2f86a/a451e820bd74a3634ddb6d63679a8dc4/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题3原题解析","sha256":"c3c95f2639b6a653f55640f725568452de436440fad18945e94e3fcff471270b","width":1055,"height":193}],"question_asset_sha256":"dcbb4bf13a74861fa1dcb3594de9897c6fcfc5e31f77e69bccf8bc349c1c1614","analysis_asset_sha256":"c3c95f2639b6a653f55640f7255