O)/(mol·L\n－1)\n0.01\n0.02\n0.02\n0.01\nc(NO2)/(mol·L\n－1)\n0.01\n0.01\n0.015\n0.015\nv(CO2)/(mol·L\n－1·s\n－1)\n2.2×10\n－4\n4.4×10\n－4\n6.6×10\n－4\nx\n根据表中的测定结果，下列结论不正确的是(\n)\n－4\nA.表中x 的值为3.3×10\nB.化学反应速率v＝2.2c(CO) c(NO2)\nC.升高温度，各物质浓度不变，化学反应速率不变\nD.催化剂可能对k 影响较大","expected_options":["表中x 的值为3.3×10","化学反应速率v＝2.2c(CO) c(NO2)","升高温度，各物质浓度不变，化学反应速率不变","催化剂可能对k 影响较大"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"3947a5586a16359c043a4e72f17cae37de2b52be6647d5004c7815717c0d885b","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/05ecc3e412f6dc0c/0eb2b0ed4aada036c449c7d14f70cbee/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题9原题题面","sha256":"cff7fc11994c4fa88d46dcc91be81e51a622de4422c4c790f36c056ae075354d","width":1055,"height":572},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/05ecc3e412f6dc0c/0eb2b0ed4aada036c449c7d14f70cbee/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题9原题解析","sha256":"11e1004001c6f2ea8f9e7123246f8202cd0973e46f5826e3f62140c3d1440457","width":1055,"height":428}],"question_asset_sha256":"cff7fc11994c4fa88d46dcc91be81e51a622de4422c4c790f36c056ae075354d","analysis_asset_sha256":"11e1004001c6f2ea8f9e7123246f8202cd0973e46f5826e3f62140c3d1440457","expected_revision_token":"abfafaf384a83665cc77a0f20899019e0a751859d2a2a78303a1aee9412c1355","expected_item_sha256":"02267da876a716945503d6fca859ffcf8d6c2f68f4028f7c83a12a63b866e222","source_pdf_sha256":"252c9819e96ecc99f30377f7b243d74742bcf302abad48f42f1a891233289354","question_png_sha256":"4a2c67f3b55684edd1ce302c23c6c22237d2f7b6ed7aa8e8c6c054992d0f76e2","analysis_png_sha256":"090f69898045b06927e8f81f03b8c523b972b496df2eb29afd7244dc3a5ae33d"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_RATE-af35b8080aa61022","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_RATE-af35b8080aa61022","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_RATE","old_question_id":"QH2O_0F0D6386FBDCEA30_FB99EE44F64F8867_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_0F0D6386FBDCEA30_2C5AA07C97C61614_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":1,"baseline_explanati