，反应速率越大\n－1\nC.条件①，反应速率为0.012 mol·L\n－1·min\nD.条件②，降冰片烯起始浓度为3.0 mol·L\n－1 时，半衰期为62.5 min","expected_options":["其他条件相同时，催化剂浓度越大，反应速率越大","其他条件相同时，降冰片烯浓度越大，反应速率越大 －1","条件①，反应速率为0.012 mol·L －1·min","条件②，降冰片烯起始浓度为3.0 mol·L －1 时，半衰期为62.5 min"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"04147e84194fe6bc76efb7300546dfd0a1028d2e2a04620c53f07b731a86a7f9","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/c7d727a25130045d/c38258dae0b793a623b637e08f02a72e/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题题面","sha256":"606ab8b26dbf03f7e77ab18814880bf7d72ffb7e774771f0ea7d1f01a1e08a63","width":1055,"height":589},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/c7d727a25130045d/c38258dae0b793a623b637e08f02a72e/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题2原题解析","sha256":"8c8b1588f9ca96787dc11fe74a0b4d88c8101b4f7a330c52dfbacd3a931fafd2","width":1055,"height":396}],"question_asset_sha256":"606ab8b26dbf03f7e77ab18814880bf7d72ffb7e774771f0ea7d1f01a1e08a63","analysis_asset_sha256":"8c8b1588f9ca96787dc11fe74a0b4d88c8101b4f7a330c52dfbacd3a931fafd2","expected_revision_token":"cf3c90339d26471f02816bc454d8d6cea5380fef531c50a76da11c0ba14b0592","expected_item_sha256":"36c4089ce2e08f1bd68647ba2aa71e4f22b527ef26f2b1497d15d355fc91b682","source_pdf_sha256":"252c9819e96ecc99f30377f7b243d74742bcf302abad48f42f1a891233289354","question_png_sha256":"f4c30741c304e6716121f20eb6f417eb97d352aedb88abf0879b2a490c455316","analysis_png_sha256":"355ce2ec482657bb810acb40c1dc863c888f01174941eb2145f75d254027a5ae"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_RATE-de0a81b904ccda71","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_RATE-de0a81b904ccda71","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_RATE","old_question_id":"QH2O_A9E45F68B95D85BE_54413B3368A9F036_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_A9E45F68B95D85BE_1DC812085B8962C3_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":3,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"8e464ccab26f39fa7b253c089a97d3f04834d03bd5f7b1463e7bfda0e6f98f26","expected_explanation_sha256":"32d9124ec9416ec9159441f8fc736f10e398d5baf6145c1ad5234d1ae8dcfedc","expected_explanation":"A．反应①标为快反应，反应③标为慢反应；其他条件相近时，活化能越小反应越快，所以反应①的活化能小于反应③，A正确。\nB．反应②达到平衡时，k正c(CO)c(Cl·)＝k逆c(COCl·)，所以K＝c(COCl·)/[c(CO)·c(Cl·)]＝k正/k逆，B正确。\nC．多步反应的总速率由慢反应决定，反应③是慢反应，因此提高反应③的速率是提高COCl₂合成速率的关键，C正确。\nD．催化剂能加快正、逆反应速率，但不改变平衡位置，所以COCl₂的平衡产率不变，D错误。\n故选D。","expected_stem":"Burns 和Dainton 研究发现Cl2与CO 合成COCl2的反应机理\n如下：①Cl2(g)\n2Cl·(g)快；②CO(g)＋Cl·(g)\nCOCl·(g)快；③COCl·(g)＋\nCl2(g)\nCOCl2(g)＋Cl·(g)慢。其中反应②存在v 正＝k 正c(CO)c(Cl·)、v 逆＝k 逆\nc(COCl·)。下列说法错误的是(\n)\nA.反应①的活化能小于反应③的活化能\nB.反应②的平衡常数K＝k 正\nk 逆\nC.要提高合成COCl2 的速率，关键是提高反应③的速率\nD.选择合适的催化剂能加快该反应的速率，并提高COCl2 的平衡产率","expected_options":["反应①的活化能小于反应③的活化能","反应②的平衡常数K＝k 正 k 逆","要提高合成COCl2 的速率，关键是提高反应③的速率","选择合适的催化剂能加快该反应的速率，并提高COCl2 的平衡产率"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"1d877e58882c13d0fb8c0b68f36cda8af97549f5f96230d3fb0143d1a4fae778","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/a9e45f68b95d85be/7b8ece4379f24c74857ebc6871376bf2/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题10原题题面","sha256":"0487d4136f1ad016849ec31f4fa27b3411a7ba7bd05ea5a61a73c14535cb5828","width":1055,"height":433},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/a9e45f68b95d85be/7b8ece4379f24c74857ebc6871376bf2/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题10原题解析","sha256":"1823dbb9d356af858c9d901ce90631b67a13cd31aa8fae230cd8fdcf85fd0fa1","width":1055,"height":380}],"question_asset_sha256":"0487d4136f1ad016849ec31f4fa27b3411a7ba7bd05ea5a61a73c14535cb5828","analysis_asset_sha256":"1823dbb9d356af858c9d901ce90631b67a13cd31aa8fae230cd8fdcf85fd0fa1","expected_revision_token":"d1c0c43e58a7f2b037ec5e7818e47eddef265f6e21dc656779a6bfa39cf99b32","expected_item_sha256":"1faed2b179896f6e36b0b913297dc02b53ebf7e7690176abb673ed546d0a11c4","source_pdf_sha256":"252c9819e96ecc99f30377f7b243d74742bcf302abad48f42f1a891233289354","question_png_sha256":"3361b7ccd310358aade691afb2fcec39e1dbcb210c29383c8e089a5a55541e5a","analysis_png_sha256":"74a0dd65190c