与H⁺结合生成HCO₃⁻时放热，ΔH₁＜0；CO₃²⁻水解是吸热过程，ΔH₂＞0，所以“ΔH₁＜0、ΔH₂＜0”错误，A错误。\nB．ΔH₁为负值，ΔH₂为正值，所以ΔH₁＜ΔH₂，B正确。\nC．强酸强碱中和放热，ΔH₃＜0；CH₃COOH与OH⁻反应也放热，ΔH₄＜0，不是ΔH₄＞0，C错误。\nD．醋酸电离吸热，使反应④放出的热量少于强酸强碱中和；二者ΔH均为负值，所以ΔH₃＜ΔH₄，不是ΔH₃＞ΔH₄，D错误。\n故选B。","expected_stem":"关于下列ΔH 的判断正确的是（\n）\nCO2－\n3 （aq）＋H\n＋（aq）===HCO\n－\n3 （aq）\nΔH1\nCO2－\n3 （aq）＋H2O（l）\nHCO\n－\n3 （aq）＋OH\n－（aq）\nΔH2\nOH\n－（aq）＋H\n＋（aq）===H2O（l）\nΔH3\nOH\n－（aq）＋CH3COOH（aq）===CH3COO\n－（aq）＋H2O（l）\nΔH4\nA.ΔH1<0\nΔH2<0\nB.ΔH1<ΔH2\nC.ΔH3<0\nΔH4>0\nD.ΔH3>ΔH4","expected_options":["ΔH1<0 ΔH2<0","ΔH1<ΔH2","ΔH3<0 ΔH4>0","ΔH3>ΔH4"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"b1fbe0344b6970b6fff1f43034744c00b9df2fe823b3e41d68dcd1260911d337","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/a47c2a2ea37baff7/95e7b34d29b2dc319b1d1c92560e9821/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题（2020·浙江7 月选考）关于下列ΔH 的判断原题题面","sha256":"56193511bb830a285c63e81552eac44df353155824df9cca944149eb4725b95b","width":1055,"height":428},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/a47c2a2ea37baff7/95e7b34d29b2dc319b1d1c92560e9821/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题（2020·浙江7 月选考）关于下列ΔH 的判断原题解析","sha256":"a82a8c95ee1a28c0dac213da7a4f7f84f0ad67b2f864f2a249c2d6631c44f1aa","width":1055,"height":917}],"question_asset_sha256":"56193511bb830a285c63e81552eac44df353155824df9cca944149eb4725b95b","analysis_asset_sha256":"a82a8c95ee1a28c0dac213da7a4f7f84f0ad67b2f864f2a249c2d6631c44f1aa","expected_revision_token":"c510db560d18a10457154172357bea440c88ec02169b173e40f838e39efe71d6","expected_item_sha256":"44a532fb079628f3166af8def715268beaea8975ee2e338ae2e451ef363229cb","source_pdf_sha256":"43bd8beda5969e085fedf91c74c77d7f6cb48851e1a1092a2019f71054d37ef5","question_png_sha256":"6881ab6ff7398d81982e099bb6a202f54d453d1f1975060e3d724600b267ba54","analysis_png_sha256":"9978e52e8a1c8f4ac49e5f532c4713f43dd6aff124bc155cefdb9591f31bbc73"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_THERMO-b65eca10e258dfd5","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_THER