得c(HFeO₄⁻)/c(H₂FeO₄)＝4.8，不是1.2，A错误。\nB．图中pH≥9时含铁微粒几乎全部为FeO₄²⁻，所以要获得尽可能纯的高铁酸盐，应控制pH≥9，B正确。\nC．pH＝5时主要微粒为HFeO₄⁻，加入KOH发生HFeO₄⁻＋OH⁻＝FeO₄²⁻＋H₂O，C正确。\nD．由图读出pH＝2时主要含铁微粒浓度大小为c(H₂FeO₄)＞c(H₃FeO₄⁺)＞c(HFeO₄⁻)，D正确。\n故选A。","expected_stem":"高铁酸盐在水溶液中有四种含铁型体，25 ℃时，它们的物质的量分数随pH 的\n变化如图所示。下列叙述错误的是(\n)\n－8，\nA.已知H3FeO\n＋\n4 的电离常数分别为K1＝2.5×10\n－2，K2＝4.8×10\n－4，K3＝5.0×10\n当pH＝4 时，溶液中c（HFeO\n＝1.2\n－\n4 ）\nc（H2FeO4）\nB.为获得尽可能纯净的高铁酸盐，应控制pH≥9\n－\n4 ＋\nC.向pH＝5 的高铁酸盐溶液中加入KOH溶液，发生反应的离子方程式为HFeO\nOH\n－===FeO2－\n4 ＋H2O\nD.pH ＝2\n时，溶液中主要含铁型体浓度的大小关系为\nc(H2FeO4)>c(H3FeO\n＋\n4 )>c(HFeO\n－\n4 )","expected_options":["已知H3FeO ＋ 4 的电离常数分别为K1＝2.5×10 －2，K2＝4.8×10 －4，K3＝5.0×10 当pH＝4 时，溶液中c（HFeO ＝1.2 － 4 ） c（H2FeO4）","为获得尽可能纯净的高铁酸盐，应控制pH≥9 － 4 ＋","向pH＝5 的高铁酸盐溶液中加入KOH溶液，发生反应的离子方程式为HFeO OH －===FeO2－ 4 ＋H2O","pH ＝2 时，溶液中主要含铁型体浓度的大小关系为 c(H2FeO4)>c(H3FeO ＋ 4 )>c(HFeO － 4 )"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"dba7e3b57783efe2e188ce5cee1a744b904582d5a51e620b2a20e5c90c321070","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/88594c03c81fc3d0/c6e614bb4931a09bc05178603f558cc6/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题7原题题面","sha256":"a77cc4f654bf44040b98b478faa730852363665b484dc21915826219bd80d424","width":1055,"height":695},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/88594c03c81fc3d0/c6e614bb4931a09bc05178603f558cc6/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题7原题解析","sha256":"0023c3831f4986358c60b10fb0343efe38d48f70567f53169b0a01942101e84a","width":1055,"height":526}],"question_asset_sha256":"a77cc4f654bf44040b98b478faa730852363665b484dc21915826219bd80d424","analysis_asset_sha256":"0023c3831f4986358c60b10fb0343efe38d48f70567f53169b0a01942101e84a","expected_revision_token":"94b3a85a483e0d8a8e9b816413e134792465672822b2f7e044b3ef516be70ebc","expected_item_sha256":"6581feff13c763d0fc0efb3ff672048a3a94e80b86730b4d91490d7c53b036ea","source_pdf_sha256":"1f43e3800520493d33ea368192d9402e19135115e6ba17639826216f81595943","question_png_sha256":"3072d766b6906a9edaff4c32823103f2300d828315f7e000c4c328681d7d46d2","analysis_png_sha256":"176f61d4ec96f3c0c303cda00168814db1211fc5d150cb58771e8108c34e4e65"},{"source_manifest_id":"H2_WEAK-329341f3007268aa","canonical_source_id":"--:H2_WEAK-329341f3007268aa","grade_band":"高二","skill_id":"H2_WEAK","old_question_id":"QH2O_43F0DEDFBC5C73F9_8FE0AFE3932F5454_R761DC1B48D41","new_question_id":"QH2O_43F0DEDFBC5C73F9_D97878C714444522_R245BE48B2999","correct_option":0,"baseline_explanation_sha256":"b8c803cac78cfb5b8f275d939f089b3908f9b2873f74bcf3d02e574f12044e11","expected_explanation_sha256":"db7f38f9f919f576ed60189ae6152ed8d049c7a47813526b07d3fae0d68b1d67","expected_explanation":"A．Kₐ₁(H₂A)＝4.0×10⁻⁴＞Kₐ(HB)＝2.0×10⁻⁵，相同浓度时H₂A电离程度更大、c(H⁺)更大，所以pH(H₂A)＜pH(HB)，A正确。\nB．升高Na₂A溶液温度会促进A²⁻水解，c(A²⁻)减小而c(Na⁺)不变，所以c(Na⁺)/c(A²⁻)增大，不是减小，B错误。\nC．由电离常数可得酸性H₂A＞HB＞HA⁻，HB不能从NaHA中制得更强的酸H₂A，C错误。\nD．酸性HB＞HA⁻，对应的B⁻比A²⁻碱性弱；相同浓度下Na₂A碱性强于NaB，不是Na₂A＜NaB，D错误。\n故选A。","expected_stem":"已知25 ℃时，H2A 的Ka1＝4.0×10\n－4、Ka2＝5.0×10\n－11，HB 的Ka＝2.0×10\n下列说法正确的是(\n)\nA.相同浓度H2A 溶液的pH 小于HB\n减小\nB.升高Na2A 溶液的温度，c（Na\n＋）\nc（A2－）\nC.HB 能与NaHA 溶液反应生成H2A\nD.相同浓度溶液的碱性：Na2A<NaB","expected_options":["相同浓度H2A 溶液的pH 小于HB 减小","升高Na2A 溶液的温度，c（Na ＋） c（A2－）","HB 能与NaHA 溶液反应生成H2A","相同浓度溶液的碱性：Na2A<NaB"],"expected_content_fingerprint":"476eaa51e675fc14c06be08e7e283fe06db9ce8d159c69906ed56859a1b07ed7","audit_status":"FAIL","segment_mode":"ABCD","required_markers":["A","B","C","D"],"new_asset_refs":[{"kind":"question_image","path":"h2orig/43f0dedfbc5c73f9/3d75f4505da0e5fc1febc826a7881f64/question/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题6原题题面","sha256":"cc8f00f5e9ebaa200ad0a3937e4798fdf0219df9e0b5ae24302a34d32d28344f","width":1055,"height":334},{"kind":"analysis_image","path":"h2orig/43f0dedfbc5c73f9/3d75f4505da0e5fc1febc826a7881f64/analysis/r245be48b2999","alt":"苏教版高中化学原题6原题解析","sha256":"ee22420a80c67c81565181d1efa966649fd4282c234915cbd98de1db16a16a83","width":1055,"height":414}],"question_asset_sha256":"cc8f00f5e9ebaa200ad0a3937e4798fdf0219df9e0b5ae2430